    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRight in front of where you start accept |cffffd100Dwarven Outfitters|r\nA\t\t179\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t29.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo south around |cffbbbbbb(28, 73)|r and kill |cff00ff25Wolves|r for the |cfffca742[Tough Wolf Meat]|r\nT\t\t179\t\nA\tRogue\t3109\t\nA\t\t233\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTo your left accept |cffffd100A New Threat|r\nA\t\t170\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t26.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(30, 74)|r kill |cff00ff25Burly Troggs|r and at |cffbbbbbb(26, 72)|r there is a camp of |cff00ff25Rockjaw Troggs|r, kill them for |cffffd100A New Threat|r\nC\t\t170\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(29, 71)|r and turn in |cffffd100A New Threat|r you should be level 3 now\nT\t\t170\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to Anvilmar and turn in your classes skill npc quest which...\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Anvilmar at |cffbbbbbb(28, 69)|r and turn in your classes skill npc quest which was Encrypted Rune for a rogue\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t3361\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t22.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road south to |cffbbbbbb(22, 71)|r and turn in |cffffd100Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery pt.2|r and |cffffd100The Boar Hunter|r\nT\t\t233\t\nA\t\t234\t\nA\t\t183\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust behind him start killing |cff00ff25Small Crag Boar|r until you have 12 for |cffffd100The Boar Hunter|r then go back to |cffbbbbbb(22, 71)|r and turn it in\nC\t\t183\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t183\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t20.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(20, 76)|r clear the front of the tent and grab |cfffca742Felix's Box|r for |cffffd100A Refugee's Quandary|r\nC\t\t3361\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t22.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(22, 80)|r clear in front of the tent and grab |cfffca742Felix's Chest|r for |cffffd100A Refugee's Quandary|r\nC\t\t3361\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t25.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to |cffbbbbbb(25, 75)|r (it’s the end of the road on the map) and turn in |cffffd100Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery pt.2|r and accept |cffffd100The Troll Cave|r\nT\t\t234\t\nA\t\t182\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t26.0\t79.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(26, 79)|r clear in front of the cave and grab |cfffca742Felix's Bucket of Bolts|r for |cffffd100A Refugee's Quandary|r then kill the |cff00ff25Frostmane Troll Whelp|r in and out of it until you complete |cffffd100The Troll Cave|r\nC\t\t3361\t\t\nC\t\t182\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t25.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back up to |cffbbbbbb(25, 75)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Troll Cave|r accept |cffffd100The Stolen Journal|r you should be level 5 or very close to it now.\nT\t\t182\t\nA\t\t218\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t30.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(26, 79)|r and go left at the 3 directions to |cffbbbbbb(30, 80)|r and kill |cff00ff25Grik'nir the Cold|r for |cffffd100The Stolen Journal|r\nC\t\t218\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t25.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tReturn back to |cffbbbbbb(25, 75)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Stolen Journal|r accept |cffffd100Senir's Observations pt.1|r\nT\t\t218\t\nA\t\t282\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn around and accept |cffffd100Scalding Mornbrew Delivery|r and hearth.\nA\t\t3364\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t28.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up into Anvilmar at |cffbbbbbb(28, 69)|r and turn in |cffffd100A Refugee's Quandary|r.\nT\t\t3361\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo further back and turn in |cffffd100Scalding Mornbrew Delivery|r accept |cffffd100Bring Back the Mug|r.\nT\t\t3364\t\nA\t\t3365\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get training before you leave\nI\t\tGet training before you leave.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t25.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun right to |cffbbbbbb(25, 75)|r, everything is yellow so nothing will attack you, and turn in |cffffd100Bring Back the Mug|r.\nT\t\t3365\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t33.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead toward the tunnel and turn in |cffffd100Senir's Observations pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(33, 7