    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go through the tunnel and kill all the mobs on the way\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t46.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo through the tunnel and kill all the mobs on the way. Follow the road to |cffbbbbbb(46, 53)|r in Kharanos and kill mobs until you’re level 6. Save your |cfffca742Boar Ribs|r and |cfffca742Boar Meat|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOnce at |cffbbbbbb(46, 53)|r turn in |cffffd100Senir's Observations pt.2|r\nT\t\t420\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tUp ahead on the right, in front of the Inn, accept |cffffd100Beer Basted Boar Ribs|r\nA\t\t384\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo inside the Inn and turn in |cffffd100Supplies to Tannok|r\nT\t\t2160\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the Innkeeper, make it your home and purchase a |cff00ff25Rhapsody Malt|r for |cffffd100Beer Basted Boar Ribs|r\nC\t\t384\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get new skills\nI\t\tGet new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo across the road from the Inn and accept |cffffd100Tools For Steelgrill|r\nA\t\t400\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t49.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t317\t\nA\t\t313\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the left house and turn in |cffffd100Tools For Steelgrill|r\nT\t\t400\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tBy the tree out front accept |cffffd100Ammo For Rumbleshot|r\nA\t\t5541\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t44.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the small camp at |cffbbbbbb(44, 56)|r and open the box for |cffffd100Ammo For Rumbleshot|r\nC\t\t5541\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFrom around this camp to the SW kill |cff00ff25Boars|r and |cff00ff25Bears|r until you finish |cffffd100Stocking Jetsteam|r and |cffffd100Beer Basted Boar Ribs|r\nC\t\t317\t\t\nC\t\t384\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you’re having trouble finding Boars, just go to there are a...\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t40.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you’re having trouble finding |cff00ff25Boars|r, just go to around |cffbbbbbb(40, 65)|r there are a lot.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t42.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the Grizzled Den at |cffbbbbbb(42, 54)|r and kill |cff00ff25Wendingos|r until you get 8 manes for |cffffd100The Grizzled Den|r\nC\t\t313\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t40.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou also want to head out to |cffbbbbbb(40, 65)|r and turn in |cffffd100Ammo For Rumbleshot|r watch the scene it’s cool, only if you aren’t time running. You should be level 7 or very close now\nT\t\t5541\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Kharanos\nI\t\tHearth back to Kharanos\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust outside the Inn, turn in |cffffd100Beer Basted Boar Ribs|r\nT\t\t384\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t45.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the house at |cffbbbbbb(45, 49)|r, NE of the Inn, and accept |cffffd100Operation Recombobulation|r\nA\t\t412\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t49.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t317\t\nA\t\t318\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t313\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be close to half way through level 7\nI\t\tYou should be close to half way through level 7\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t30.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t318\t\nA\t\t319\t\nA\t\t315\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tBeside him accept |cffffd100Bitter Rivals|r\nA\t\t310\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTo the North/NE from here you’ll find tons of |cff00ff25Bears|r, |cff00ff25Leopards|r, and |cff00ff25Boars|r to kill for |cffffd100A Favor For Evershine|r You should ding level 8 while killing for this.\nC\t\t319\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t41.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Frostmane Seer|r and open baskets at |cffbbbbbb(41, 44)|r and |cffbbbbbb(41, 35)|r for |cffffd100The Perfect Stout|r.\nC\t\t315\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die so you end up in Kharanos\nI\t\tDie so you end up in Kharanos\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNext to the GY accept |cffffd100Frostmane Hold|r\nA\t\t287\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into the Inn and buy a |cff00ff25Thunder Ale|r off the |cff00ff25Innkeeper|r and down in the basement, give the ale to |cff00ff25Jarven Thunderbrew|r. When he leaves touch the barrel to turn in |cffffd100Bitter Rivals|r accept |cffffd100Return to Marleth|r.\nT\t\t310\t\nA\t\t311\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get new skills\nI\t\tGet new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t30.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to Brewnall Village again at |cffbbbbbb(30, 45)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Perfect Stout|r and |cffffd100A Favor For Evershine|r accept |cffffd100Return to Bellowfiz|r and |cffffd100Shimmer Stout|r.\nT\t\t315\t\nT\t\t319\t\nA\t\t320\t\nA\t\t413\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNext to him turn in |cffffd100Return to Marleth|r you should be past half way to level 9 now\nT\t\t311\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo west of Brewnall and kill |cff00ff25Leper Gnomes|r until you complete |cffffd100Operation Recombobulation|r you should hit level 9 getting kills\nC\t\t412\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t24.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(24, 50)|r and enter the cave kill 5 headhunters and explore the cave for |cffffd100Frostmane Hold|r To explore it just run in and stay to the right, it will curve left and you can see a raised platform with mobs, get near it to complete exploration\nC\t\t287\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die so you end up at Kharanos\nI\t\tDie so you end up at Kharanos\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tEither straight down the steps of the Inn, or north of the GY, turn in |cffffd100Frostmane Hold|r accept |cffffd100The Reports|r\nT\t\t287\t\nA\t\t291\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t45.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo NW in the house at |cffbbbbbb(45, 49)|r and turn in |cffffd100Operation Recombobulation|r\nT\t\t412\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo east to |cffbbbbbb(49, 48)|r and turn in |cffffd100Return to Bellowfiz|r you should be half way to level 10 now\nT\t\t320\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go North to IF\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t53.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo North to IF at |cffbbbbbb(53, 35)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make IF your home\nG\t\tIronforge\t21.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tMake IF your home at |cffbbbbbb(21, 55)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t39.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(39, 56)|r in IF, behind the bank, in the kings room, turn in |cffffd100The Reports|r\nT\t\t291\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Enter the tram\nG\t\tIronforge\t76.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the tram at |cffbbbbbb(76, 51)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Take the tram down to SW\nI\t\tTake the tram down to SW\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and get the FP\nG\t\tStormwind City\t66.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(66, 62)|r and get the FP.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Reach goldshire and enter the Inn\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t42.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tReach goldshire and enter the Inn at |cffbbbbbb(42, 65)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust to your left accept |cffffd100Kobold Candles|r\nA\t\t60\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tExit the Inn and go straight out and accept |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r\nA\t\t62\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn the blacksmith house right here accept |cffffd100Elmore's Task|r\nA\t\t1097\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t42.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo near the carts at |cffbbbbbb(42, 67)|r and accept |cffffd100Gold Dust Exchange|r\nA\t\t47\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t39.0\t82.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo south to the Fargodeep Mine at |cffbbbbbb(39, 82)|r and kill |cff00ff25Kobold|r until you complete all 3 quests |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r, |cffffd100Gold Dust Exchange|r, and |cffffd100Kobold Candles|r Make sure you go in the lower entrance so |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r is easier\nC\t\t62\t\t\nC\t\t47\t\t\nC\t\t60\t\t\nC\t\t62\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce all 3 are done go to the Stonefield Farm just up the hill east at |cffbbbbbb(34, 84)|r and accept |cffffd100Lost Necklace|r SKIP SKIPPrincess Must Die!\nA\t\t85\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to the Maclure Vinyard st |cffbbbbbb(43, 85)|r and turn in |cffffd100Lost Necklace|r accept |cffffd100Pie For Billy|r turn around and kill |cff00ff25Boars|r until it’s finished\nT\t\t85\t\nA\t\t86\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t106\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back west to |cffbbbbbb(34, 84)|r and turn in |cffffd100Pie For Billy|r SKIP |cffff6060Back to Billy|r\nT\t\t86\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t29.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to the river at |cffbbbbbb(29, 85)|r and turn in |cffffd100Young Lovers|r accept |cffffd100Speak with Gramma|r\nT\t\t106\t\nA\t\t111\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(34, 84)|r and turn in |cffffd100Speak with Gramma|r in the house, accept |cffffd100Note to William|r You should be level 10 now\nT\t\t111\t\nA\t\t107\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go back to Goldshire, either die or run\nI\t\tGo back to Goldshire, either die or run\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t63.0\t10.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the tram again at |cffbbbbbb(63, 10)|r accept |cffffd100Deeprun Rat Roundup|r just collect 5 rats and turn it in. You could skip this and keep the flute, It can really piss people off if you play it non stop around the IF bank. SKIP |cffff6060Me Brother, Nipsy|r unless you go back to SW on the tram because you get crap xp\nA\t\t6661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=After this you should be a bit over half way to level 11\nI\t\tAfter this you should be a bit over half way to level 11\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t68.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t433\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo behind him and accept |cffffd100Those Blasted Troggs!|r\nA\t\t432\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go in the pit below and kill Troggs here and in the cave for...\nI\t\tGo in the pit below and kill |cff00ff25Troggs|r here and in the cave for both quests turn them back in at |cffbbbbbb(68, 55)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go east and follow the path into Loch Modan\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t80.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to |cffbbbbbb(80, 51)|r and follow the path into Loch Modan\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t22.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t224\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up in the bunker and accept |cffffd100The Trogg Threat|r\nA\t\t267\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=At grab the FP\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t33.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(33, 50)|r grab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tLook for |cff00ff25Mountaineer Kadrell|r and accept |cffffd100Rat Catching|r\nA\t\t416\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t27.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Troggs|r from |cffbbbbbb(27, 53)|r and north for |cffffd100In Defense of the King's Lands|r and |cffffd100The Trogg Threat|r\nC\t\t224\t\t\nC\t\t267\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go back and turn them both in\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t22.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(22, 73)|r and turn them both in\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t24.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo north to the bunker at |cffbbbbbb(24, 18)|r and turn in |cffffd100Stormpike's Delivery|r\nT\t\t353\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be level 12 now or close to it\nI\t\tYou should be level 12 now or close to it. You can grind if you’d like. Follow the Night Elf to IF guide but just go backwards. You’re going to go north through the wetlands to menethil take the boat to auberdine from here." },
  { name = "1-10 Elwynn Forest (Alliance)", title = "1-10 Elwynn Forest", group = "VanillaGuide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 1, hi = 10, next = "10-12 Westfall and Loch Modan (Alliance)", defaultFor = "Human", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t783\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the building and turn in |cffffd100A Threat Within|r\nT\t\t783\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t7\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back out, and turn in Welcome! at the wagons\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t47.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back out, and turn in |cffffd100Welcome!|r at the wagons at |cffbbbbbb(47, 41)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t48.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the nook at the NorthWest corner of the building at |cffbbbbbb(48, 40)|r and accept |cffffd100Wolves Across the Border|r.\nA\t\t33\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t47.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Wolves|r in front of you for |cffffd100Wolves Across the Border|r, while working your way to the |cff00ff25Kobold Vermin|r at |cffbbbbbb(47, 35)|r for |cffffd100Kobold Camp Cleanup|r.\nC\t\t33\t\t\nC\t\t7\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t48.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t33\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t48.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun into the house at |cffbbbbbb(48, 41)|r and turn in |cffffd100Kobold Camp Cleanup|r, accept |cffffd100Simple Letter|r and |cffffd100Investigate Echo Ridge|r.\nT\t\t7\t\nA\tWarrior\t3100\t\nA\t\t15\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t50.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to your class trainer and turn in |cffffd100Simple Letter|r and get new skills.\nT\tWarrior\t3100\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tExit the house and accept |cffffd100Brotherhood of Thieves|r.\nA\t\t18\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t47.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo NorthWest toward the cave at |cffbbbbbb(47, 32)|r, and kill |cff00ff25Kobold Workers|r on the way for |cffffd100Investigate Echo Ridge|r.\nC\t\t15\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t54.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo West to |cffbbbbbb(54, 40)|r and go south killing |cff00ff25Defias|r for |cffffd100Brotherhood of Thieves|r, you should be level 4 by the time you’re done, if not grind until you are.\nC\t\t18\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t48.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back to the abbey at |cffbbbbbb(48, 42)|r and turn in |cffffd100Brotherhood of Thieves|r, accept |cffffd100Milly Osworth|r and |cffffd100Bounty on Garrick Padfoot|r.\nT\t\t18\t\nA\t\t3903\t\nA\t\t6\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo inside the house and turn in |cffffd100Investigate Echo Ridge|r, accept |cffffd100Skirmish at Echo Ridge|r get new skills.\nT\t\t15\t\nA\t\t21\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t50.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo North of the house at |cffbbbbbb(50, 39)|r next to the barn, turn in |cffffd100Milly Osworth|r, accept |cffffd100Milly's Harvest|r.\nT\t\t3903\t\nA\t\t3904\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t57.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back East and grab the |cfffca742grapes|r in the garden at |cffbbbbbb(54, 48)|r for |cffffd100Milly's Harvest|r then NorthEast to |cffbbbbbb(57, 48)|r you’ll see a shack with |cff00ff25Garrick Padfoot|r. Kill him for |cffffd100Bounty on Garrick Padfoot|r.\nC\t\t3904\t\t\nC\t\t6\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t50.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3904\t\nA\t\t3905\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t47.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the cave at |cffbbbbbb(47, 31)|r and kill |cff00ff25Kobold Laborer|r for |cffffd100Skirmish at Echo Ridge|r.\nC\t\t21\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to the Abbey\nI\t\tHearth back to the Abbey.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t6\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo inside the house, turn in |cffffd100Skirmish at Echo Ridge|r, accept |cffffd100Report to Goldshire|r.\nT\t\t21\t\nA\t\t54\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the top of the tower through the spiral staircase, turn in |cffffd100Grape Manifest|r.\nT\t\t3905\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t45.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t2158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you’re not level 6 you should be close, just grind on a few...\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t46.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you’re not level 6 you should be close, just grind on a few mobs while you head towards the house near Goldshire at |cffbbbbbb(46, 62)|r and pick up skinning if you want it.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t42.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Inn at |cffbbbbbb(42, 65)|r, accept |cffffd100Kobold Candles|r, turn in |cffffd100Rest and Relaxation|r and make Goldshire your home.\nA\t\t60\t\nT\t\t2158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tExit the Inn, turn in |cffffd100Report to Goldshire|r, accept |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r.\nT\t\t54\t\nA\t\t62\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Find your trainer and buy new skills\nI\t\tFind your trainer and buy new skills.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t42.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo near the carts at |cffbbbbbb(42, 67)|r and accept |cffffd100Gold Dust Exchange|r\nA\t\t47\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t39.0\t82.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo South to the Fargodeep Mine at |cffbbbbbb(39, 82)|r and kill the |cff00ff25Kobold|r until you complete all 3 quests |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r, |cffffd100Gold Dust Exchange|r, and |cffffd100QUEATKobold Candles|r. Use the lower enterance, as it is easier.\nC\t\t62\t\t\nC\t\t47\t\t\nC\t\t60\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce all 3 are done go to the Stonefield Farm just up the hill East at |cffbbbbbb(34, 84)|r and accept |cffffd100Lost Necklace|r SKIP SKIPPrincess Must Die! if you cannot fight 3 mobs at a time.\nA\t\t85\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t90.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to the Maclure Vinyard at |cffbbbbbb(43, 90)|r and accept |cffffd100Young Lovers|r\nA\t\t106\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill boars until it’s finished.\nT\t\t85\t\nA\t\t86\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t86\t\nA\t\t84\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t30.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo West to the river at |cffbbbbbb(30, 86)|r, and turn in |cffffd100Young Lovers|r, accept |cffffd100Speak with Gramma.|r\nT\t\t106\t\nA\t\t111\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t111\t\nA\t\t107\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t84\t\nA\t\t87\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t41.0\t78.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the bottom entrance of the Fargodeep Mine at |cffbbbbbb(39, 82)|r and to about |cffbbbbbb(41, 78)|r, kill |cff00ff25Goldtooth|r for |cffffd100Goldtooth|r. You should ding level 7 during this quest.\nC\t\t87\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Goldshire\nI\t\tHearth back to Goldshire.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn the Inn turn in |cffffd100Kobold Candles|r, accept |cffffd100Shipment to Stormwind|r also turn in |cffffd100Note to William|r, accept |cffffd100Collecting Kelp|r.\nT\t\t60\t\nA\t\t61\t\nT\t\t107\t\nA\t\t112\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tStraight outside the Inn, turn in |cffffd100The Fargodeep Mine|r accept |cffffd100The Jasperlode Mine|r.\nT\t\t62\t\nA\t\t76\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tSouth near the fence, turn in |cffffd100Gold Dust Exchange|r You should have dinged level 7 now, accept |cffffd100A Fishy Peril|r, accept |cffffd100Further Concerns|r by the blacksmith.\nT\t\t47\t\nA\t\t40\t\nA\t\t35\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t51.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Murlocs|r around the lake at |cffbbbbbb(51, 65)|r for |cffffd100Collecting Kelp|r.\nC\t\t112\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t60.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind up to the Jasperlode Mine at |cffbbbbbb(61, 53)|r and run through it about half way to |cffbbbbbb(60, 50)|r for |cffffd100The Jasperlode Mine|r.\nC\t\t76\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t74.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to the bridge at |cffbbbbbb(74, 72)|r and turn in |cffffd100Further Concerns|r, accept |cffffd100Find the Lost Guards|r and |cffffd100Protect the Frontier|r.\nT\t\t35\t\nA\t\t37\t\nA\t\t52\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t79.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at the house at |cffbbbbbb(79, 69)|r and accept |cffffd100Red Linen Goods|r.\nA\t\t83\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t81.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt the center of the camp, |cffbbbbbb(81, 66)|r, accept |cffffd100A Bundle of Trouble|r.\nA\t\t5545\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t73.0\t60.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun just West of the waterfall at |cffbbbbbb(73, 60)|r touch the |cfffca742Mangled Body|r, and turn in |cffffd100Find the Lost Guards|r, accept |cffffd100Discover Rolf’s Fate|r You should now be level 8, if not grind until you are.\nT\t\t37\t\nA\t\t45\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t80.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the Murloc camp at |cffbbbbbb(80, 56)|r and loot the |cfffca742Mangled Body|r there, and turn in |cffffd100Discover Rolf’s Fate|r, accept |cffffd100Report to Thomas|r.\nT\t\t45\t\nA\t\t71\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t81.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t5545\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tCross the road and go south and east and finish killing the |cff00ff25Bears|r and |cff00ff25Wolves|r for |cffffd100Protect the Frontier|r.\nC\t\t52\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t74.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(74, 72)|r near the bridge and turn in |cffffd100Protect the Frontier|r and |cffffd100Report to Thomas|r, accept |cffffd100Deliver Thomas' Report|r.\nT\t\t52\t\nT\t\t71\t\nA\t\t39\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t69.0\t78.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to the pumpkin patch at |cffbbbbbb(69, 78)|r and kill |cff00ff25Defias|r for |cffffd100Red Linen Goods|r.\nC\t\t83\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You might find Westfall Deed, for the quest Furlbrow's Deed...\nI\t\tYou might find |cfffca742[Westfall Deed]|r, for the quest |cff00ff25Furlbrow's Deed|r while you’re killing |cff00ff25Defias|r. Just hold it for now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t79.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(79, 69)|r and turn in |cffffd100Red Linen Goods|r, it should make you level 9 or bring you really close.\nT\t\t83\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t74.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at the bridge again at |cffbbbbbb(74, 72)|r and accept |cffffd100Report to Gryan Stoutmantle|r, must be level 9 to accept.\nA\t\t109\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Goldshire\nI\t\tHearth to Goldshire\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Collecting Kelp|r accept |cffffd100The Escape|r, |cffffd100The Jasperlode Mine|r and |cffffd100Deliver Thomas' Report|r SKIP SKIPCloth and Leather Armor accept |cffffd100Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!|r. Accept |cffffd100Elmore's Task|r at the blacksmith.\nT\t\t112\t\nA\t\t114\t\nT\t\t76\t\nT\t\t39\t\nA\t\t239\t\nA\t\t1097\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t43.0\t89.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun South to the Maclure Vinyard at |cffbbbbbb(43, 89)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Escape|r.\nT\t\t114\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t34.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun West to the Stonefield Farm at |cffbbbbbb(34, 84)|r and turn in |cffffd100Goldtooth|r.\nT\t\t87\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t24.0\t74.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo NorthWest to |cffbbbbbb(24, 74)|r and turn in |cffffd100Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!|r, accept |cffffd100Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty|r and |cffffd100Hogger!|r from the |cfffca742Wanted! sign|r.\nT\t\t239\t\nA\t\t11\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo just South of the road and start killing |cff00ff25Gnolls|r for |cffffd100Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty|r they can also drop a |cfffca742Gold Schedule|r which starts a quest.\nC\t\t11\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t24.0\t74.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t11\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be very close to level 10 now, follow the road west...\nI\t\tYou should be very close to level 10 now, follow the road west into Westfall." },
  { name = "10-12 Westfall and Loch Modan (Alliance)", title = "10-12 Westfall and Loch Modan", group = "VanillaGuide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 10, hi = 12, next = "12-14 Darkshore (Alliance)", defaultFor = "Human", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t60.0\t19.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(60, 19)|r and turn in |cffffd100Furlbrow’s Deed|r if you found |cfffca742[Westfall Deed]|r.\nT\t\t184\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Westfall Stew|r SKIP SKIPPoor Old Blanchy.\nA\t\t36\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.0\t30.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the house at |cffbbbbbb(56, 30)|r and turn in |cffffd100Westfall Stew|r.\nT\t\t36\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t109\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the tower and accept |cffffd100A Swift Message|r.\nA\t\t6181\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet the flightpath at |cffbbbbbb(56, 53)|r and turn in |cffffd100A Swift Message|r accept |cffffd100Continue to Stormwind|r.\nT\t\t6181\t\nA\t\t6281\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Stormwin\nI\t\tFly to Stormwin. If you did |cff00ff25Hogger|r hearth to Goldshire instead, and turn it in outside the Inn.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t56.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIn Stormwind go to |cffbbbbbb(56, 66)|r and turn in |cffffd100Shipment to Stormwind|r.\nT\t\t61\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Train new weapons\nG\t\tStormwind City\t57.0\t57.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTrain new weapons at |cffbbbbbb(57, 57)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t74.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t6281\t\nA\t\t6261\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t52.0\t12.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(52, 12)|r and turn in |cffffd100Elmore's Task|r accept |cffffd100Stormpike's Delivery|r this will be done on the way to the Wetlands.\nT\t\t1097\t\nA\t\t353\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t66.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(66, 62)|r and turn in |cffffd100Stormpike's Delivery|r accept |cffffd100|rReturn to Lewis then fly back to Westfall.\nT\t\t353\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestfall\t56.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the tower at |cffbbbbbb(56, 47)|r and turn in |cffffd100Return to Lewis|r.\nT\t\t6285\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly back to Stormwind\nG\t\tStormwind City\t74.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Stormwind.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go into the tram and take it to Ironforge\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the tram at |cffbbbbbb(64, 08)|r and take it to Ironforge.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOnce it stops accept |cffffd100Deeprun Rat Roundup|r just collect 5 rats and turn it in. You could skip this and keep the flute, It can really piss people off if you play it non stop around the IF bank. SKIP |cffff6060Me Brother, Nipsy|r.\nA\t\t6661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grab the flightpath\nG\t\tIronforge\t55.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrab the flightpath at |cffbbbbbb(55, 47)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Leave Ironforge and head into Dun Morogh\nI\t\tLeave Ironforge and head into Dun Morogh.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t69.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t433\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo behind him and accept |cffffd100Those Blasted Troggs!|r\nA\t\t432\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go in the pit below and kill the Troggs here and in the cave...\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t69.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the pit below and kill the |cff00ff25Troggs|r here and in the cave for both quests turn them back in at |cffbbbbbb(69, 56)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go east and follow the path into Loch Modan\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t81.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to |cffbbbbbb(81, 53)|r and follow the path into Loch Modan.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t22.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo inside the bunker and accept |cffffd100The Trogg Threat|r.\nA\t\t224\t\nA\t\t267\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go grab the flightpath\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t34.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo grab the flightpath at |cffbbbbbb(34, 51)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t27.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Troggs|r from |cffbbbbbb(27, 53)|r and north for |cffffd100In Defense of the King's Lands|r and |cffffd100The Trogg Threat|r.\nC\t\t224\t\t\nC\t\t267\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go back and turn them both in\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t22.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(22, 73)|r and turn them both in.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t25.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo north to the bunker at |cffbbbbbb(25, 18)|r and turn in |cffffd100Stormpike's Delivery|r.\nT\t\t353\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be level 12 now or close to it\nI\t\tYou should be level 12 now or close to it. You can grind if you’d like.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Head and follow the mountainpath to Wetlands\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t25.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead to |cffbbbbbb(25, 11)|r and follow the mountainpath to Wetlands.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Follow the road to Menethil Harbor , get the flighpath get on...\nG\t\tWetlands\t25.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road to Menethil Harbor at |cffbbbbbb(11, 53)|r, get the flighpath get on the boat for Darkshore." },
