ff25Webwood Spider|r |cffbbbbbb(57, 32)|r. Get |cfffca742Webwood Egg|r for |cffffd100Webwood Egg|r at |cffbbbbbb(57, 26)|r inside the cave.\nC\t\t3521\t\t\nC\t\t917\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t58.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t917\t\nA\t\t920\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up the ramp to the top of the tree and turn in |cffffd100Tenaron's Summons|r at |cffbbbbbb(59, 39)|r\nT\t\t920\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t921\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t61.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3521\t\nA\t\t3522\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t54.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3522\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFill the |cfffca742[Crystal Phial]|r for |cffffd100Crown of the Earth pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(59, 32)|r\nC\t\t921\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t59.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back to the top of the tree at |cffbbbbbb(59, 39)|r, and turn in |cffffd100Crown of the Earth pt.1|r.\nT\t\t921\t\nA\t\t928\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you’re not level 6 yet, you should be close\nI\t\tIf you’re not level 6 yet, you should be close. Level and get skills." },
