    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t35.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet |cffffd100Washed Ashore pt.1|r from |cff00ff25|r next to the flightmaster, and |cffffd100For Love Eternal|r at the docks at |cffbbbbbb(35, 43)|r.\nA\t\t3524\t\nA\t\t963\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Be sure to pick up the flightpath aswell, unless you came from...\nI\t\tBe sure to pick up the flightpath aswell, unless you came from Teldrassil. Set Auberdine as your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Buzzbox 827|r upstairs in the Inn, |cffffd100Cave Mushrooms|r in front of the Inn and |cffffd100The Red Crystal|r near the bridge\nA\t\t983\t\nA\t\t947\t\nA\t\t4811\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t37.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy some 6 slot bags if you haven’t found 3 by now at |cffbbbbbb(37, 40)|r\nA\t\t954\t\nA\t\t958\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo south over the bridge, accept |cffffd100Plagued Lands|r and |cffffd100How Big a Threat? pt.1|r. Skip SKIPA Lost Master for now.\nA\t\t2118\t\nA\t\t984\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Washed Ashore pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(36, 50)|r grind from town to there to get |cfffca742[Crawler Legs]|r for |cffffd100Buzzbox 827|r.\nC\t\t3524\t\t\nC\t\t983\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t983\t\nA\t\t1001\t\nT\t\t3524\t\nA\t\t4681\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t32.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tSwim out and do |cffffd100Washed Ashore pt.2|r at |cffbbbbbb(32, 46)|r. Turn it in\nC\t\t4681\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4681\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t42.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Buzzbox 411|r by killing |cff00ff25Darkshore Threshers|r in the water. Turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(42, 29)|r and accept |cffffd100Buzzbox 323|r. You might have to grind a few mobs to hit lvl 13 to accept the quest.\nC\t\t1001\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t42\t29\t\t\t\nT\t\t1001\t\nA\t\t1002\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t42.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(42, 32)|r accept |cffffd100Beached Sea Creature|r.\nA\t\t4723\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t44.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Bashal'Aran pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(44, 36)|r grinding along the way, accept |cffffd100Bashal'Aran pt.2|r killing |cff00ff25Grells|r around him for |cfffca742[Grell Earring]|r.\nT\t\t954\t\nA\t\t955\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t44.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t955\t\nA\t\t956\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Bashal’Aran pt.3|r by killing |cff00ff25Deth'ryll Satyr|r and turn it in accept |cffffd100Bashal’Aran pt.4|r\nC\t\t956\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t956\t\nA\t\t957\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t47.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(47, 48)|r and do |cffffd100The Red Crystal|r\nC\t\t4811\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t40.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(40, 53)|r to find the camp for |cffffd100How Big a Threat? pt.1|r\nC\t\t984\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t40.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t953\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Fall of Ameth'Aran|r, |cffffd100Bashal’Aran pt.4|r, |cffffd100Tools of the Highborne|r and |cffffd100For Love Eternal|r in this area.\nC\t\t953\t\t\nC\t\t957\t\t\nC\t\t958\t\t\nC\t\t963\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t40.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t953\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo across the road of Amath’Aran, and do |cffffd100Plagued Lands|r.\nC\t\t2118\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Auberdine, turn in |cffffd100For Love Eternal|r, |cffffd100Beached Sea Creature|r, |cffffd100The Red Crystal|r, accept |cffffd100As Water Cascades|r\nT\t\t963\t\nT\t\t4723\t\nT\t\t4811\t\nA\t\t4812\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFill the |cfffca742[Empty Water Tube]|r in the Moonwell for |cffffd100As Water Cascades|r, turn in |cffffd100Plagued Lands|r, accept |cffffd100Cleansing the Infected|r, turn in |cffffd100How Big a Threat? pt.1|r accept |cffffd100How Big a Threat? Pt.2|r and |cffffd100Thundris Windweaver|r. Accept |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.1|r upstairs.\nC\t\t4812\t\t\nT\t\t2118\t\nA\t\t2138\t\nT\t\t984\t\nA\t\t985\t\nA\t\t4761\t\nA\t\t965\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the merchant house, turn in |cffffd100Tools of the Highborne|r and |cffffd100Thundris Windweaver|r, accept |cffffd100The Cliffspring River|r.\nT\t\t958\t\nT\t\t4761\t\nA\t\t4762\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tYou should be 14 by now, get skills in Darnassus and be sure to accept the quest |cffffd100Trouble In Darkshore|r from |cff00ff25Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker|r at |cffbbbbbb(23, 64)|r\nA\t\t730\t" },
  { name = "14-17 Darkshore (Alliance)", title = "14-17 Darkshore", group = "VanillaGuide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 14, hi = 17, next = "17-18 Loch Modan (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t44.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t957\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t50.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Moonstalkers|r and |cff00ff25Rabid Thistle Bears|r all around |cffbbbbbb(48, 30)|r, for |cffffd100Cleansing the Infected|r and |cffffd100Buzzbox 323|r, then head to |cffbbbbbb(50, 25)|r for |cffffd100The Cliffspring River|r.\nC\t\t2138\t\t\nC\t\t1002\t\t\nC\t\t4762\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t44.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4725\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t51.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1002\t\nA\t\t1003\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t55.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(55, 33)|r and do |cffffd100Cave Mushrooms|r.\nC\t\t947\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t47.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4812\t\nA\t\t4813\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t40.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(40, 53)|r and do |cffffd100How Big a Threat? Pt.2|r\nC\t\t985\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t37.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4725\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t36.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tContinue south and accept |cffffd100Beached Sea Creature|r at |cffbbbbbb(36, 70)|r.\nA\t\t4730\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t41.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Grizzled Thistle Bear|r south of Grove of the Ancients for |cffffd100Buzzbox 525|r then turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(41, 81)|r.\nC\t\t1003\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t41\t81\t\t\t\nT\t\t1003\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t32.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4730\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Auberdine, and turn in all the |cffffd100Beached Sea Creature|r quests.\nT\t\t4730\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t1138\t\nT\t\t947\t\nA\t\t948\t\nT\t\t4813\t\nT\t\t730\t\nA\t\t729\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4762\t\nA\t\t4763\t\nT\t\t2138\t\nA\t\t2139\t\nT\t\t985\t\nA\t\t986\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t50.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tPick up |cfffca742[Grains]|r for |cffffd100The Blackwood Corrupted|r at |cffbbbbbb(50, 35)|r.\nC\t\t4763\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t52.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Tharnariun's Hope|r at |cffbbbbbb(52, 37)|r.\nC\t\t2139\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t52.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet |cfffca742[Nuts]|r at |cffbbbbbb(52, 34)|r, and |cfffca742[Fruit]|r at |cffbbbbbb(52, 33)|r for |cffffd100The Blackwood Corrupted|r.\nC\t\t4763\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Clear around the bonfire and place the food\nG\t\tDarkshore\t52.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear around the bonfire at |cffbbbbbb(52, 33)|r and place the food. Kill |cff00ff25Xabraxxis|r, and loot the |cfffca742[Talisman]|r from the ground beside him..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t55.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(55, 25)|r turn in |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.1|r Accept |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.2|r, and do it by killing mobs outside the tower.\nT\t\t965\t\nA\t\t966\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t966\t\nA\t\t967\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t53.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4730\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Fruit of the Sea|r at the |cff00ff25Crawlers|r here.\nC\t\t1138\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Auberdine\nI\t\tHearth back to Auberdine.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4730\t\nT\t\t1138\t\nT\t\t4763\t\nT\t\t2139\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on boat to Menethil Harbor, the left/south pier\nI\t\tGet on boat to Menethil Harbor, the left/south pier.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you got flightpath to Thelsamar (Loch Modan), fly there, if...\nG\t\tWetlands\t54.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you got flightpath to Thelsamar (Loch Modan), fly there, if not, run to |cffbbbbbb(54, 73)|r, and follow the mountainpath to Loch Modan." },
  { name = "17-18 Loch Modan (Alliance)", title = "17-18 Loch Modan", group = "VanillaGuide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 17, hi = 18, next = "18-20 Redridge Mountains (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t24.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the Algaz Station bunker at |cffbbbbbb(24, 18)|r, and accept |cffffd100Filthy Paws|r and |cffffd100Stormpike's Order|r.\nA\t\t307\t\nA\t\t1338\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t35.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to the Cave at |cffbbbbbb(35, 18)|r and do |cffffd100Filthy Paws|r, |cfffca742[Miner's Gear]|r are looted from the ground. Turn it in back at the bunker.\nC\t\t307\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t307\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to Thelsamar , and get the flightpath if you don't have it\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t33.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Thelsamar at |cffbbbbbb(33, 50)|r, and get the flightpath if you don't have it. DO NOT make it your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t65.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Ironband's Excavation|r in the last house on the right, go turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(65, 67)|r, accept |cffffd100Gathering Idols|r and |cffffd100Excavation Progress Report|r.\nA\t\t436\t\nA\t\t297\t\nA\t\t298\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Gathering Idols|r in the Excavation site just west, then turn it back in.\nC\t\t297\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run around the excavation site, and get to the house\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t82.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun around the excavation site, and get to the house at |cffbbbbbb(82, 62)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn right when you enter, and accept |cffffd100Crocolisk Hunting|r\nA\t\t385\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the other side and accept |cffffd100A Hunter's Boast|r\nA\t\t257\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100A Hunter's Boast|r by killing |cff00ff25Mountain Buzzard|r in front of the house.\nC\t\t257\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t76.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Elder Mountain Boar|r at around |cffbbbbbb(76, 46)|r.\nT\t\t257\t\nA\t\t258\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t258\t\nA\t\t271\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t64.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(64, 48)|r and accept |cffffd100Bingles' Missing Supplies|r. Do |cffffd100Crocolisk Hunting|r here on the shore, and on the island at |cffbbbbbb(54, 38)|r if necessary.\nA\t\t2038\t\nC\t\t385\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t54.0\t27.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet all the parts for |cffffd100Bingles' Missing Supplies|r. |cfffca742[Blastencapper]|r at |cffbbbbbb(54, 27)|r, |cfffca742[Wrench]|r at |cffbbbbbb(49, 30)|r, |cfffca742[Hammer]|r at |cffbbbbbb(52, 24)|r, and |cfffca742[Screwdriver]|r at |cffbbbbbb(48, 21)|r.\nC\t\t2038\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t45.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccess the dam from the west side and accept |cffffd100A Dark Threat Looms pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(46, 14)|r\nA\t\t250\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun out the east entrance and turn in |cffffd100A Dark Threat Looms pt.1|r at the |cfffca742Suspicious Barrel|r\nT\t\t250\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t199\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t45.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back and turn in |cffffd100A Dark Threat Looms pt.2|r at |cffbbbbbb(46, 14)|r, SKIP SKIPA Dark Threat Looms pt.3.\nT\t\t199\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t37.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to Thelsamar and turn in |cffffd100Excavation Progress Report|r at |cffbbbbbb(37, 47)|r, accept |cffffd100Report to Ironforge|r.\nT\t\t298\t\nA\t\t301\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t38.0\t61.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(38, 61)|r and do |cffffd100Vyrin's Revenge pt.1|r.\nC\t\t271\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t83.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back to the house at |cffbbbbbb(83, 62)|r turn in |cffffd100Crocolisk Hunting|r and |cffffd100Vyrin's Revenge pt.1|r, accept |cffffd100Wyrin’s Revenge pt.2|r, and turn it in.\nT\t\t385\t\nT\t\t271\t\nA\t\t531\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t63.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t2038\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you got Ironforge flightpath, fly there, if not, run down...\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t22.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you got Ironforge flightpath, fly there, if not, run down to |cffbbbbbb(22, 70)|r and follow the path North into Dun Morogh\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run along the road to Ironforge\nG\t\tDun Morogh\t53.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun along the road to Ironforge at |cffbbbbbb(53, 35)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t74.0\t12.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet Ironforge weapon training at |cffbbbbbb(61, 89)|r, and get flight path at |cffbbbbbb(55, 38)|r. Turn in |cffffd100Report to Ironforge|r at |cffbbbbbb(74, 12)|r, SKIP SKIPPowder to Ironband.\nT\t\t301\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on the tram to Stormwind\nG\t\tIronforge\t76.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet on the tram to Stormwind at |cffbbbbbb(76, 51)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t58.0\t16.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Stormpike's Order|r at |cffbbbbbb(58, 16)|r in Stormwind.\nT\t\t1338\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get Stormwind weapon training , and flightpath\nG\t\tStormwind City\t66.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet Stormwind weapon training at |cffbbbbbb(57, 57)|r, and flightpath at |cffbbbbbb(66, 62)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Leave Stormwind run towards in Elwynn Forest, and enter...\nG\t\tElwynn Forest\t91.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tLeave Stormwind run towards |cffbbbbbb(91, 73)|r in Elwynn Forest, and enter Redridge Mountains" },
  { name = "18-20 Redridge Mountains (Alliance)", title = "18-20 Redridge Mountains", group = "VanillaGuide 1-20", faction = "Alliance", lo = 18, hi = 20, next = "20-21 Darkshore (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t15.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Guard Parker|r.\nA\t\t244\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t30.0\t60.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet the flightpath.\nT\t\t244\t\nA\t\t246\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tCross the bridge, accept |cffffd100Blackrock Menace|r, |cffffd100The Lost Tools|r and |cffffd100The Everstill Bridge|r. SKIP SKIPThe Price of Shoes\nA\t\t20\t\nA\t\t125\t\nA\t\t89\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Hilary's Necklace|r on the dock, accept |cffffd100Selling Fish|r near the shed outside the Inn. Go inside the Inn and accept |cffffd100A Free Lunch|r, SKIP SKIPDry Times.\nA\t\t3741\t\nA\t\t127\t\nA\t\t129\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t23.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west of Lakeshire and accept |cffffd100Redridge Goulash|r inside the house at |cffbbbbbb(23, 44)|r.\nA\t\t92\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t19.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet 5 |cfffca742[Great Goretusk Snouts]|r for |cffffd100Redridge Goulash|r just west of the houses. Beware |cff00ff25Bellygrub|r. Loot |cfffca742[Hillary's Necklace]|r from the |cfffca742Glinting Mud Pile|r underwater at |cffbbbbbb(19, 52)|r.\nC\t\t92\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t42.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead towards |cffbbbbbb(42, 55)|r for |cffffd100The Lost Tools|r and |cffffd100Selling Fish|r. Save at least 8 |cfffca742[Murloc Fins]|r for a later quest.\nC\t\t125\t\t\nC\t\t127\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Lost Tools|r by the bridge, |cffffd100Hilary's Necklace|r on the dock, and |cffffd100Selling Fish|r by the shed. You should be half way to level 20 at this point.\nT\t\t125\t\nT\t\t3741\t\nT\t\t127\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t15.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t129\t\nA\t\t130\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t33.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Spiders|r for |cffffd100Redridge Goulash|r between |cffbbbbbb(15, 71)|r and |cffbbbbbb(33, 76)|r.\nC\t\t92\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t43.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Assessing the Thread|r at |cffbbbbbb(31, 84)|r and |cffbbbbbb(43, 72)|r.\nC\t\t246\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t57.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Condors|r for |cffffd100Redridge Goulash|r around |cffbbbbbb(57, 76)|r\nC\t\t92\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t23.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back to Lakeshire, turn in |cffffd100Assessing the Threat|r near the flightpath. Go to the two houses West of Lakeshire, at |cffbbbbbb(23, 46)|r and turn in |cffffd100Redridge Goulash|r and |cffffd100Visit the Herbalist|r, accept |cffffd100Delivering Daffodils|r\nT\t\t246\t\nT\t\t92\t\nT\t\t130\t\nA\t\t131\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the Inn and turn in |cffffd100Delivering Daffodils|r. You should now be level 20, accept |cffffd100Murloc Poachers|r in front of the shed, if you still have the |cfffca742[Murloc Fins]|r in your bag, turn it in.\nT\t\t131\t\nA\t\t150\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Gnolls|r North of Lakeshire for |cffffd100The Everstill Bridge|r, then turn it in.\nC\t\t89\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t89\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Auberdine\nI\t\tHearth back to Auberdine. You should definitely be level 20 by this point and at least half way to level 21." },
  { name = "20-21 Darkshore (Alliance)", title = "20-21 Darkshore", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 20, hi = 21, next = "21-22 Ashenvale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=First fly to Darnassus and get your new Skills\nI\t\tFirst fly to Darnassus and get your new Skills.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t948\t\nA\t\t944\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t39.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(39, 85)|r it should say you found |cffffd100Master’s Glaive(complete)|r now use the |cfffca742[Phial of Scrying]|r. Click it turn in |cffffd100The Master's Glaive|r accept |cffffd100The Twilight Camp|r\nC\t\t944\t\t\nT\t\t944\t\nA\t\t949\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t38.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tClick the |cfffca742[Book]|r at |cffbbbbbb(38, 86)|r turn in |cffffd100The Twilight Camp|r accept |cffffd100Return to Onu|r.\nT\t\t949\t\nA\t\t950\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t38.0\t87.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t945\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t35.0\t83.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t729\t\nA\t\t731\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t31.0\t83.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to |cffbbbbbb(31, 83)|r and |cffbbbbbb(31, 85)|r and accept |cffffd100Beached Sea Turtle|r at both.\nA\t\t4731\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t950\t\nA\t\t951\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100The Sleeper Has Awakened (escort)|r the sleeping bear behind Onu. Put his horn on your hotbar because he falls asleep every minute or so. This quest will bring you into Ashenvale. Horn is in the box beside him. Note: since he follows you, with aspect of the cheetah on you can skip mobs by running down the road or taking the offroad.\nA\t\t5321\t" },
  { name = "21-22 Ashenvale (Alliance)", title = "21-22 Ashenvale", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 21, hi = 22, next = "22-23 Stonetalon Mountains (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to |cffbbbbbb(26, 36)|r Maestra’s Post in Ashenvale, and this will complete |cffffd100The Sleeper Has Awakened|r Go turn it in straight ahead in the house.\nC\t\t5321\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5321\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t1010\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill mobs around |cffbbbbbb(31, 31)|r in ruins of Ordil’Aran for |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.4|r I then clear the camp a total of 4 times. If I find it early I still clear it 4 times total. I am then half way to level 22.\nC\t\t970\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t31.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrab plant bundles for |cffffd100Bathran's Hair|r at |cffbbbbbb(31, 21)|r in Bathran’s Haunt\nC\t\t1010\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to Maestra’s Post at |cffbbbbbb(26, 38)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.4|r Accept |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.5|r.\nT\t\t970\t\nA\t\t973\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1010\t\nA\t\t1020\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t22.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t945\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run into Astranaar and get FP\nG\t\tAshenvale\t33.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun into Astranaar at |cffbbbbbb(33, 48)|r and get FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100The Zoram Strand|r right as you enter town.\nA\t\t1008\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100On Guard in Stonetalon pt.1|r on the house to the right.\nA\t\t1070\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tCross the road near the gazebo accept |cffffd100Journey to Stonetalon Peak|r\nA\t\t1056\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn the Inn accept |cffffd100Raene's Cleansing pt.1|r and |cffffd100Culling the Threat|r.\nA\t\t991\t\nA\t\t1054\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Astranaar your home\nI\t\tMake Astranaar your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Orendil's Cure|r at the last house accept |cffffd100Elune's Tear|r\nT\t\t1020\t\nA\t\t1033\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t14.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to The Zoram Strand. Stop at |cffbbbbbb(14, 31)|r accept |cffffd100The Ancient Statuette|r\nA\t\t1007\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tdo |cffffd100The Zoram Strand|r Naga all around here.\nC\t\t1008\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t14.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAnd |cffffd100The Ancient Statuette|r at |cffbbbbbb(14, 20)|r it’s on the ground.\nC\t\t1007\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t14.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1007\t\nA\t\t1009\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t9.0\t15.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Ruuzel|r at 9,15 You don’t actually have to kill Ruuzel. Kill Lady Vespia. A 22 weak elite and doesn’t have guards like Ruuzel\nC\t\t1009\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t14.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1009\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t20.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Raene's Cleansing pt.1|r at |cffbbbbbb(20, 42)|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.2|r Kill murlocs for the gem\nT\t\t991\t\nA\t\t1023\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Astranaar\nI\t\tHearth back to Astranaar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Zoram Strand|r right as you enter town accept |cffffd100Pridewings of Stonetalon|r\nT\t\t1008\t\nA\t\t1134\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the Inn Turn in |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.3|r and |cffffd100An Aggressive Defense|r\nT\t\t1023\t\nA\t\t1024\t\nA\t\t1025\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t46.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(46, 46)|r and accept |cffffd100Elune's Tear|r\nA\t\t1033\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t49.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(49, 56)|r grind north to |cffbbbbbb(53, 46)|r turn in |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.3|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.4|r.\nT\t\t1024\t\nA\t\t1026\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t55.0\t61.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou should already be level 22. Go to |cffbbbbbb(55, 61)|r and do |cffffd100An Aggressive Defense|r\nC\t\t1025\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Astranaar\nI\t\tHearth to Astranaar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1025\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the east exit house, turn in |cffffd100Elune's Tear|r accept |cffffd100The Ruins of Stardust|r\nT\t\t1033\t\nA\t\t1034\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t33.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tExit Astranaar out the east exit follow the south path till you are at |cffbbbbbb(33, 66)|r and grab stardust covered bushes for |cffffd100QUEATThe Ruins of Stardust|r\nC\t\t1034\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grind east to Talondeep path\nG\t\tAshenvale\t42.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind east to Talondeep path at |cffbbbbbb(42, 71)|r" },
  { name = "22-23 Stonetalon Mountains (Alliance)", title = "22-23 Stonetalon Mountains", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 22, hi = 23, next = "23-24 Darkshore (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down Stonetalon to the hut at |cffbbbbbb(58, 62)|r accept |cffffd100Super Reaper 6000|r\nA\t\t1093\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1070\t\nA\t\t1085\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t1085\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn it in right behind you accept |cffffd100A Gnome’s Respite|r\nT\t\t1085\t\nA\t\t1071\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill Loggers and Deforesters for |cffffd100A Gnome’s Respite|r and Operators for |cffffd100Super Reaper 6000|r all around Windshear Crag. Operators hang out around buildings only.\nC\t\t1071\t\t\nC\t\t1093\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Super Reaper 6000|r at the hut |cffbbbbbb(58, 62)|r SKIP |cffff6060Further Instructions|r Unless you want to run to Ratchet.\nT\t\t1093\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t59.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen go to |cffbbbbbb(59, 66)|r and turn in |cffffd100A Gnome’s Respite|r accept |cffffd100An Old Colleague|r and |cffffd100A Scroll From Mauren|r We’ll do these later.\nT\t\t1071\t\nA\t\t1072\t\nA\t\t1075\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Stop at Mirkfallon Lake and kill Pridewings for Pridewings of...\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t48.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at Mirkfallon Lake at |cffbbbbbb(48, 40)|r and kill Pridewings for |cff00ff25Pridewings of Stonetalon|r South and East of it.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t37.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to 37,8 turn in |cffffd100Journey to Stonetalon Peak|r SKIP |cffff6060Reclaiming The Charred Vale|r for now\nT\t\t1056\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grab FP at 36,7 and Fly to Auberdine\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t36.0\t7.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrab FP at 36,7 and Fly to Auberdine." },
  { name = "23-24 Darkshore (Alliance)", title = "23-24 Darkshore", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 23, hi = 24, next = "24-25 Ashenvale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in both |cffffd100Beached Sea Turtle|r on the dock\nT\t\t4731\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Auberdine your home\nI\t\tMake Auberdine your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.2|r just outside the merchant house accept |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.3|r.\nT\t\t731\t\nA\t\t741\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the last house accept |cffffd100A Lost Master|r.\nA\t\t986\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarnassus\t31.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Darnassus and turn in |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.3|r outside the Temple of the Moon at |cffbbbbbb(31, 84)|r accept |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.4|r Get talents if you need them.\nT\t\t741\t\nA\t\t942\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly back to Auberdine\nI\t\tFly back to Auberdine.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t58.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to around |cffbbbbbb(58, 21)|r for |cffffd100Mathystra Relics|r The relics are all over.\nC\t\t951\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t56.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(56, 13)|r accept |cffffd100Gyromast's Retrieval|r Kill raging reef crawlers around here and Murlocs north near the ship at |cffbbbbbb(55, 12)|r\nA\t\t2098\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun north of Ruins of Mathystra killing sire’s and matriach’s for |cffffd100A Lost Master|r Also kill Foreststriders for |cffffd100Gyromast's Retrieval|r\nC\t\t986\t\t\nC\t\t2098\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t56.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t2098\t\nA\t\t2078\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Turn the key on The First Mate somewhere in the middle he’s...\nG\t\tDarkshore\t55.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn the key on The First Mate at |cffbbbbbb(55, 18)|r somewhere in the middle he’s gonna attack you. You have to kill him. Then turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(56, 13)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back to Auberdine\nI\t\tRun back to Auberdine.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100A Lost Master pt.1|r at the first house in town.\nT\t\t986\t\nA\t\t993\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t43.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t951\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarkshore\t41.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to |cffbbbbbb(41, 81)|r and do /wave at Grimclaw He’ll point southwest at the cave. Go to it at |cffbbbbbb(45, 85)|r and turn in |cffffd100A Lost Master pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Escape Through Force|r Run him back to Grimclaw at |cffbbbbbb(41, 81)|r.\nT\t\t993\t\nA\t\t994\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you’re not level 24 yet or 1750 xp to level 24, grind to...\nI\t\tIf you’re not level 24 yet or 1750 xp to level 24, grind to 1750 until you level.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Auberdine\nI\t\tHearth to Auberdine.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Escape Through Force|r at the house before exiting town.\nT\t\t994\t\nA\t\t990\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Darnassus and get new skills fly to Astranaar\nI\t\tFly to Darnassus and get new skills fly to Astranaar." },
  { name = "24-25 Ashenvale (Alliance)", title = "24-25 Ashenvale", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 24, hi = 25, next = "25-27 Wetlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Trek to Ashenvale|r right in front of you when you hearth.\nT\t\t990\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun to the house on the East side, turn in |cffffd100The Ruins of Stardust|r accept |cffffd100Fallen Sky Lake|r.\nT\t\t1034\t\nA\t\t1035\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun to the West side of town, turn in |cffffd100Pridewings of Stonetalon|r accept |cffffd100Kayneth Stillwind|r\nT\t\t1134\t\nA\t\t4581\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t25.0\t61.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind every mob down into Fire Scar Shrine and kill |cff00ff25Ilkruk Mathrull|r at |cffbbbbbb(25, 61)|r for |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.5|r Take him out as fast as you can. He summons 2 voidwalkers if you take too long.\nC\t\t973\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t35.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind a path up to between |cffbbbbbb(35, 33)|r and |cffbbbbbb(36, 36)|r (he patrols) and kill |cff00ff25Dal Bloodclaw|r for |cffffd100Culling the Threat|r.\nC\t\t1054\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I grind furbolg’s until I’m half way to level 25\nI\t\tI grind furbolg’s until I’m half way to level 25\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen run to Maestra’s Post at |cffbbbbbb(26, 38)|r turn in |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.5|r accept |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.6|r.\nT\t\t973\t\nA\t\t1140\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Supplies to Auberdine (escort)|r may seem out of the way, you run into a fight of 4, and 2 fights of 3. You only go to the darkshore border and it completes. Easy 2900 xp, not far out of the way. Turn it back in at |cffbbbbbb(26, 38)|r.\nA\t\t976\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run to Astranaar\nI\t\tRun to Astranaar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Culling the Threat|r at the inn\nT\t\t1054\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t49.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to Silverwing Refuge at |cffbbbbbb(49, 67)|r and accept |cffffd100Elemental Bracers|r do it in the lake here.\nA\t\t1016\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once you have all 5 inact bracers, use the scroll on them and...\nG\t\tAshenvale\t49.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce you have all 5 inact bracers, use the scroll on them and hand it back in at |cffbbbbbb(49, 67)|r SKIP |cffff6060Mage Summoner|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I’m usually about 1 bar from level 25 so I grind to level 25 on...\nI\t\tI’m usually about 1 bar from level 25 so I grind to level 25 on the elementals\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Auberdine\nI\t\tHearth to Auberdine\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on the boat to Menethil Harbor\nI\t\tGet on the boat to Menethil Harbor." },
  { name = "25-27 Wetlands (Alliance)", title = "25-27 Wetlands", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 25, hi = 27, next = "27-28 Lakeshire (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tStop at the end of the docks, accept |cffffd100Claws From the Deep|r\nA\t\t279\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the west side of town accept |cffffd100Young Crocolisk Skins|r\nA\t\t484\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the top of the castle, accept |cffffd100War Banners|r\nA\t\t464\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the east side of town accept |cffffd100Digging Through the Ooze|r\nA\t\t470\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn front of the Inn accept |cffffd100The Third Fleet|r and |cffffd100The Greenwarden|r\nA\t\t288\t\nA\t\t463\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t53.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(49, 56)|r grind north to |cffbbbbbb(53, 46)|r turn in |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.3|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.4|r.\nT\t\t1024\t\nA\t\t1026\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Menethil Harbor your home\nI\t\tMake Menethil Harbor your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs in the inn, turn in |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.4|r accept |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.5|r\nT\t\t942\t\nA\t\t943\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tBuy a |cff00ff25Flagon of Mead|r from the bartender for |cffffd100The Third Fleet|r and give it to the guy outside the inn. Accept |cffffd100The Cursed Crew|r\nT\t\t288\t\nC\t\t288\t\t\nA\t\t289\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the bridge accept |cffffd100In Search of the Excavation Team pt.1|r\nA\t\t305\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t14.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Young Crocolisks just east of the bridge around |cffbbbbbb(14, 52)|r and north on the land of the lake also along the road to the greenwarden for |cffffd100Young Crocolisk Skins|r\nC\t\t484\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t18.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Bluegill Murlocs and Gobbler at |cffbbbbbb(18, 40)|r for |cffffd100Claws From the Deep|r\nC\t\t279\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t25.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Mottled Raptors and Screechers around |cffbbbbbb(25, 46)|r for |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.5|r\nC\t\t943\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Enter the Excavation Site\nG\t\tWetlands\t34.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the Excavation Site at |cffbbbbbb(34, 40)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t38.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up the path on the left and grab the fossil near the 2 npc’s at |cffbbbbbb(38, 52)|r for |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.5|r\nC\t\t943\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t305\t\nA\t\t306\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOutside the cave accept |cffffd100Ormer s Revenge pt.1.|r\nA\t\t294\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t25.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to where you killed the raptors a few minutes ago at |cffbbbbbb(25, 46)|r and do |cffffd100Ormer's Revenge pt.1|r by killing mottled raptors and screechers.\nC\t\t294\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t38.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back up to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(38, 52)|r and turn in |cffffd100Ormer's Revenge pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Ormer’s Revenge pt.2|r\nT\t\t294\t\nA\t\t295\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNow do both |cffffd100Ormer’s Revenge pt.2|r by killing Scythclaw and Razormaw Raptors below, and |cffffd100Uncovering the Past|r relics for this are all around the raptors. There are 4 different ones that randomly spawn but each is in it’s own shape which are: (Modr=Thin Red Vase) (Golm=Fat Yellow Vase) (Neru=Dirt Pile) (Ados=Tomb).\nC\t\t295\t\t\nC\t\t299\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t38.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t295\t\nA\t\t296\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t299\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t32.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Ormer’s Revenge pt.3|r atop the hill at |cffbbbbbb(32, 51)|r |cff00ff25Sarltooth|r is a 29 But he’s as easy as the others. Go turn it back in at |cffbbbbbb(38, 52)|r.\nC\t\t296\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t43.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in to Angerfang Encampment at |cffbbbbbb(43, 40)|r and do |cffffd100War Banners|r\nC\t\t464\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t49.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(49, 39)|r accept |cffffd100Daily Delivery|r.\nA\t\t469\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t56.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun straight East from here to |cffbbbbbb(56, 40)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Greenwarden|r accept |cffffd100Tramping Paws|r\nT\t\t463\t\nA\t\t276\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t62.34\t69.34\t\t\t\nC\t\t276\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t56.0\t74.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Mosshide|r around |cffbbbbbb(56, 74)|r for Tramping Paws at the camp. They’re a fast respawn I couldn’t kill them fast enough. Turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(56, 40)|r and accept |cffffd100Fire Taboo|r You should be level 26 by now, if not you will be soon\nT\t\t276\t\nA\t\t277\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t44.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Fire Taboo|r by killing any mosshides but the ones you just killed, The flints are easily dropped by the ones around |cffbbbbbb(44, 33)|r there is a few.\nC\t\t277\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t56.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Fire Taboo|r at |cffbbbbbb(56, 40)|r accept |cffffd100Blisters on the Land|r Now this is one of those quests you just do as you go. Fen Creepers are stealthed elementals that lurk in the water. If you see one, kill it.\nT\t\t277\t\nA\t\t275\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Menethil Harbor\nI\t\tHearth back to Menethil Harbor.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Absent Minded Prospector pt.5|r 2nd floor of the Inn\nT\t\t943\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo inside the castle upstairs, turn in |cffffd100War Banners|r accept |cffffd100Nek'Rosh's Gambit|r\nT\t\t464\t\nA\t\t465\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the west side of town turn in |cffffd100Daily Delivery|r and |cffffd100Young Crocolisk Skins|r accept |cffffd100Apprentice's Duties|r\nT\t\t469\t\nT\t\t484\t\nA\t\t471\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo on the dock and turn in |cffffd100Claws From the Deep|r accept |cffffd100Reclaiming Goods|r\nT\t\t279\t\nA\t\t281\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the bridge turn in |cffffd100In Search of the Excavation Team pt.2|r.\nT\t\t306\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should definitely be level 26 by this point and near ½ way...\nI\t\tYou should definitely be level 26 by this point and near ½ way to 27. You can either wait till you fly through IF to get talents or do it now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t13.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTouch the damaged crate at |cffbbbbbb(13, 41)|r turn in |cffffd100Reclaiming Goods|r accept |cffffd100The Search Continues|r.\nT\t\t281\t\nA\t\t284\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t13.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just north to the next camp touch the sealed barrel at |cffbbbbbb(13, 38)|r turn in |cffffd100The Search Continues|r accept |cffffd100Search More Hovels|r.\nT\t\t284\t\nA\t\t285\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t13.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo north again touch the half-burried barrel at |cffbbbbbb(13, 34)|r turn in |cffffd100Search More Hovels|r accept |cffffd100Return the Statuette|r\nT\t\t285\t\nA\t\t286\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t14.0\t28.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at the sunken ships around |cffbbbbbb(14, 28)|r |cffbbbbbb(14, 25)|r and kill the undead on either ship for |cffffd100The Cursed Crew|r Try to stay on top of the ships. Kill |cff00ff25Snellig|r in the broken part of the first ship in the rear near the shore for the box.\nC\t\t289\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t44.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFrom here north you should be able to find Giant crocolisks for |cffffd100Apprentice's Duties|r as well as the fen dwellers (track hidden) in the waters all over this area while you head toward Ironbeard’s Tomb at |cffbbbbbb(44, 25)|r for |cffffd100Digging Through the Ooze|r Kill oozes for the bag.\nC\t\t471\t\t\nC\t\t470\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now once all your fen creepers are dead head back to the...\nG\t\tWetlands\t56.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow once all your fen creepers are dead head back to the greenwarden at |cffbbbbbb(56, 40)|r and hand it in.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth Back to Menethil Harbor\nI\t\tHearth Back to Menethil Harbor.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t289\t\nA\t\t290\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo north a little bit and turn in |cffffd100Digging Through the Ooze|r\nT\t\t470\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the west side of town, turn in |cffffd100Apprentice's Duties|r.\nT\t\t471\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNext down to the docks, turn in |cffffd100Return the Statuette|r\nT\t\t286\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be level 27 now\nI\t\tYou should be level 27 now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t71.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to IF, get new skills, turn in |cffffd100An Old Colleague|r at |cffbbbbbb(71, 51)|r SKIP the next part\nT\t\t1072\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t43.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to SW, turn in |cffffd100A Gnome’s Respite|r at |cffbbbbbb(43, 80)|r SKIP the next part\nT\t\t1071\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Lakeshire\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire" },
  { name = "27-28 Lakeshire (Alliance)", title = "27-28 Lakeshire", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 27, hi = 28, next = "28-29 Duskwood (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Blackrock Bounty|r right in front of FP near bridge\nA\t\t128\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Blackrock Menace|r just over bridge on right.\nA\t\t20\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the town hall, accept |cffffd100Solomon's Law|r\nA\t\t91\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore|r Outside the Inn on the wall\nA\t\t180\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Lakeshire your home\nI\t\tMake Lakeshire your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t16.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tJust west of town at the house past the inn, accept |cffffd100An Unwelcome Guest|r now go do it just west of this house at |cffbbbbbb(16, 49)|r (Bellygrub) kill him\nA\t\t34\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t44.0\t19.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Render’s Camp at |cffbbbbbb(44, 19)|r and kill the orcs here for |cffffd100Blackrock Menace|r while you head NW to 34,7 for |cffffd100Blackrock Bounty|r\nC\t\t20\t\t\nC\t\t128\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once at the cave kill for the axes and champions Go left when...\nI\t\tOnce at the cave kill for the axes and champions Go left when you go in towards the down area with water, there is an escort quest here.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should have your axes and champions killed by the time you...\nI\t\tYou should have your axes and champions killed by the time you get to the escort. If not you can kill them on your way out.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t28.0\t12.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet the escort quest |cffffd100Missing In Action|r at |cffbbbbbb(28, 12)|r in the cave and escort him out. He’s a 25 elite so he won’t die easy. Once you’re out of the camp he starts running back to Lakeshire, turn the quest in right where you stop as well as |cffffd100Blackrock Menace|r SKIP |cffff6060Tharil'Zun|r\nA\t\t219\t\nT\t\t20\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun over the Bridge near the FP turn in, |cffffd100Blackrock Bounty|r\nT\t\t128\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t74.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the Gnolls all around |cffbbbbbb(74, 42)|r for |cffffd100Solomon's Law|r and Keep an eye out for |cffffd100Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore|r he is at |cffbbbbbb(80, 40)|r Make sure you clear the mobs around him or they come running in\nC\t\t91\t\t\nC\t\t180\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once you got those both done, grind on these shadowhide until...\nI\t\tOnce you got those both done, grind on these shadowhide until youre about 4k or 2 bars from level 28\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Lakeshire\nI\t\tHearth to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the town hall and turn in both |cffffd100Solomon's Law|r and |cffffd100Wanted: Lieutenant Fangore|r\nT\t\t91\t\nT\t\t180\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should have hit level 28 after that\nI\t\tYou should have hit level 28 after that.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down to the SW corner of Redridge Mountains, and take the...\nI\t\tRun down to the SW corner of Redridge Mountains, and take the path that forks south into Duskwood" },
  { name = "28-29 Duskwood (Alliance)", title = "28-29 Duskwood", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 28, hi = 29, next = "29-30 Ashenvale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Note on Duskwood, it has a few long, pointless chains that you...\nI\t\tNote on Duskwood, it has a few long, pointless chains that you only do a few parts of SKIP the rest\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Follow the road until you get to Darkshire and get FP\nG\t\tDuskwood\t72.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road until you get to Darkshire and get FP at |cffbbbbbb(72, 44)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t79.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the house just south of FP at |cffbbbbbb(79, 47)|r accept |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.1|r Buy a bronze tube from the gnome engineer just south of here at |cffbbbbbb(78, 48)|r and hand it back in, accept |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.2|r\nA\t\t174\t\nA\t\t175\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo towards town and the first big house on the left outside accept |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.1|r\nA\t\t173\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the house and accept |cffffd100Raven Hill|r |cffffd100The Hermit|r and |cffffd100Deliveries to Sven|r\nA\t\t163\t\nA\t\t165\t\nA\t\t164\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tExit the house and go straight to the house across the street and accept |cffffd100The Legend of Stalvan pt.1|r and |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r.\nA\t\t66\t\nA\t\t101\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run out the door straight across to the Inn and make it your...\nI\t\tRun out the door straight across to the Inn and make it your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tExit and go to the right, accept |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.1|r\nA\t\t56\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Legend of Stalvan pt.1|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t66\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t64.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart off doing |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.1|r to the east of Duskwood around |cffbbbbbb(64, 46)|r by killing Nightbane Shadow Weaver\nC\t\t173\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.1|r back in the center of town, accept |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.2|r\nT\t\t173\t\nA\t\t221\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t64.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to around |cffbbbbbb(64, 46)|r and kill Nightbane Dark Runners now for |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.2|r There are a lot in the camps\nC\t\t221\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo turn in |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.2|r in the center of town again and accept |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.3|r\nT\t\t221\t\nA\t\t222\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t81.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to the house at |cffbbbbbb(81, 59)|r turn in |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.3|r\nT\t\t175\t\nA\t\t177\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t79.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.1|r and the skeleton finger part of |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r at Tranquil Garden Cemetary around |cffbbbbbb(79, 70)|r.\nC\t\t56\t\t\nC\t\t101\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGer Mary’s Looking Glass for |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.3|r inside the chapel here from the insane ghoul\nC\t\t177\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t73.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the mobs around |cffbbbbbb(73, 73)|r inside and out of the cave for |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.3|r.\nC\t\t222\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Darkshire\nI\t\tHearth back to Darkshire.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust outside the Inn, hand in |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.1|r accept |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.2|r.\nT\t\t56\t\nA\t\t57\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo east from here and hand in |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.3|r accept |cffffd100Worgen in the Woods pt.4|r go in the house and turn that in.\nT\t\t222\t\nA\t\t223\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t79.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just south of the FP to |cffbbbbbb(79, 47)|r turn in |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.3|r accept |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.4|r\nT\t\t177\t\nA\t\t181\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be over half way to level 29, more near ¾ the way\nI\t\tYou should be over half way to level 29, more near ¾ the way\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t33.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at the ogre mound cave at |cffbbbbbb(33, 75)|r and kill |cff00ff25Zzarc' Vul|r for |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.4|r Stay left inside the cave\nC\t\t181\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t18.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at the front of Raven Hill at |cffbbbbbb(18, 56)|r and turn in |cffffd100Raven Hill|r SKIP the rest since they’re grey\nT\t\t163\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun north into the cemetery and kill skeletons for |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.2|r and spiders in here for |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r.\nC\t\t57\t\t\nC\t\t101\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t22.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill ghouls in the northern part of the cemetery at |cffbbbbbb(22, 38)|r to get ghoul fangs for |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r\nC\t\t101\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill black widow’s east of the graveyard for the last part of |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r\nC\t\t101\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t28.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the shack NE of Raven Hill at |cffbbbbbb(28, 31)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Hermit|r accept |cffffd100Supplies From Darkshire|r.\nT\t\t165\t\nA\t\t148\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t17.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(17, 29)|r at the grave and accept |cffffd100The Weathered Grave|r\nA\t\t225\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t7.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t164\t\nA\t\t95\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Darkshire\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRight in front of the inn, turn in |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.2|r accept |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.3|r\nT\t\t57\t\nA\t\t58\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in town hall, turn in |cffffd100The Weathered Grave|r accept |cffffd100Morgan Ladimore|r Turn it in just out front of the town hall SKIP |cffff6060Mor'Ladim|r\nT\t\t225\t\nA\t\t227\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the house east of the Inn, turn in |cffffd100The Totem of Infliction|r and |cffffd100Supplies From Darkshire|r accept |cffffd100Ghost Hair Thread|r\nT\t\t101\t\nT\t\t148\t\nA\t\t149\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the last house to the east, turn in |cffffd100Look to the Stars pt.4|r.\nT\t\t181\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t81.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Blind Mary in the house at |cffbbbbbb(81, 59)|r turn in |cffffd100Ghost Hair Thread|r accept |cffffd100Return the Comb|r Go turn it in at the house east of the Inn, accept |cffffd100Deliver the Thread|r\nT\t\t149\t\nA\t\t154\t\nA\t\t157\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t49.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(49, 77)|r (you can sneak around everything to here by going towards STV and to this location) and turn in |cffffd100Sven's Revenge|r accept |cffffd100Sven’s Camp|r\nT\t\t95\t\nA\t\t230\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun up to the shack NE of Raven Hill and hand in |cffffd100Deliver the Thread|r accept |cffffd100Zombie Juice|r\nT\t\t157\t\nA\t\t158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t23.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the underground at |cffbbbbbb(23, 35)|r kill plagued spreaders just around here and down inside for |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.3|r you probably won’t get them all in 1 pass.\nC\t\t58\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t49.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t230\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t7.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind your way back out over to Sven at 7,34 hand in |cffffd100Sven's Revenge|r accept |cffffd100The Shadowy Figure|r\nT\t\t230\t\nT\t\t95\t\nA\t\t262\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Darkshire\nI\t\tHearth back to Darkshire\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Zombie Juice|r right in front of you, SKIP the rest\nT\t\t158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Night Watch pt.3|r right outside the Inn\nT\t\t58\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Shadowy Figure|r at the house east of the Inn accept |cffffd100The Shadowy Search Continues|r\nT\t\t262\t\nA\t\t265\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t265\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn it in at the town hall, accept |cffffd100Inquire at the Inn|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t265\t\nA\t\t266\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDuskwood\t74.0\t7.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you happened to find |cff00ff25An Old History Book|r (drops off all mobs in Duskwood) start the quest |cffffd100An Old History Book|r and Fly to SW and turn it in at 74,7 and accept |cffffd100Southshore|r\nA\t\t337\t\nA\t\t538\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Menethil Harbor and get on the boat to Auberdine, Fly to...\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor and get on the boat to Auberdine, Fly to Ashenvale" },
  { name = "29-30 Ashenvale (Alliance)", title = "29-30 Ashenvale", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 29, hi = 30, next = "30-30 Wetlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Astranaar your home\nI\t\tMake Astranaar your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t66.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(66, 56)|r and touch the crystal for the first part of |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.6|r.\nC\t\t1140\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t55.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Withered Ancients for the Wooden Key for |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.4|r around |cffbbbbbb(55, 35)|r then use the key on the chest at |cffbbbbbb(54, 35)|r\nC\t\t1026\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t53.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1026\t\nA\t\t1027\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t85.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4581\t\nA\t\t1011\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t81.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(81, 48)|r and get the second part of |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.6|r\nA\t\t1140\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t66.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(66, 81)|r and do |cffffd100Fallen Sky Lake|r the mob is in the center\nC\t\t1035\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill rotting slimes until a chest falls east of the road near the lake for |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.5|r\nC\t\t1027\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t75.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(75, 71)|r and do |cffffd100Forsaken Diseases|r the bottle is on the table.\nC\t\t1011\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t85.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHand in |cffffd100Forsaken Diseases|r at |cffbbbbbb(85, 44)|r SKIP the next part.\nT\t\t1011\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Astranaar\nI\t\tHearth back to Astranaar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Fallen Sky Lake|r at the last house on the east side of town\nT\t\t1035\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t53.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(53, 46)|r turn in |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.5|r accept |cffffd100Raene's Cleansing pt.5|r Go turn it in at the shrine inside the tree at |cffbbbbbb(56, 49)|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.6|r Turn it back in at the moonwell at |cffbbbbbb(53, 46)|r accept |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.7|r die so you end up near town\nT\t\t1027\t\nA\t\t1027\t\nA\t\t1028\t\nA\t\t1055\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHand in |cffffd100Raene’s Cleansing pt.7|r at the Inn, SKIP the rest but keep the rod, you can use it forever to transform for fun =P\nT\t\t1055\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t26.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(26, 38)|r turn in |cffffd100The Tower of Althalaxx pt.6|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t1140\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Darnassus and get your level 30 talents\nI\t\tFly to Darnassus and get your level 30 talents\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Auberdine get on the boat to Menethil Harbor\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine get on the boat to Menethil Harbor" },
  { name = "30-30 Wetlands (Alliance)", title = "30-30 Wetlands", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 30, hi = 30, next = "30-31 Hillsbrad Foothills (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Menethil Harbor your home\nI\t\tMake Menethil Harbor your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t14.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(14, 25)|r and kill Captain Halyndor for his key on top of the ship, the chest is in the bottom of the ship. Send your pet in to grab all the aggro send it out to attack a murloc so it trains them all out. Touch the chest and turn in |cffffd100Lifting the Curse|r accept |cffffd100The Eye of Paleth|r\nT\t\t290\t\nA\t\t292\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t47.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTouch the catapult at |cffbbbbbb(47, 47)|r, hand in |cffffd100Nek'Rosh's Gambit|r accept |cffffd100Defeat Nek’Rosh|r\nT\t\t465\t\nA\t\t474\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t53.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(53, 55)|r and clear the left side, walk up and around the back, to do |cffffd100Defeat Nek’Rosh|r clear anything he might aggro, die doing so if you must. He’s kinda weak. Pretty easy for a 32 elite.\nC\t\t474\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Menethil Harbor\nI\t\tHearth back to Menethil Harbor.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Eye of Paleth|r right in front of you, accept |cffffd100Cleansing the Eye|r.\nT\t\t292\t\nA\t\t293\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up top of the castle, hand in |cffffd100Defeat Nek’Rosh|r.\nT\t\t474\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Fall of Dun Modr|r just outside the inn\nA\t\t472\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t49.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t472\t\nA\t\t631\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t51.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo half way across the bridge to 51,8 and go in the door that leads down, look for the dead dwarf body, hand in |cffffd100The Thandol Span pt.1|r accept |cffffd100The Thandol Span pt.2|r turn that back in at the camp at |cffbbbbbb(49, 18)|r accept |cffffd100The Thandol Span pt.3|r\nT\t\t631\t\nA\t\t632\t\nA\t\t633\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWetlands\t48.0\t88.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back over the bridge, just to the right is a tinier bridge. Cross it and destroy the explosives cart for |cffffd100The Thandol Span pt.3|r at |cffbbbbbb(48, 88)|r accept |cffffd100Plea to the Alliance|r\nT\t\t633\t\nC\t\t633\t\t\nA\t\t634\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t45.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun into Arathi Highlands to Refuge Point at |cffbbbbbb(45, 47)|r and hand in |cffffd100Plea to the Alliance|r.\nT\t\t634\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grab the FP\nI\t\tGrab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be half way to level 31 or more by now\nI\t\tYou should be half way to level 31 or more by now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run towards Hillsbrad Foothills\nI\t\tRun towards Hillsbrad Foothills.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Stop and run south into Stormgarde Keep, at the first...\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t27.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(27, 49)|r and run south into Stormgarde Keep, at the first intersection go right and hug the wall around over the bridge, buy all 3 first aid books at |cffbbbbbb(26, 58)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Continue heading to Hillsbrad\nI\t\tContinue heading to Hillsbrad" },
