    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t691\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t62.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to |cffbbbbbb(62, 33)|r touch the crystal and accept |cffffd100The Princess Trapped|r\nA\t\t642\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t80.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just east of Hammerfall to |cffbbbbbb(80, 40)|r. (Load up on bloodstone ore here, you can sell it for a few g per 4 in BB) This is a tree, behind it is the path up to the cave to kill kobolds for |cffffd100The Princess Trapped|r If you get them all before the end of the cave you have to continue to the end to hand it in by touching Iridescent Shards and accept |cffffd100Stones of Binding|r\nC\t\t642\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t642\t\nA\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be just about ¼ through this level when you exit the...\nI\t\tYou should be just about ¼ through this level when you exit the cave.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to the circle of east binding, just west of Hammerfall and...\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t80.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the circle of east binding, just west of Hammerfall at |cffbbbbbb(80, 36)|r and grab the cresting key from the rock.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t60.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(60, 53)|r and hand in |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.2|r If you see the courier kill him. Simply send your pet in get aggro, when he’s hurt some multi shot some off of him. He’s easy, just feign and let pet die once courier is dead. The courier walks between refuge and tarren mill.\nT\t\t659\t\nA\t\t658\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t68.0\t74.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the trolls all around the lake at |cffbbbbbb(67, 69)|r for |cffffd100Worth Its Weight In Gold|r you can get tusks and medicine bags off the guys here, to get the dagger you have to kill Shadow Hunters in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(68, 74)|r\nC\t\t691\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to the circle of outer binding and grab the thundering key...\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t52.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the circle of outer binding at |cffbbbbbb(52, 50)|r and grab the thundering key from the rock.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to refuge point and hand in |cffffd100Worth Its Weight In Gold|r this opens up |cffffd100Wand Over Fist|r from another NPC\nT\t\t691\t\nA\t\t693\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t53.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Wand Over Fist|r by killing |cff00ff25Coldrage|r in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(53, 77)|r (follow the left path) run back to Refuge hand it in, SKIP the rest\nC\t\t693\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t693\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to the circle of west binding and grab the burning key from...\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t25.0\t30.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the circle of west binding at |cffbbbbbb(25, 30)|r and grab the burning key from the rock.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I found the courier at this point on the road (varies since he...\nI\t\tI found the courier at this point on the road (varies since he travels)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t36.0\t57.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the circle of inner binding at |cffbbbbbb(36, 57)|r and turn in |cffffd100Stones of Binding|r on the rock, SKIP the rest.\nT\t\t651\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run SW of here, there is a path that leads behind Stromgarde...\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t31.0\t64.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun SW of here, there is a path that leads behind Stromgarde at |cffbbbbbb(31, 64)|r follow it around to the cave path at |cffbbbbbb(21, 75)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tSwim over to the ship and accept |cffffd100Land HO!|r\nA\t\t663\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t663\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t663\t\nA\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo by the fire accept |cffffd100Drowned Sorrows|r and |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.1|r\nA\t\t664\t\nA\t\t665\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.1|r by escorting him right behind you in the cave. Turn it in, accept |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.2|r\nC\t\t665\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t665\t\nA\t\t666\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t24.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down south near the sunken ships, around |cffbbbbbb(24, 84)|r and do |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.2|r (use goggles to find them easy), |cffffd100Drowned Sorrows|r (nagas), and |cffffd100Deep Sea Salvage|r (2 on each ship)\nC\t\t666\t\t\nC\t\t664\t\t\nC\t\t662\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Deep Sea Salvage|r on the dock\nT\t\t662\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Drowned Sorrows|r next to the fire\nT\t\t664\t\nT\t\t666\t\nA\t\t668\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t668\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHand that in on the dock accept |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.4|r\nT\t\t668\t\nA\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t60.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back towards Go’Shek Farm, if you haven’t found the courier yet abandon quest and hearth to SS. If so go to |cffbbbbbb(60, 53)|r and hand in |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.3|r turn it right back in accept |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.4|r\nT\t\t658\t\nA\t\t657\t\nA\t\t660\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tArathi Highlands\t60.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t660\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tEscort her when done turn it back in and accept |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.5|r Grind until youre 3500 xp to level 38\nT\t\t660\t\nA\t\t661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Southshore\nI\t\tHearth to Southshore\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Hints of a New Plague? Pt.5|r just outside the Inn\nT\t\t661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t41.0\t89.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Stormwind for new skills and get the quest |cffffd100Morgan Stern|r from Angus Stern at 41 89 fly to Menethil and sail to Theramore\nA\t\t1260\t" },
  { name = "38-38 Dustwallow Marsh (Alliance)", title = "38-38 Dustwallow Marsh", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 38, hi = 38, next = "38-40 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun up near the Inn, accept |cffffd100They Call Him Smiling Jim|r\nA\t\t1282\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t41.0\t89.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t1260\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the Inn, accept |cffffd100Mudrock Soup and Bugs|r and make Theramore your home.\nT\t\t1260\t\nA\t\t1204\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the 2nd floor of the castle behind the Inn, not the tower, turn in |cffffd100They Call Him Smiling Jim|r This gives you hints about some quests at the old Inn near the Barrens.\nT\t\t1282\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Buy 3 soothing spices from the trade supplies person in the...\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t66.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tBuy 3 soothing spices from the trade supplies person in the houst at |cffbbbbbb(66, 51)|r (for upcoming quest)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust as you exit Theramore, go right and kill Mudrock turtles along the shore for |cffffd100Mudrock Soup and Bugs|r\nC\t\t1204\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t55.0\t26.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the house at |cffbbbbbb(55, 26)|r and accept |cffffd100Soothing Spices|r turn it right back in, accept |cffffd100Jarl Needs eyes|r\nA\t\t1218\t\nA\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTouch the mound of dirt beside the house, accept |cffffd100The Orc Report|r\nA\t\t1219\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t32.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to Darkmist Cavern at |cffbbbbbb(32, 23)|r and kill spiders inside and outside for |cffffd100Jarl Needs eyes|r They drop 1-2 every kill\nC\t\t1206\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(35, 38)|r and grab |cffffd100Hungry!|r\nA\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t29.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(29, 47)|r, the shady rest inn, and grab these 3 quests, touch the hoofprints just out front |cffffd100Suspicious Hoofprints|r the badge on the board laying on the floorboards (it’s a tiny badge) |cffffd100Lieutenant Paval Reethe pt.1|r and the shield over the fireplace |cffffd100The Black Shield pt.1|r\nA\t\t1284\t\nA\t\t1252\t\nA\t\t1253\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t54.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to |cffbbbbbb(54, 56)|r and open the shipping crate for |cffffd100Razzeric's Tweaking|r\nC\t\t1187\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Theramore\nI\t\tHearth to Theramore\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Mudrock Soup and Bugs|r in front of you, accept |cffffd100… and bugs|r\nT\t\t1204\t\nA\t\t1258\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the docks at the tower and turn in |cffffd100The Orc Report|r accept |cffffd100Captain Vimes|r Run in the castle behind the Inn and turn it in\nT\t\t1219\t\nA\t\t1220\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1252\t\nA\t\t1259\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1253\t\nA\t\t1319\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1284\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1259\t\nA\t\t1285\t\nA\t\t1286\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the blacksmith house, turn in |cffffd100The Black Shield pt.2|r accept |cffffd100The Black Shield pt.3|r go turn it in back up in the castle\nT\t\t1319\t\nA\t\t1320\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t55.0\t26.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun out to |cffbbbbbb(55, 26)|r and turn in |cffffd100Jarl Needs eyes|r SKIP the next\nT\t\t1206\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo just NE of here and kill murlocs for |cffffd100Hungry!|r\nC\t\t1177\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t46.0\t17.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(46, 17)|r and clear some raptors until you’re 50% or more into 39 accept |cffffd100Stinky's Escape|r just follow him, and kill what attacks him. Really easy.\nA\t\t1222\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(35, 38)|r turn in |cffffd100Hungry!|r\nT\t\t1177\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t35.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the tower at |cffbbbbbb(35, 53)|r and attack Balos Jacken, at ¼ life he’ll become friendly and\nT\t\t1286\t\nA\t\t1287\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die so you end up near Theramore\nI\t\tDie so you end up near Theramore\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Stinky's Escape|r in the Inn\nT\t\t1222\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up in the castle, turn in |cffffd100The Deserters pt.2|r\nT\t\t1287\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t80.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan and run up to the Shimmering Flats to |cffbbbbbb(80, 76)|r turn in |cffffd100Razzeric's Tweaking|r accept |cffffd100Safety First pt.1|r turn it in in Gadget and accept |cffffd100Safety First pt.2|r\nT\t\t1187\t\nA\t\t1188\t\nA\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun back to the flats and turn in |cffffd100Safety First pt.2|r\nT\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Theramore and fly to Rachet, get on the boat to BB\nI\t\tHearth to Theramore and fly to Rachet, get on the boat to BB" },
  { name = "38-40 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", title = "38-40 Stranglethorn Vale", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Alliance", lo = 38, hi = 40, next = "40-41 Badlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun towards the Inn, accept |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.1|r halfway\nA\t\t595\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the building next to the half boat upside down, accept |cffffd100Scaring Shaky|r\nA\t\t606\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the Inn, make it your home, accept |cffffd100Venture Company Mining|r\nA\t\t600\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs, turn in |cffffd100The Rumormonger|r accept |cffffd100Dream Dust In the Swamp|r and |cffffd100Skullsplitter Tusks|r\nT\t\t1115\t\nA\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo just outside, hand in |cffffd100Sunken Treasure pt.4|r SKIP the next\nT\t\t669\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t33.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to around |cffbbbbbb(33, 39)|r and kill raptors for |cffffd100Raptor Mastery pt.3|r\nC\t\t196\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t38.0\t30.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill Snapjaw Crocolisks from the stream at |cffbbbbbb(38, 30)|r to the lake at |cffbbbbbb(41, 19)|r for |cffffd100Some assembly required|r\nC\t\t577\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t20.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the Island at |cffbbbbbb(20, 23)|r and kill elementals for |cffffd100Water Elementals|r You should be close to level 39 by now, either grind on the elementals or raptors and basalisks around |cffbbbbbb(33, 39)|r\nC\t\t601\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t41.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce you’re level 39, grind your way east to the road then to |cffbbbbbb(41, 41)|r and kill the goblins for |cffffd100Venture Company Mining|r\nC\t\t600\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t42.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to the camps around |cffbbbbbb(42, 37)|r and do |cffffd100Skullsplitter Tusks|r\nC\t\t209\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t48.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow you’re gonna have to find Bhag'thera for |cffffd100Panther Mastery pt.4|r she is anywhere between just north of Mosh’ogg at |cffbbbbbb(49, 25)|r to just north of the ZG entrance at |cffbbbbbb(48, 17)|r she’s elite. Easy way to do it is lay immolation trap and run her into it, once pet gets half health fear it and keep attacking it\nC\t\t193\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to BB\nI\t\tHearth back to BB\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t600\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs, turn in |cffffd100Skullsplitter Tusks|r\nT\t\t209\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tWalk outside, turn in |cffffd100Water Elementals|r SKIP the next\nT\t\t601\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into the shop Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks and turn in |cffffd100Some assembly required|r accept |cffffd100Excelsior|r\nT\t\t577\t\nA\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t27.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo out of BB and turn left to the camp of pirates at |cffbbbbbb(27, 69)|r and touch the letter on the barrel, turn in |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.1|r accept |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.2|r\nT\t\t595\t\nA\t\t597\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t32.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo kill gorillas around |cffbbbbbb(32, 65)|r just NE of BB for |cffffd100Scaring Shaky|r\nC\t\t606\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back to BB\nI\t\tRun back to BB\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn right after the tunnel, turn in |cffffd100Scaring Shaky|r accept |cffffd100Return to MacKinley|r\nT\t\t606\t\nA\t\t607\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFollow the lower dock towards the Inn, turn in |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.2|r accept |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.3|r\nT\t\t597\t\nA\t\t599\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo In the house across from the half ship, turn in |cffffd100Return to MacKinley|r accept |cffffd100Voodoo Dues|r\nT\t\t607\t\nA\t\t609\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up top the Inn, accept |cffffd100Up To Snuff|r\nA\t\t587\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t599\t\nA\t\t604\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should have close to all the STV pages, if not buy the few...\nI\t\tYou should have close to all the STV pages, if not buy the few that you need. You don’t need 1-27 they go in this order. 1,4,6,8,|cffbbbbbb(10, 11)|r,|cffbbbbbb(14, 16)|r,|cffbbbbbb(18, 20)|r,|cffbbbbbb(21, 24)|r,|cffbbbbbb(25, 26)|r,27\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up near Grom’Gol, search the shore there for the 38 elite croc for |cffffd100Excelsior|r stay away from the base or the guards will get you\nC\t\t628\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.0\t10.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to Nessingways at |cffbbbbbb(35, 10)|r and turn in |cffffd100Raptor Mastery pt.3|r and |cffffd100Panther Mastery pt.4|r accept |cffffd100Raptor Mastery pt.4|r\nT\t\t196\t\nT\t\t193\t\nA\t\t197\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t338\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be at lest 25% or less to level 40 now go grind on...\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t33.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou should be at lest 25% or less to level 40 now go grind on basalisks and raptors around |cffbbbbbb(33, 39)|r until you’re 40.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to BB\nI\t\tHearth to BB\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into the shop Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks and turn in |cffffd100Excelsior|r\nT\t\t628\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t74.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow fly to IF and accept |cffffd100Ironband Wants You|r from Prospector Stormpike at 74 11, and either to Darnassus to get your new skills and your mount, or get skills in IF and prepare for a few badlands quests by buying a frost oil and a gyrochronatom (don’t by a gyro if you can’t find a frost oil) a healing potion and lesser invisibility potion. Again don’t get either of the potions if you can’t get a frost oil or gyro.\nA\t\t707\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Loch Modan, Stable your pet, and make Thelsamar your home\nI\t\tFly to Loch Modan, Stable your pet, and make Thelsamar your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the house behind the Inn, accept |cffffd100Badlands Reagent Run|r\nA\t\t2500\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t74.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t707\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t65.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t707\t\nA\t\t738\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down into Badlands\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t46.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down into Badlands at |cffbbbbbb(46, 76)|r" },
  { name = "40-41 Badlands (Alliance)", title = "40-41 Badlands", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 40, hi = 41, next = "41-41 Swamp of Sorrows (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t53.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t706\t\nA\t\t718\t\nA\t\t719\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t45.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(42, 52)|r and hand in |cffffd100Martek the Exiled|r accept |cffffd100Indurium|r\nT\t\t1106\t\nA\t\t1108\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Barbecued Buzzard Wings|r, |cffffd100Pearl Diving|r (if you have them)\nA\t\t703\t\nA\t\t705\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now there's only one area for buzzards\nI\t\tNow there's only one area for buzzards. So for the 2 quests that require their items, kill them whenever you see one.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t25.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t710\t\nA\t\t713\t\nA\t\t714\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t25.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t714\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t714\t\nA\t\t715\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t66.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to |cffbbbbbb(66, 21)|r and open the crate for |cffffd100Mirages|r\nC\t\t718\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t53.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind over to the dig site at |cffbbbbbb(53, 29)|r and kill the dwarfs for |cffffd100A Dwarf and His Tools|r On the right side of the hole at |cffbbbbbb(53, 33)|r touch the note in the tent for |cffffd100A Sign of Hope|r\nC\t\t719\t\t\nC\t\t720\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t53.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind up to |cffbbbbbb(53, 43)|r and hand in |cffffd100Mirages|r accept |cffffd100Scrounging|r\nT\t\t718\t\nA\t\t733\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAlso turn in |cffffd100A Dwarf and His Tools|r and |cffffd100A Sign of Hope|r accept the next part to Uldaman\nT\t\t719\t\nT\t\t720\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t61.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to |cffbbbbbb(61, 54)|r and accept |cffffd100Tremors of the Earth|r The ogres spawn at |cffbbbbbb(62, 70)|r and wander to |cffbbbbbb(29, 56)|r so kill them if you see them. The boss is easy to pull off the back, with the small add or none.\nA\t\t732\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t62.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo south to |cffbbbbbb(62, 70)|r and kill ogres here for |cffffd100Scrounging|r and hopefully the boss is here. There isn’t many ogres so don’t worry\nC\t\t733\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t50.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(50, 62)|r, turn in |cffffd100Find Agmond|r accept |cffffd100Murdaloc|r\nT\t\t738\t\nA\t\t739\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo just south to the gnoll camp and do |cffffd100Murdaloc|r and |cffffd100Indurium|r\nC\t\t739\t\t\nC\t\t1108\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t45.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(42, 52)|r and turn in |cffffd100Barbecued Buzzard Wings|r and |cffffd100Indurium|r accept |cffffd100News for Fizzle|r\nT\t\t703\t\nT\t\t1108\t\nA\t\t1137\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t18.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(18, 41)|r and kill the lesser rock elementals for |cffffd100Study of the Elements: Rock pt.1|r and |cffffd100Badlands Reagent Run|r\nC\t\t710\t\t\nC\t\t2500\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t26.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(26, 44)|r turn in |cffffd100Study of the Elements: Rock pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Study of the Elements: Rock pt.2|r and do it by killing rock elementals\nT\t\t710\t\nA\t\t711\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t26.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t711\t\nA\t\t712\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t33.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill buzzards around |cffbbbbbb(15, 60)|r and coyotes around |cffbbbbbb(33, 62)|r for |cffffd100Badlands Reagent Run|r if you still need them\nC\t\t2500\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t11.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to |cffbbbbbb(11, 77)|r and kill ogres for |cffffd100Scrounging|r\nC\t\t733\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t14.0\t88.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill greater rock elementals at |cffbbbbbb(14, 88)|r for |cffffd100Study of the Elements: Rock|r\nC\t\t711\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t26.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t712\t\nA\t\t734\t\nA\t\t777\t\nA\t\t778\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Kill the elemental that’s summoned, he’s level 45\nI\t\tKill the elemental that’s summoned, he’s level 45. Then turn it back in to get your Nifty Stopwatch\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t53.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t733\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBadlands\t61.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(61, 54)|r and turn in |cffffd100Tremors of the Earth|r SKIP the next part\nT\t\t732\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNow you should be level 41, if you’re not go east into the ravine and kill the whelps until you level. I usually go here and grind for at least 30 min whether or not im 41 and try to get the heart for |cffffd100Fiery Blaze Enchantment|r If you don’t find it in 30 min just abandon it\nC\t\t706\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Thelsamar\nI\t\tHearth to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the house behind the Inn and turn in |cffffd100Badlands Reagent Run|r accept the Uldaman part\nT\t\t2500\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t65.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to |cffbbbbbb(65, 65)|r turn in |cffffd100Murdaloc|r accept the Uldaman part. I’m almost 25% into 41 now\nT\t\t739\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Duskwood, make it your home. Fly to SW Go to |cffbbbbbb(64, 20)|r and accept |cffffd100In Search of The Temple|r\nA\t\t1448\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly back to Duskwood, Run into Swamp of Sorrows\nI\t\tFly back to Duskwood, Run into Swamp of Sorrows" },
  { name = "41-41 Swamp of Sorrows (Alliance)", title = "41-41 Swamp of Sorrows", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 41, hi = 41, next = "41-42 Desolace (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t12.0\t58.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun into the Swamp of Sorrows, go to |cffbbbbbb(12, 58)|r and kill the whelps for |cffffd100Dream Dust In the Swamp|r low droprate but they respawn fast\nC\t\t1116\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t26.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the 3 mob types around him and north. It’s all close to the quest giver\nA\t\t1396\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t43.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up and find Noboru the Cudgel he circles around |cffbbbbbb(43, 38)|r and drops an item that starts |cffffd100Noboru the Cudgel|r\nA\t\t40030\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t26.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1396\t\nA\t\t1421\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t25.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind up to |cffbbbbbb(25, 31)|r and turn in |cffffd100Noboru the Cudgel|r accept |cffffd100Draenethyst Crystals|r\nT\t\t40030\t\nA\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t54.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to the sanctuary that starts at |cffbbbbbb(54, 29)|r and start collecting the |cffffd100Draenethyst Crystals|r\nC\t\t1389\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t65.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tWhen you get to the last camp with the npc in the cage at |cffbbbbbb(65, 18)|r first grab the chest off the cart to the left for |cffffd100The Lost Caravan|r\nC\t\t1421\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make sure you clear the camp beside the caged npc\nI\t\tMake sure you clear the camp beside the caged npc.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThen accept |cffffd100Galen’s Escape|r it’s a breeze if you cleared the camp\nA\t\t1393\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t48.0\t39.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to |cffbbbbbb(48, 39)|r to the busted up looking tent and open the chest to complete |cffffd100Galen’s Escape|r\nC\t\t1393\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t26.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1389\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t26.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1421\t\nA\t\t1398\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run through the swamp and go south into the Blasted Lands and...\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t54.0\t78.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun through the swamp and go south into the Blasted Lands at |cffbbbbbb(36, 59)|r and over to Nethergarde Keep at |cffbbbbbb(54, 78)|r. Grab the FP and fly to Darkshire.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Stable your cat and get the Badlands cat back out\nI\t\tStable your cat and get the Badlands cat back out\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Supplies for Nethergarde|r on your way back NE\nA\t\t1395\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly back to Nethergarde, turn in |cffffd100Supplies for Nethergarde|r easy xp.\nT\t\t1395\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back up into the Swamp of Sorrows\nI\t\tRun back up into the Swamp of Sorrows.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t70.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to the lake around the Sunken Temple at |cffbbbbbb(70, 54)|r and you should get a complete message for |cffffd100In Search of The Temple|r\nC\t\t1448\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t76.0\t6.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to about 76,6 and start killing silt and monstrous crawlers and work your way south for |cffffd100… and bugs|r until it’s done. Also look for wood planks on the ground for |cffffd100Driftwood|r\nC\t\t1258\t\t\nC\t\t1398\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Darkshire and get your cat back out\nI\t\tHearth to Darkshire and get your cat back out.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Nethergarde and run back up into the Swamp\nI\t\tFly to Nethergarde and run back up into the Swamp\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t26.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1398\t\nA\t\t1425\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t66.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down into the Blasted Lands and turn in |cffffd100Deliver the Shipment|r at |cffbbbbbb(66, 21)|r\nT\t\t1425\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to BB and turn in |cffffd100Dream Dust In the Swamp|r atop the Inn and accept |cffffd100Rumors for Kravel|r\nT\t\t1116\t\nA\t\t1117\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGet on the ship to Rachet and fly to Theramore and turn in |cffffd100… and bugs|r at the Inn\nT\t\t1258\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Desolace\nI\t\tFly to Desolace" },
