 Scorpidsting|r and kill him for |cffffd100WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting|r while here. He has 2 stealthed guards but is fairly easy. He patrols up and down\nC\t\t1690\t\t\nC\t\t1707\t\t\nA\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run over to the cave and go through to Lost Rigger Cove\nG\t\tTanaris\t68.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(68, 41)|r and go through to Lost Rigger Cove.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tStart killing the mobs all back here for |cffffd100Southsea Shakedown|r and |cffffd100Pirate Hats Ahoy!|r\nC\t\t8366\t\t\nC\t\t8365\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tYou may get some drops of Pirate's Footlocker which can hold |cff00ff25Ship Schedule|r and the upper middle and lower map fragments which starts |cffffd100Cuergo’s Gold|r and |cffffd100Ship Schedules|r only do them if you find them. If I don’t find them all I skip them or sell what I have.\nA\t\t2876\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t73.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Andre Firebeard|r at |cffbbbbbb(73, 47)|r for |cffffd100WANTED: Andre Firebeard|r\nA\t\t2875\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t72.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the only 2 story house out here at |cffbbbbbb(72, 46)|r and get the stolen wine for |cffffd100Stoley’s Shipment|r. It’s on the 2nd floor\nC\t\t2873\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1690\t\nA\t\t1691\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t2781\t\nT\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be close to half way TNL\nI\t\tYou should be close to half way TNL\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t32.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to |cffbbbbbb(39, 29)|r and do |cffffd100Gadgetzan Water Survey|r Run once you get the sample a 47 and 48 will attack you.\nC\t\t992\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun back to Gadgetzan and hand in |cffffd100Gadgetzan Water Survey|r accept |cffffd100Noxious Lair Investigation|r\nT\t\t992\t\nA\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t60.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100More Wastewander Justice|r around |cffbbbbbb(60, 35)|r by killing the mobs\nC\t\t1691\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=