  { name = "43-45 Feralas (Alliance)", title = "43-45 Feralas", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 43, hi = 45, next = "45-46 Uldaman (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the water side of the inn in the gazebo, accept |cffffd100The Mark of Quality|r\nA\t\t2821\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Feralas your home\nI\t\tMake Feralas your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into the big building across from the Inn, accept |cffffd100The Missing Courier pt.1|r and |cffffd100The Ruins of Solarsal|r\nA\t\t4124\t\nA\t\t2866\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the building just west accept |cffffd100In Search of Knowledge|r and |cffffd100The High Wilderness|r\nA\t\t2939\t\nA\t\t2982\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs turn in |cffffd100The Missing Courier pt.1|r accept |cffffd100The Missing Courier pt.2|r\nT\t\t4124\t\nA\t\t4125\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t26.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the gazebo at |cffbbbbbb(26, 52)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Ruins of Solarsal|r accept |cffffd100Return to Feathermoon Stronghold|r\nT\t\t2866\t\nA\t\t2867\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Feathermoon to the big building, turn in |cffffd100Return to Feathermoon Stronghold|r accept |cffffd100Against the Hatecrest pt.1|r turn around and hand it in accept |cffffd100Against the Hatecrest pt.2|r\nT\t\t2867\t\nA\t\t3130\t\nA\t\t2869\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t26.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill naga around |cffbbbbbb(26, 54)|r for |cffffd100Against the Hatecrest pt.2|r\nC\t\t2869\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I kill the naga until im about 2500 TNL because I’m usually...\nI\t\tI kill the naga until im about 2500 TNL because I’m usually under 15k TNL when I get to this part. They give an average of 250 xp per kill\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Feathermoon to the big building, turn in |cffffd100Against the Hatecrest pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Against Lord Shalzaru|r\nT\t\t2869\t\nA\t\t2870\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t26.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(26, 66)|r and kill |cff00ff25Lord Shalzaru|r at the end for |cffffd100Against Lord Shalzaru|r\nC\t\t2870\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die so you end up at Feathermoon\nI\t\tDie so you end up at Feathermoon\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Feathermoon to the big building, turn in |cffffd100Against Lord Shalzaru|r accept |cffffd100Delivering the Relic|r go to the other side of the building and turn it in.\nT\t\t2870\t\nA\t\t2871\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Take the boat to the mainland\nI\t\tTake the boat to the mainland\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo south of the dock and kill screechers for |cffffd100Screecher Spirits|r\nC\t\t3520\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t45.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to |cffbbbbbb(45, 65)|r and touch the wrecked boat to turn in |cffffd100The Missing Courier pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Boat Wreckage|r\nT\t\t4125\t\nA\t\t4127\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Feathermoon\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the little building across from the Inn on the 2nd floor, turn in |cffffd100Boat Wreckage|r accept |cffffd100The Knife Revealed|r\nT\t\t4127\t\nA\t\t4129\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up top of the big spiral tower, turn in |cffffd100The Knife Revealed|r accept |cffffd100Psychometric Reading|r\nT\t\t4129\t\nA\t\t4130\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the little building across form the Inn on the 2nd floor, turn in |cffffd100Psychometric Reading|r accept |cffffd100The Woodpaw Gnolls|r\nT\t\t4130\t\nA\t\t4131\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Take the boat to the mainland\nI\t\tTake the boat to the mainland\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t56.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the yeti cave at |cffbbbbbb(56, 56)|r and kill yeti’s for |cffffd100The Mark of Quality|r you can skin them and it’s also a drop.\nC\t\t2821\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIf a |cff00ff25OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon|r has fallen accept the quest |cffffd100Find OOX-22/FE!|r and turn it in at the back of the cave SKIP the escort.\nA\t\t2766\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t60.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind east and kill the Brutes around |cffbbbbbb(60, 56)|r, and warlocks and shamans around |cffbbbbbb(59, 66)|r for |cffffd100The High Wilderness|r I kill any I see\nC\t\t2982\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t65.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(65, 45)|r and accept |cffffd100Freedom For All Creatures|r It’s pretty hidden, just NW of the camp entrance is a path that doesn’t even look like you can walk on it. To do this simply escort her to the cage, open it and kill anything until it says complete.\nA\t\t2969\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t66.67\t46.75\t\t\t\nC\t\t2969\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHand it back in and accept |cffffd100Doling Justice pt.1|r The mobs can be found in this camp.\nT\t\t2969\t\nA\t\t2970\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t65.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t2970\t\nA\t\t2972\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t73.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to |cffbbbbbb(73, 56)|r and touch Large Leather Backpacks on the big tree.\nT\t\t4131\t\nA\t\t4135\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRight click the Backpack, accept |cffffd100Thalanaar Delivery|r\nA\t\t4281\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t73.0\t63.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to the hive at |cffbbbbbb(73, 63)|r and go all the way down. Go into the southern tunnel and stay right, You’ll see a Zukk’Ash Pod there.\nT\t\t4135\t\nA\t\t4265\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Feathermoon\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOn the water side of the Gazebo, turn in |cffffd100The Mark of Quality|r accept |cffffd100Improved Quality|r\nT\t\t2821\t\nA\t\t7733\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the small house across from the Inn, turn in |cffffd100The High Wilderness|r\nT\t\t2982\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs and turn in |cffffd100Freed From the Hive|r\nT\t\t4265\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t4266\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the big building next door and turn in |cffffd100A Hero’s Welcome|r accept |cffffd100Rise of the Silithid|r\nT\t\t4266\t\nA\t\t4267\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t89.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly out to Thalanaar (spot between 1k needles and here) turn in |cffffd100Thalanaar Delivery|r at |cffbbbbbb(89, 46)|r\nT\t\t4281\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Rut'theran Village (Darnassus)\nI\t\tFly to Rut'theran Village (Darnassus)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFollow the dock and go in the house, turn in |cffffd100Handle With Care|r accept |cffffd100Favored of Elune?|r\nT\t\t3022\t\nA\t\t3661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs, turn in |cffffd100In Search of Knowledge|r\nT\t\t2939\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the back of the house on the 2nd floor, open the green book and accept |cffffd100Feralas: A History|r turn it back in to her, accept |cffffd100The Borrower|r\nA\t\t2940\t\nA\t\t2941\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get new skills\nI\t\tGet new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t39.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the temple of the moon at |cffbbbbbb(39, 86)|r and up to the 2nd floor, turn in |cffffd100Rise of the Silithid|r and |cffffd100Doling Justice pt.2|r\nT\t\t4267\t\nT\t\t2972\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Buy 2 Elixir of Fortitude for a later part of this quest\nI\t\tBuy 2 Elixir of Fortitude for a later part of this quest\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon and fly to Gadgetzan and turn in |cffffd100The Borrower|r accept |cffffd100The Super Snapper FX|r\nT\t\t2941\t\nA\t\t2944\t" },
  { name = "45-46 Uldaman (Alliance)", title = "45-46 Uldaman", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 45, hi = 46, next = "46-47 The Hinterlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now you can either grind on the gnolls in Feralas around where...\nI\t\tNow you can either grind on the gnolls in Feralas around where you found the backpack on the tree, or you can do Uldaman. I highly suggest you do Uldaman. You picked up some quests earlier, there are a few more in IF and in the badlands. If you get a good group build you can easily do just about every quest in there in under 3 hours max. I usually fully do Uldaman inside and out, I don’t finish all the quests unless I have to level. 1 full run inside and out should get you 75-100% through this level. I usually do this in about 3 hours no problem. Plus you can solo all the mobs outside of the instance 3 at a time no problem. The end of Uldaman, after the boss, (mini disks quest) gives about 20k xp between that and talking to the ghostly npc who spawns in there, as well as gives some nice xp for quests later on. And you could miss some xp spots for later quests I do if you skip this.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I don’t list all the quests for Uldaman because there is a good...\nI\t\tI don’t list all the quests for Uldaman because there is a good handful and you don’t have to do them all to fully level, and again it is optional. This is much faster than grinding would be. I really hate to do instances when trying for the best time but alliance has less quests than the horde do and I did mention there will be about 10-15% of grinding on your way to 60. If you did do all instances though you would be really slowed down. This isn’t going to put a break in your time with a good group, preferrably guild groups of 45+\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You can stop at about 75% to 46 but again I suggest you level\nI\t\tYou can stop at about 75% to 46 but again I suggest you level. It’s not as bad as it seems.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=A great map of Uldaman and where the parts of most of the...\nI\t\tA great map of Uldaman and where the parts of most of the quests pieces can be done at is listed here on worldofwar.net\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce you’re all set, fly to SW and turn in |cffffd100In Search of The Temple|r at |cffbbbbbb(64, 20)|r and accept |cffffd100In Search of The Hinterlands|r get new skills then fly to Southshore.\nT\t\t1448\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run up to the path behind Durnholde Keep (you’ll see 2...\nG\t\tHillsbrad Foothills\t84.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to the path at |cffbbbbbb(84, 33)|r behind Durnholde Keep (you’ll see 2 griffins) into The Hinterlands" },
  { name = "46-47 The Hinterlands (Alliance)", title = "46-47 The Hinterlands", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 46, hi = 47, next = "47-47 Feralas (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t11.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(11, 46)|r and turn in |cffffd100In Search of The Hinterlands|r accept |cffffd100Gryphon Master Talonaxe|r\nT\t\t1450\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t11.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet the FP at |cffbbbbbb(11, 46)|r way up top go in the cave and turn in |cffffd100Gryphon Master Talonaxe|r, accept |cffffd100Rhapsody Shindigger|r and |cffffd100Witherbark Cages|r\nT\t\t1450\t\nA\t\t1451\t\nA\t\t2988\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into the Inn and turn right, accept |cffffd100Skulk Rock Clean-Up|r and |cffffd100Troll Necklace Bounty|r\nA\t\t2877\t\nA\t\t2880\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go way in the back of the Inn up to and make Aerie Peak your...\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t13.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo way in the back of the Inn up to around |cffbbbbbb(13, 41)|r and make Aerie Peak your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t20.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind east to |cffbbbbbb(20, 48)|r to the path while keeping an eye out for feathers on the ground for |cffffd100Favored of Elune?|r You don’t need them all yet\nC\t\t3661\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t26.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path up to |cffbbbbbb(26, 48)|r and turn in |cffffd100Rhapsody Shindigger|r accept |cffffd100Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail|r\nT\t\t1451\t\nA\t\t1452\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t23.0\t58.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back down and to the troll camp and clear most of them out at |cffbbbbbb(23, 58)|r and open the 2 cages for |cffffd100Witherbark Cages|r\nC\t\t2988\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t31.0\t57.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind east to |cffbbbbbb(31, 57)|r and open the 3rd cage for |cffffd100Witherbark Cages|r\nC\t\t2988\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tYou should also have 5 necklaces for |cffffd100Troll Necklace Bounty|r now\nC\t\t2880\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t46.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo NE up to |cffbbbbbb(46, 42)|r, collecting feathers if you still need them on the way, and kill the Green Sludges for |cffffd100Skulk Rock Clean-Up pt.1|r\nC\t\t2877\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go if you found OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t49.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(49, 37)|r if you found OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t56.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(56, 41)|r and kill Jade Oozes for part 2 of |cffffd100Skulk Rock Clean-Up|r\nC\t\t2877\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t81.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the waterfall at |cffbbbbbb(81, 46)|r and dive into the water below, then go south along this shore until you see Gammerita and take her picture for |cffffd100The Super Snapper FX|r Also you want to keep an eye out for bottles along the shore for |cffffd100Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog|r\nC\t\t2944\t\t\nC\t\t580\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Aerie Peak\nI\t\tHearth to Aerie Peak\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the front of the Inn and turn in |cffffd100Skulk Rock Clean-Up|r and |cffffd100Troll Necklace Bounty|r and any extra 5 necklaces you have.\nT\t\t2877\t\nT\t\t2880\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t9.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up past the FP in the cave at 9,44 and turn in |cffffd100Witherbark Cages|r accept |cffffd100The Altar of Zul|r\nT\t\t2988\t\nA\t\t2989\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t48.0\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo run up top of the Altar of Zul at |cffbbbbbb(48, 68)|r for |cffffd100The Altar of Zul|r\nC\t\t2989\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now I grind on the trolls and wolves around Zul until I’m 1 bar...\nI\t\tNow I grind on the trolls and wolves around Zul until I’m 1 bar from level 47. You should be at least half way through level 46 at this point.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t33.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet the quest |cffffd100Jammal'an the Prophet|r at |cffbbbbbb(33, 75)|r if you plan to do Sunken Temple later.\nA\t\t1446\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t49.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tI’m sure by the time you near level 47 you’re going to find OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon accept |cffffd100Find OOX-09/HL|r and turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(49, 37)|r and accept |cffffd100Rescue OOX-09/HL|r and escort it to |cffbbbbbb(78, 61)|r Theres only 2 encounters of 3 mobs, but watch out for the stealthed wolves\nA\t\t485\t\nA\t\t836\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once you’re about 6k or 1 bar from level 47 hearth to Aerie Peak\nI\t\tOnce you’re about 6k or 1 bar from level 47 hearth to Aerie Peak\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in any |cffffd100Troll Necklace Bounty|r you have just before you go out\nT\t\t2880\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t9.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up past FP to 9,44 and turn in |cffffd100The Altar of Zul|r accept |cffffd100Thadius Grimshade|r\nT\t\t2989\t\nA\t\t2990\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine fly to...\nI\t\tFly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine fly to Rut’theran Village\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTeldrassil\t55.0\t92.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to the house at |cffbbbbbb(55, 92)|r and turn in |cffffd100Favored of Elune?|r\nT\t\t3661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo upstairs, turn in |cffffd100The Super Snapper FX|r accept |cffffd100Return to Troyas|r\nT\t\t2944\t\nA\t\t2943\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should now be level 47 and about 8k into it\nI\t\tYou should now be level 47 and about 8k into it.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Feralas\nI\t\tFly to Feralas" },
  { name = "47-47 Feralas (Alliance)", title = "47-47 Feralas", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 47, hi = 47, next = "47-48 Tanaris (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Feathermoon Stronghold your home\nI\t\tMake Feathermoon Stronghold your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo across from the Inn to the 2 story house, turn in |cffffd100Return to Troyas|r accept |cffffd100The Stave of Equinex|r\nT\t\t2943\t\nA\t\t2879\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100The Sunken Temple|r Next to him\nA\t\t3445\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Swim or sail east to the dock\nI\t\tSwim or sail east to the dock.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tBeside the dock at |cffbbbbbb(44, 33)|r accept |cffffd100Zapped Giants|r and |cffffd100Fuel for Zapping|r\nA\t\t7003\t\nA\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tMake the Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker a hotkey. Then go south along the shore and start zapping giants and killing them for |cffffd100Zapped Giants|r and kill water elementals for |cffffd100Fuel for Zapping|r\nC\t\t7003\t\t\nC\t\t7721\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.0\t33.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(44, 33)|r and turn in |cffffd100Zapped Giants|r and |cffffd100Fuel for Zapping|r You can now do those again, but I wouldn’t, for about 500 xp per turn in. Now he opens his store to you.\nT\t\t7003\t\nT\t\t7721\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t65.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to the grimtotem camp at |cffbbbbbb(65, 45)|r and accept |cffffd100An Orphan Looking For A Home|r\nA\t\t3841\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go down to the yeti cave and do the robot chicken escort if you...\nG\t\tFeralas\t56.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to the yeti cave at |cffbbbbbb(56, 56)|r and do the robot chicken escort if you can, don’t be afraid to ask for help if needed.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t51.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to the yeti cave at |cffbbbbbb(51, 31)|r on Ironfur Bears and Groddoc Gorillas until you get 3 livers from each of them for |cffffd100Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail|r\nC\t\t1452\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill the Rage Scar Yeti’s here for |cffffd100Improved Quality|r remember you can skin them for these as well. If a Pristine Yeti Hide drops, accept the quest it gives |cffffd100Pristine Yeti Hide|r\nC\t\t7733\t\t\nA\t\t7735\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t42.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Rockbiter at |cffbbbbbb(42, 22)|r and accept |cffffd100The Giant Guardian|r\nA\t\t2844\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t38.0\t15.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Stave of Equinex|r by doing the following. Get the Blytan Essence from the fire at |cffbbbbbb(38, 15)|r |cffffd100The Stave of Equinex|r Get the Samha Essence from the fire at |cffbbbbbb(40, 12)|r (atop the ruined arch) to get to it, go around back and hop up the broken rocks (it’s not easily noticed) Go back out the back and Grab the Imbel Essence from the fire at 39,9. Get the Lahassa Essence from the fire at |cffbbbbbb(37, 12)|r under the brown gazebo. Go down to the Equinex Monolith just over the cliff. Use Troya’s Staff next to it. Touch the Monolith and turn in |cffffd100The Stave of Equinex|r accept |cffffd100The Morrow Stone|r\nC\t\t2879\t\t\nC\t\t2879\t\t\nT\t\t2879\t\nA\t\t2942\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t38.0\t10.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back up near the previous flame to |cffbbbbbb(38, 10)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Giant Guardian|r accept the escort |cffffd100Wandering Shay|r\nT\t\t2844\t\nA\t\t2845\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t42.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrab the bell from the chest and hotkey it. This is similar to the druid quest back in Darkshore. Run her back to Rockbiter at |cffbbbbbb(42, 21)|r and turn in |cffffd100Wandering Shay|r (the trick is to keep ahead of her, if she’s with you by your side she will wander off a lot more and the bell has a 1 minute timer.\nT\t\t2845\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nI\t\tHearth to Feathermoon Stronghold\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the gazebo near the water beside the hippogryph master, turn in |cffffd100Pristine Yeti Hide|r and |cffffd100Improved Quality|r\nT\t\t7735\t\nT\t\t7733\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Take your 2 Elixirs of Fortitude out of your mailbox if you...\nI\t\tTake your 2 Elixirs of Fortitude out of your mailbox if you don’t already have them on you.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo across to the 2 story house, turn in |cffffd100The Morrow Stone|r\nT\t\t2942\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be close to 70% into 47\nI\t\tYou should be close to 70% into 47\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan" },
  { name = "47-48 Tanaris (Alliance)", title = "47-48 Tanaris", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 47, hi = 48, next = "48-48 The Hinterlands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust inside Gadgetzan to the right, accept |cffffd100The Thirsty Goblin|r\nA\t\t2605\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Gadgetzan your home\nI\t\tMake Gadgetzan your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo behind the Inn, accept |cffffd100The Dunemaul Compound|r\nA\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNear the north entrance, accept |cffffd100Thistleshrub Valley|r\nA\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t49.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo south to the skeleton in the ground at |cffbbbbbb(49, 36)|r and |cffbbbbbb(44, 39)|r and |cffbbbbbb(47, 45)|r kill Rocs for |cffffd100Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail|r If it’s busy just do it later.\nC\t\t1452\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide over to |cffbbbbbb(52, 45)|r turn in |cffffd100The Sunken Temple|r and accept |cffffd100The Stone Circle|r and |cffffd100Gahz'Ridian|r\nT\t\t3445\t\nA\t\t3444\t\nA\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNow put on the Gahz’Ridian Detector Helm and yellow dots on mini map will show the pieces you need to get for |cffffd100Gahz'Ridian|r. It’s up to you if you want to wear this in fights. This stuff is all over\nC\t\t3161\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t40.0\t58.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over west to the Dunemaul Compound clear a path to |cffbbbbbb(40, 58)|r and kill Gor’Marok the Ravager for |cffffd100The Dunemaul Compound|r You don’t need the 20 ogre kills all from here\nC\t\t5863\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Head over and finish killing the ogres for The Dunemaul...\nG\t\tTanaris\t47.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead over to |cffbbbbbb(47, 65)|r and finish killing the ogres for The Dunemaul Compound while gathering the rest of the artifacts for Gahz'Ridian\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grind on the ogres until you’re 0 from level 48\nI\t\tGrind on the ogres until you’re |cffbbbbbb(10, 00)|r0 from level 48\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t37.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tSneak up the left side of Uldum and go up to the pedestal at |cffbbbbbb(37, 81)|r and turn in |cffffd100Seeing What Happens|r\nT\t\t2946\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTalk to the guy who appears, accept |cffffd100The Stone Watcher|r and talk to him until completed. Then touch the pedastal to turn it back in\nA\t\t2954\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t2954\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTouch the pedastal one more time and accept |cffffd100Return to Ironforge|r\nT\t\t2954\t\nA\t\t2977\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t29.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to |cffbbbbbb(29, 66)|r and kill Gnarled Thistlegrub and Thistlegrub Rootshapers for |cffffd100Thistleshrub Valley|r and the dew collectors for |cffffd100The Thirsty Goblin|r You should hit level 48 here\nC\t\t3362\t\t\nC\t\t2605\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t29.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf you find Tooga, accept |cffffd100Tooga’s Quest|r I found him at |cffbbbbbb(29, 73)|r near the zepplin, but you can find him anywhere around this valley. He follows you, you don’t have to follow him\nA\t\t1560\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t34.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to the Noxious Lair around |cffbbbbbb(34, 46)|r and kill Centipaar there for |cffffd100Noxious Lair Investigation|r If you can’t get them all before tooga has 10 minutes left, go turn that in and then come back.\nC\t\t82\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t66.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Tooga’s Quest|r near steamwheedle port at |cffbbbbbb(66, 25)|r\nT\t\t1560\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t4324\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t66.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Screecher Spirits|r at |cffbbbbbb(66, 22)|r SKIP the ZF part\nT\t\t3520\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo near the entrance and accept |cffffd100The Thirsty Goblin|r back and turn it in accept |cffffd100In Good Taste|r\nT\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t2606\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo behind the Inn near the fire, turn in |cffffd100The Dunemaul Compound|r\nT\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo near the north entrance, hand in |cffffd100Thistleshrub Valley|r\nT\t\t3362\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo west to Sprinkle, turn in |cffffd100In Good Taste|r accept |cffffd100Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient|r\nT\t\t2606\t\nA\t\t2641\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn the building behind her, turn in |cffffd100Noxious Lair Investigation|r\nT\t\t82\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo on the hill behind the building, accept |cffffd100The Schrimshank Redemption|r\nA\t\t10\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t55.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to the entrance at |cffbbbbbb(55, 70)|r take the spiral down to the entrance that is north. first fork go right. after the circular room at the next fork go right. You will enter a big square room. Go right to |cffbbbbbb(55, 71)|r and grab the survey gear for |cffffd100The Schrimshank Redemption|r\nC\t\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die on purpose so you end up at Gadgetzan\nI\t\tDie on purpose so you end up at Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the hill on the west side of town, turn in |cffffd100The Schrimshank Redemption|r accept |cffffd100Insect Part Analysis pt.1|r\nT\t\t10\t\nA\t\t110\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the house on the NW part of town, turn in |cffffd100Insect Part Analysis pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Insect Part Analysis pt.2|r\nT\t\t110\t\nA\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back up on the hill, turn in |cffffd100Insect Part Analysis pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Rise of the Silithid|r\nT\t\t113\t\nA\t\t162\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t78.0\t74.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to the Shimmering Flats to |cffbbbbbb(78, 74)|r and turn in |cffffd100An Orphan Looking For A Home|r accept |cffffd100A Short Incubation|r and since you already have this, turn it back in and accept |cffffd100The Newest Member of the Family|r now you have 1 hour.\nT\t\t3841\t\nA\t\t3842\t\nA\t\t3843\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Theramore and get any mageweave you have out and build...\nI\t\tFly to Theramore and get any mageweave you have out and build up first aid as much as you can.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Sail to Menethil and fly to IF\nI\t\tSail to Menethil and fly to IF\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make IF your home and get new skills\nI\t\tMake IF your home and get new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t77.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t2977\t\nA\t\t2964\t\nA\t\t3448\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t2964\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.0\t4.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3448\t\nA\t\t3449\t\nA\t\t3450\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t70.0\t93.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow you got the flare gun to signal later on.\nT\t\t3450\t\nA\t\t3451\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to the Hinterlands\nI\t\tFly to the Hinterlands" },
  { name = "48-48 The Hinterlands (Alliance)", title = "48-48 The Hinterlands", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 48, hi = 48, next = "48-49 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t14.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the base downstairs to |cffbbbbbb(14, 43)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Newest Member of the Family|r accept |cffffd100Food For Baby|r\nT\t\t3843\t\nA\t\t4297\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t26.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1452\t\nA\t\t1469\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t40.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to the lake at |cffbbbbbb(40, 59)|r and Violet Tragan (Mushroom) from the bottom of the lake for |cffffd100Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient|r\nC\t\t2641\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Hinterlands\t57.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind until you’re east of |cffbbbbbb(57, 47)|r and kill Silvermane Stalkers for |cffffd100Food For Baby|r\nC\t\t4297\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back to Aerie Peak and go to the bottom floor of the Inn\nI\t\tRun back to Aerie Peak and go to the bottom floor of the Inn\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tCute pet and good xp =)\nT\t\t4297\t\nA\t\t4298\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to IF and fly to BB\nI\t\tHearth to IF and fly to BB" },
  { name = "48-49 Stranglethorn Vale (Alliance)", title = "48-49 Stranglethorn Vale", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 48, hi = 49, next = "49-50 Blasted Lands (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go down to the first floor of the Inn, make it your home\nI\t\tGo down to the first floor of the Inn, make it your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1118\t\nT\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tEnter the house next to the upside down, half ship, turn in |cffffd100Deliver to MacKinley|r\nT\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tUnder that boat outside, accept |cffffd100Stranglethorn Fever|r\nA\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up the ramp and first house past the bridge, turn in all of...\nI\t\tGo up the ramp and first house past the bridge, turn in all of the robot chicken escorts you’ve gotten. I didn’t get the Tanaris one while writing this guide so I missed out on the quest to get 7100 extra exp\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNear the boat, accept |cffffd100The Captain's Chest|r\nA\t\t614\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.0\t60.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo kill gorillas around |cffbbbbbb(34, 63)|r for |cffffd100Stranglethorn Fever|r then go up into the cave at |cffbbbbbb(35, 60)|r turn it in. the guy in the cave asks for 10 gorilla fangs, then he summons 3 waves of gorillas. Mokk is in the 3rd wave. They’re all around level 42-44 it starts with 3, then 5 then I think 6 or 7. It can get tough. Just kill Mokk first in case you die.\nC\t\t348\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t38.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(38, 34)|r and kill |cff00ff25King Bangalash|r for |cffffd100Big Game Hunter|r he spawns level 33 minions. You can kill him before a few come out.\nC\t\t208\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t48.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to |cffbbbbbb(48, 25)|r and kill the elite ogres all around here until Maury’s Key drops for |cffffd100Cracking Maury’s Foot|r If you don’t find this after an hour just abandon the quest. It has a low drop rate. I grind until i'm 2 bars from level 49 if I don’t get the key. Usally it’s about an hours worth.\nC\t\t613\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t35.0\t10.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to Nessingways at |cffbbbbbb(35, 10)|r and turn in |cffffd100Big Game Hunter|r\nT\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Booty Bay, run up to the half boat just outside the...\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay, run up to the half boat just outside the Inn\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t348\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun to the shore just east of BB and open blue bottles until you get Carefully Folded Note which starts |cffffd100Message in A Bottle pt.1|r\nA\t\t594\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t36.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(36, 69)|r and kill |cff00ff25Gorlash|r for |cffffd100The Captain's Chest|r He’s a 47 elite, it can be tough but I did it. Use everything you have\nC\t\t614\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t38.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(38, 80)|r and turn in |cffffd100Message in A Bottle pt.1|r SKIP the next part, unless you can get a group to kill the 51 ape\nT\t\t594\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t33.0\t87.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to the pirate ships, 1 is at |cffbbbbbb(33, 87)|r and the other 2 are at |cffbbbbbb(30, 88)|r You want to go to the 2nd floor near the front of the ship and kill the captain of each for |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.5|r\nC\t\t608\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tLook for a scroll on one of the ships called Cortello's Riddle which starts |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.1|r\nA\t\t624\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If hearth is up, use it, otherwise die so you end up at BB\nI\t\tIf hearth is up, use it, otherwise die so you end up at BB\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo near the boat, turn in |cffffd100The Captain's Chest|r\nT\t\t614\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up top of the Inn, turn in |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.5|r\nT\t\t608\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t64.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to SW and go to |cffbbbbbb(64, 20)|r turn in |cffffd100Rhapsody's Tale|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t1469\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=From here on, either look at the AH when you go by one, or use...\nI\t\tFrom here on, either look at the AH when you go by one, or use your AH char to search for your Beaststalker Bracers. I got mine for 8g also look for a mithril casing for later in Un’Goro\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Duskwood\nI\t\tFly to Duskwood\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run east through Deadwind Pass to the Swamp of Sorrows\nI\t\tRun east through Deadwind Pass to the Swamp of Sorrows\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t22.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the road until it forks and the left fork has a bridge at |cffbbbbbb(22, 48)|r and under it is A Soggy Scroll which turns in |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.1|r accept |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.2|r\nT\t\t624\t\nA\t\t625\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down to the Blasted Lands\nI\t\tRun down to the Blasted Lands" },
  { name = "49-50 Blasted Lands (Alliance)", title = "49-50 Blasted Lands", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 49, hi = 50, next = "50-51 Searing Gorge (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=No need to rush through this zone, so grind on anything you see\nI\t\tNo need to rush through this zone, so grind on anything you see.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t50.0\t14.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(50, 14)|r and accept the following 5 quests: |cffffd100The Basilisk's Bite|r |cffffd100Vulture's Vigor|r |cffffd100Snickerfang Jowls|r |cffffd100A Boar's Vitality|r and |cffffd100The Decisive Striker|r\nA\t\t2601\t\nA\t\t2603\t\nA\t\t2581\t\nA\t\t2583\t\nA\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You’re going to need the following amount of items to complete...\nI\t\tYou’re going to need the following amount of items to complete all 5 of these quests. Snickerfang Jowls:5, Blasted Boar Lungs:6, Scorpok Pincers:6, Basilisk Brain:11, Vulture Gizzards:14 It’s going to be like grinding getting all this so you’re killing 2 birds with 1 stone. You’ll most likely gain half a level before you turn these in.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Just circle the center of the map and you’ll find all the stuff...\nI\t\tJust circle the center of the map and you’ll find all the stuff you need to kill. I’d mark it with coords but there would be way too many. You might want to avoid anything level 53 and up which are farther to the south. You should make some nice money with skinning here.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be close to 3 ½ bars into level 49 now\nI\t\tYou should be close to 3 ½ bars into level 49 now\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t51.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind down to |cffbbbbbb(51, 35)|r and accept |cffffd100Everything Counts In Large Amounts|r If you do find one of these, hand it back in when you pass her, you’re bound to find at least one while here. Don’t even bother with the other quest you’ll Never find it. I’ve been playing WoW since release and never found one.\nA\t\t3501\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t50.0\t14.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(50, 14)|r and turn in the 5 quests, |cffffd100The Basilisk's Bite|r |cffffd100Vulture's Vigor|r |cffffd100Snickerfang Jowls|r |cffffd100A Boar's Vitality|r and |cffffd100The Decisive Striker|r but turn in the one you want the most last, because you get buffed and get an item as well. These each give 4700 xp\nT\t\t2601\t\nT\t\t2603\t\nT\t\t2581\t\nT\t\t2583\t\nT\t\t2585\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBlasted Lands\t66.0\t19.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Nethergarde Keep to the top of the tall tower at |cffbbbbbb(66, 19)|r and turn in |cffffd100Thadius Grimshade|r SKIP the next part.\nT\t\t2990\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be close to 70% into level 49 now\nI\t\tYou should be close to 70% into level 49 now. If you don’t want to do ZF to hit 50, grind here until you’re about 13k from level 50. If you want do ZF go to the next step.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Booty Bay\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t1119\t\nA\t\t1127\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on the boat to Ratchet\nI\t\tGet on the boat to Ratchet\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Volcanic Activity|r at the first hut off the dock\nA\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust outside this hut is a green chest, open it for |cffffd100The Stone Circle|r\nC\t\t3444\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Tanaris\nI\t\tFly to Tanaris\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo near the NW entrance, turn in |cffffd100Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient|r accept |cffffd100Delivery For Marin|r\nT\t\t2641\t\nA\t\t2661\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back near the South entrance and turn in |cffffd100Delivery For Marin|r accept |cffffd100Noggenfogger Elixir|r You will recieve 5 elixirs and be able to purchase them.\nT\t\t2661\t\nA\t\t2662\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t77.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun in the Shimmering Flats to |cffbbbbbb(77, 77)|r and turn in |cffffd100Zanzil's Mixture|r and |cffffd100A Fool's Stout|r accept |cffffd100Get the Goblins Drunk|r go to |cffbbbbbb(79, 76)|r and turn it in.\nT\t\t1119\t\nT\t\t1127\t\nA\t\t1121\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t77.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and turn in INThe Stone Circle SKIP the rest unless you plan...\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(52, 45)|r and turn in INThe Stone Circle SKIP the rest unless you plan on doing the Sunken Temple.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be about 30k from level 50 now, like I said above...\nI\t\tYou should be about 30k from level 50 now, like I said above, either go do ZF or you should have grinded in Blasted Lands.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIf you do ZF you only really need to complete at least 2-3 of the following quests |cffffd100Troll Temper|r |cffffd100Divino-matic Rod|r |cffffd100Gahz'rilla|r |cffffd100The Prophecy of Mosh'Aru|r I highly suggest getting |cffffd100Divino-matic Rod|r and |cffffd100Gahz'rilla|r because you get an awesome ring and a mount speed inscrease trinket.\nC\t\t3042\t\t\nC\t\t2768\t\t\nC\t\t2770\t\t\nC\t\t3527\t\t\nA\t\t2768\t\nA\t\t2770\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now you should be about 1-2 bars into level 50 if you went to ZF\nI\t\tNow you should be about 1-2 bars into level 50 if you went to ZF. From here on out there is a lot more fresh content, as you seen 45-50 is a pain in the ass. We still have a lot of untouched areas to level in now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth to BB and turn in |cffffd100Report Back to Fizzlebub|r\nT\t\t1122\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to IF to get new skills and accept the quest |cffffd100The Hunter's Charm|r\nA\tHunter\t8151\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make sure you get at least 15 Silk Cloth out of the mailbox or...\nI\t\tMake sure you get at least 15 Silk Cloth out of the mailbox or AH alt\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tMake IF your home and accept |cffffd100Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm|r\nA\t\t3763\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Thelsamar\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down into the Badlands all the way west and enter the...\nG\t\tBadlands\t1.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down into the Badlands all the way west to |cffbbbbbb(01, 62)|r and enter the Searing Gorge" },
  { name = "50-51 Searing Gorge (Alliance)", title = "50-51 Searing Gorge", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 50, hi = 51, next = "51-52 Un’Goro Crater (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to |cffbbbbbb(65, 62)|r and touch the outhouse, accept |cffffd100Caught!|r\nA\t\t4449\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo just below the outhouse and kill the geologists for |cffffd100Caught!|r\nC\t\t4449\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t74.0\t19.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tClear all the mobs and at the bottom of the little pit, accept |cffffd100Suntara Stones pt.1|r escort him to |cffbbbbbb(74, 19)|r and when he dies grab the note which starts |cffffd100Suntara Stones pt.2|r\nA\t\t3367\t\nA\t\t3368\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back down near the outhouse at |cffbbbbbb(65, 62)|r and get the last of your geologist kills if you need them and turn in |cffffd100Caught!|r at the outhouse, accept |cffffd100Ledger From Tanaris|r and grab the book he slips you under the door.\nT\t\t4449\t\nA\t\t4450\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t71.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to |cffbbbbbb(71, 72)|r and kill |cff00ff25Margol the Rager|r, and grab Margol's Horn off him which starts |cffffd100The Horn of the Beast|r This gives you the searing gorge key, useless now that there is a FP here but good XP\nA\t\t3181\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t39.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to him until completed, accept |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r\nA\t\t3441\t\nA\t\t3442\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run up to Thorium Point\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t38.0\t26.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to Thorium Point at |cffbbbbbb(38, 26)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGrab these quests off the sign: |cffffd100WANTED: Overseer Maltorius|r (this will require a group) |cffffd100STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass|r and |cffffd100JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition|r\nA\t\t7701\t\nA\t\t7728\t\nA\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Curse These Fat Fingers|r |cffffd100Fiery Menace!|r |cffffd100Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It|r near the tower\nA\t\t7723\t\nA\t\t7724\t\nA\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tUnder the tent accept |cffffd100What The Flux?|r\nA\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grab the FP and fly to IF\nI\t\tGrab the FP and fly to IF\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t71.0\t16.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(71, 16)|r and turn in |cffffd100Suntara Stones pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Dwarven Justice|r\nT\t\t3368\t\nA\t\t3371\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Thelsamar\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tLoch Modan\t18.0\t83.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3181\t\nA\t\t3182\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to IF\nI\t\tHearth to IF\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t69.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3182\t\nA\t\t3201\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t75.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4512\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Thelsamar and run\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t18.0\t83.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thelsamar and run to |cffbbbbbb(18, 83)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100At Last!|r put the key on your keyring. Easy 12k xp\nT\t\t3201\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now the fun part, doing all these quests\nI\t\tNow the fun part, doing all these quests. Some of the mobs you have to kill are in a widespread area so I really won’t list coords on them.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFrom here south kill glassweb spiders for |cffffd100Ledger From Tanaris|r\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill any golems you see over here for |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r\nC\t\t3442\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go around the southern part of the cauldron (the pit) and...\nI\t\tGo around the southern part of the cauldron (the pit) and circle it back towards TP and do the following:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill heavy war golems and infernal elementals (not magma elementals for |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r and heavy war golems for |cffffd100Curse These Fat Fingers|r\nC\t\t3442\t\t\nC\t\t7723\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill dark iron lookouts and steamsmiths (Only 6 of them, so come back if they don’t drop, they seem to drop outhouse key a lot) for |cffffd100STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass|r\nC\t\t7728\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r accept |cffffd100Forging the Shaft|r when you’re near TB again.\nT\t\t3442\t\nA\t\t3443\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill greater lava spiders (not searing) for |cffffd100Fiery Menace!|r Mostly SW\nC\t\t7724\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf the Grimesilt Outhouse Key dropped, use it to start |cffffd100The Key to Freedom|r and turn it in at |cffbbbbbb(65, 62)|r\nA\t\t4451\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and start going down into the cauldron\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t63.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(63, 38)|r and start going down into the cauldron.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Kill dark iron taskmasters and slavers down here and inside the...\nI\t\tKill dark iron taskmasters and slavers down here and inside the cave if you see them for |cffffd100JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition and Forging the Shaft|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Enter the caves\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t41.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEnter the caves at |cffbbbbbb(41, 54)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t41.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the cave to |cffbbbbbb(41, 25)|r and go through the jail bar door, turn in |cffffd100Dwarven Justice|r accept |cffffd100Release Them|r\nT\t\t3371\t\nA\t\t3372\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t40.0\t35.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up the ramp and stay right until |cffbbbbbb(40, 35)|r kill the boss here for |cffffd100WANTED: Overseer Maltorius|r and grab |cffffd100What The Flux?|r on the rail behind him. If you can’t find a group have the pet get the aggro and run the guys away from the plans. This is doable with 2 people but very tough. If you can’t get this quest done no big deal but I usually get it done.\nC\t\t7701\t\t\nC\t\t7722\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKeep following the path that goes outside and curves back in. You’ll come to a big dead end area with lots of Incendosaur for |cffffd100Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It|r Save the scales\nC\t\t7727\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grind until youre 36k from leveling\nI\t\tGrind until youre 36k from leveling\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Die on purpose so you end up back at TP and turn in these quests\nI\t\tDie on purpose so you end up back at TP and turn in these quests\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo next to the sign, turn in |cffffd100WANTED: Overseer Maltorius|r\nT\t\t7701\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTo the right of the tower, turn in |cffffd100Curse These Fat Fingers|r |cffffd100Fiery Menace!|r and |cffffd100Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It|r\nT\t\t7723\t\nT\t\t7724\t\nT\t\t7727\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the tent behind here, turn in |cffffd100STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass|r and |cffffd100JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition|r\nT\t\t7728\t\nT\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the next tent, turn in |cffffd100What The Flux?|r\nT\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once this is all handed in you can now do repeat quests for...\nI\t\tOnce this is all handed in you can now do repeat quests for small xp and faction with TB. The reason I said to save the scales or sell them\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be a hair from level 51 now, go south of base\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t38.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou should be a hair from level 51 now, go south of base to |cffbbbbbb(38, 38)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3443\t\nA\t\t3452\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now you shoud be between 1-2 bars into level 51\nI\t\tNow you shoud be between 1-2 bars into level 51\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run over to the path up the mountain\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t24.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to the path up the mountain at |cffbbbbbb(24, 32)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t29.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill the elites 1 by 1 on your way up to the lava pit at |cffbbbbbb(29, 25)|r and clear the mobs around it, the idolators don’t chain link and don’t attack when you touch the rock in the center. Jump on the rock either with mount or jump in lava Open it for |cffffd100Release Them|r\nA\t\t3372\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tWhile killing these guys around the pool you should have found a Symbol of Ragnaros for |cffffd100The Flame’s Casing|r if not kill until you do\nC\t\t3452\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tMake sure you talk to the caged npc next to the lava, he gives you |cffffd100Prayer to Elune pt.1|r Listen to his short story and turn it in for |cffffd100Prayer to Elune pt.2|r Now you have to kill these for the Rag dropping and the Prayer of Elune, Easy drops\nA\t\t3377\t\nA\t\t3378\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t38.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrab the torch in front of him and complete it and accept |cffffd100Squire Maltrake|r and turn that back in and accept |cffffd100Set Them Ablaze!|r\nT\t\t3452\t\nA\t\t3453\t\nA\t\t3454\t\nA\t\t3462\t\nA\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now equip the staff and run to each of the 4 towers at N: W: S...\nI\t\tNow equip the staff and run to each of the 4 towers at N:|cffbbbbbb(33, 53)|r W:|cffbbbbbb(36, 60)|r S:|cffbbbbbb(44, 61)|r E:|cffbbbbbb(50, 54)|r and either kill the guys downstairs, and run up and light the brazier.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=When you get them all, look for a safe spot to jump down and go...\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t41.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tWhen you get them all, look for a safe spot to jump down and go in the caves at |cffbbbbbb(41, 54)|r again and through the jail bar door at |cffbbbbbb(37, 44)|r and run to the room with the golem at |cffbbbbbb(41, 25)|r and touch the candle covered stone and turn in Release Them SKIP the next part unless you wanna do it with a group, it’s very tough you have to fight that golem and a dwarf both elites.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t29.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDie on purpose so you end up at TP and go down to |cffbbbbbb(29, 38)|r and turn in |cffffd100Set Them Ablaze!|r watch the cutscene as he turns into a dragon\nT\t\t3463\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOpen the chest on the ground accept |cffffd100Trinkets...|r open it again and complete it. Open it and keep the Black Dragonflight Molt for later In the Burning Steppes.\nA\t\t3481\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to the Blasted Lands and run up into the Swamp of Sorrows\nI\t\tFly to the Blasted Lands and run up into the Swamp of Sorrows\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t81.0\t91.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(81, 91)|r and look for a named murloc |cff00ff25Jarquia|r for |cffffd100Ledger From Tanaris|r\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once you kill him hearth to IF either get a portal to Darnassus...\nI\t\tOnce you kill him hearth to IF either get a portal to Darnassus or fly to Menethil sail to Auberdine and fly to Darnassus\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarnassus\t38.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the top of the temple of the moon at |cffbbbbbb(38, 80)|r and turn in |cffffd100Prayer to Elune pt.2|r\nT\t\t3378\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the next section up here and turn in |cffffd100Rise of the Silithid|r accept |cffffd100March of the Silithid|r\nT\t\t162\t\nA\t\t4493\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarnassus\t34.0\t9.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to 34,9 at the top of the tower and turn in |cffffd100Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm|r accept |cffffd100Un'Goro Soil|r\nT\t\t3763\t\nA\t\t3764\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Darnassus your home\nG\t\tDarnassus\t67.0\t15.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tMake Darnassus your home at |cffbbbbbb(67, 15)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now either fly to Theramore or sail to Menethil to Theramore\nI\t\tNow either fly to Theramore or sail to Menethil to Theramore\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get first aid up to 290 if you haven’t for heavy runecloth...\nI\t\tGet first aid up to 290 if you haven’t for heavy runecloth bandages\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t54.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo over to |cffbbbbbb(54, 55)|r to the wrecked ship and grab the overdue package for |cffffd100Ledger From Tanaris|r\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t31.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(31, 66)|r and touch the scroll in the back of the cave which turns in |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.2|r accept |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.3|r\nT\t\t625\t\nA\t\t626\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Aggro all the raptors and die so you end up at Theramore\nI\t\tAggro all the raptors and die so you end up at Theramore\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust as you enter Gadgetzan, turn in |cffffd100Ledger From Tanaris|r\nT\t\t4450\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get your level 52 set gloves out of the bank or mail for later\nI\t\tGet your level 52 set gloves out of the bank or mail for later\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tBetween the 2 North gates accept |cffffd100Super Sticky|r\nA\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the hut just west and turn in |cffffd100March of the Silithid|r accept |cffffd100Bungle in the Jungle|r\nT\t\t4493\t\nA\t\t4496\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down into the Un’Goro Crater\nG\t\tTanaris\t26.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down into the Un’Goro Crater at |cffbbbbbb(26, 52)|r" },
  { name = "51-52 Un’Goro Crater (Alliance)", title = "51-52 Un’Goro Crater", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 51, hi = 52, next = "52-53 Azshara (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Keep an eye out for the following items laying around the...\nI\t\tKeep an eye out for the following items laying around the crater: Power Crystals (need 7 of red,blue,green,yellow), Un’Goro Dirt Piles (get as many as you can), and Bloodpetal Sprouts: save in sets of 15\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I tell you to grind through the raptors here only for 1 reason\nI\t\tI tell you to grind through the raptors here only for 1 reason. To find the item |cff00ff25A Mangled Journal|r. Once you have it you don’t have to grind through the raptors.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFollow the path down to the waterfall at |cffbbbbbb(71, 75)|r and accept |cffffd100The Apes of Un'Goro|r and |cffffd100The Fare of Lar'Korwi|r\nA\t\t4289\t\nA\t\t4290\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t62.0\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(62, 68)|r and click on the wrecked raft, accept |cffffd100It's A Secret to Everybody pt.1|r\nA\t\t3844\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTake 2 steps under the water, turn in |cffffd100It's A Secret to Everybody pt.1|r\nT\t\t3844\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t3845\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t68.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind to |cffbbbbbb(68, 56)|r and get the meat off the big dinosaur for |cffffd100The Fare of Lar'Korwi|r\nC\t\t4290\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4290\t\nA\t\t4291\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t67.0\t63.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGrind west to about |cffbbbbbb(67, 63)|r and there will be 2 spots with a bunch of eggs. Clear the raptors around it and stand on the eggs to get the mates to spawn for |cffffd100The Scent of Lar'Korwi|r\nC\t\t4291\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce you have this done, go back to |cffbbbbbb(71, 75)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Scent of Lar'Korwi|r accept |cffffd100The Bait For Lar'Korwi|r you should have found the jornal by now as well, if not keep grinding raptors while you’re questing in this spot. If you have start the quest |cffffd100Williden’s Journal|r\nT\t\t4291\t\nA\t\t4292\t\nA\t\t3884\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t79.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(79, 49)|r it’s off to the east side in the mountains, behind the east pylon. You’ll see a big skeleton which is also the GY. There is a fairly big flat stone, stand on it and use the meat and phermone. This will summon Lar’Korwi for |cffffd100The Bait For Lar'Korwi|r super easy kill even at 51 and he’s 56, he has 3600 hp.\nC\t\t4292\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t46.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(46, 13)|r and accept |cffffd100Chasing A-Me 01|r and run up the path behind her into Marshal’s Refuge.\nA\t\t4243\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust to the left accept |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r\nA\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNext to the left, a little bit back, accept |cffffd100Muigin and Larion|r\nA\t\t4141\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNext, near the sign accept |cffffd100Lost!|r and on the sign accept |cffffd100Beware of Pterrordax|r\nA\t\t4492\t\nA\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn front of the cave, accept |cffffd100Roll the Bones|r\nA\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIf you have at least 15 bloodpetal sprouts, turn them in at the kodo for the repeatable quest |cffffd100Dadanga is Hungry!|r you can get a very rare and expensive recipe so it's worth trying.\nA\t\t5150\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTo the right of the cave, accept |cffffd100Alien Ecology|r\nA\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTo the right again, turn in |cffffd100Williden’s Journal|r accept |cffffd100Expedition Salvation|r\nT\t\t3884\t\nA\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun just south a bit and you’ll fine Linken just outside of a half hollow tree.\nT\t\t3845\t\nA\t\t3908\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGet the FP to the right of the cave (added in 1.11) go in the cave all the way to the end and accept |cffffd100Crystals of Power|r and Accept the 3 pylon quests |cffffd100The Northern Pylon|r |cffffd100The Eastern Pylon|r |cffffd100The Western Pylon|r\nA\t\t4284\t\nA\t\t4285\t\nA\t\t4287\t\nA\t\t4288\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=When ever you see the following mobs kill them on sight until...\nI\t\tWhen ever you see the following mobs kill them on sight until the quest associate with them is finished.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill bloodpetals for |cffffd100Muigin and Larion|r\nC\t\t4141\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill diametradons and pterrodaxes for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r and |cffffd100Roll the Bones|r\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill pterrodaxes and frenzied pterrodaxes for |cffffd100Beware of Pterrordax|r\nC\t\t4501\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t54.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east along the mountains to |cffbbbbbb(54, 13)|r and take that path up examine the pylon for |cffffd100The Northern Pylon|r and go farther north, there should be sone pterrodaxes.\nC\t\t4285\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t63.0\t16.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to |cffbbbbbb(63, 16)|r and kill gorillas for |cffffd100The Apes of Un'Goro|r then go in the cave and stay right to turn in |cffffd100Chasing A-Me 01|r SKIP the next part for now\nC\t\t4289\t\t\nT\t\t4243\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t61.0\t27.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou’re gonna see a bunch of black lakes near the north of the map around |cffbbbbbb(52, 23)|r Kill the tar monsters around the lakes for |cffffd100Super Sticky|r The 3 lakes south of the gorillas around |cffbbbbbb(61, 27)|r have lower level tar monsters and there is also bloodpetals around here for |cffffd100Muigin and Larion|r there is also diametradons and pterrodaxes for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r running around\nC\t\t4504\t\t\nC\t\t4141\t\t\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t68.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(68, 36)|r and grab the crate of foodstuff for |cffffd100Expedition Salvation|r\nC\t\t3881\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTry to collect all the stuff for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r out here if you aren’t just going around looking for them alone. I always seem to find them all before I finish the bloodpetals.\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t76.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(76, 51)|r and follow the path up to the pylon for |cffffd100The Eastern Pylon|r and there should be pterrodaxes further south at |cffbbbbbb(75, 61)|r\nC\t\t4287\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(71, 75)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Bait For Lar'Korwi|r and |cffffd100The Apes of Un'Goro|r SKIP the next part for now\nT\t\t4292\t\nT\t\t4289\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now if you grinded a lot like I did on those flowers and...\nI\t\tNow if you grinded a lot like I did on those flowers and dinosaurs, you should be really close to level 52 if not level 52 already.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t55.0\t90.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tJust east of the volcano (center of map) there are pterrodaxes all for |cffffd100Beware of Pterrordax|r if you’re having trouble finding them there is a spawn of 6 of them all the way south at |cffbbbbbb(55, 90)|r\nC\t\t4501\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t55.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun west to |cffbbbbbb(55, 73)|r there is a diametradon camp of about 5-6 Kill these if you need scales still for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r or |cffffd100Roll the Bones|r\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t50.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to |cffbbbbbb(50, 77)|r into the slithering scar, at the fork go left into the big room, stand in the middle, use the scraping vial for |cffffd100Alien Ecology|r\nC\t\t3883\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThere is another diametradon camp if you still need scales or bones for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r or |cffffd100Roll the Bones|r and they’re also all over now\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t38.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to the camp at |cffbbbbbb(38, 65)|r and grab the research equipment for |cffffd100Expedition Salvation|r\nC\t\t3881\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t35.0\t38.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill frenzied pterrodaxes all around |cffbbbbbb(35, 38)|r (they’re everywhere) in the NW part of the map for |cffffd100Beware of Pterrordax|r plus there are many diametradons here for |cffffd100Shizzle's Flyer|r or |cffffd100Roll the Bones|r\nC\t\t4501\t\t\nC\t\t4503\t\t\nC\t\t3882\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t23.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo down to |cffbbbbbb(23, 59)|r and touch the western pylon for |cffffd100The Western Pylon|r and kill any pterrodaxes you need behind it\nC\t\t4288\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t30.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(30, 50)|r and accept |cffffd100Finding the Source|r\nC\t\t974\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t51.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo over to Fire Plume Ridge at |cffbbbbbb(51, 48)|r and kill elementals, try to avoid anything 56+ for |cffffd100Volcanic Activity|r Leave blazing invaders alone\nC\t\t4502\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once you have that done, dismiss pet and mount up towards the...\nI\t\tOnce you have that done, dismiss pet and mount up towards the top of the volcano and look for what looks like the instance waiting stones but with fire cracks in it. Dismount and FD if there is a mob near it put pet on it and use the thermometer for Finding the Source there is more than one and it doesn’t have to be at the top I see them at the bottom too.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t30.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tUnless you need ashes still run to |cffbbbbbb(30, 50)|r and turn in |cffffd100Finding the Source|r accept |cffffd100The New Springs|r\nT\t\t974\t\nA\t\t980\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t51.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up into the cave (in the same manner) at |cffbbbbbb(51, 49)|r and turn in |cffffd100Lost!|r accept |cffffd100A Little Help From My Friends|r he follows you, once you get him out of the ridge it’s easy. Just go straight out the cave over the edge, if done right you only have to fight 1 element. Once you go north past the river it’s pie.\nT\t\t4492\t\nA\t\t4491\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tWhen you get him back to town run up near the sign by the cave and it will complete\nT\t\t4501\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4503\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Muigin and Larion|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t4141\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3882\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3883\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3881\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn the back of the cave turn in |cffffd100The Northern Pylon|r |cffffd100The Eastern Pylon|r |cffffd100The Western Pylon|r accept |cffffd100Making Sense of It|r tells you about buffs from the pylons.\nT\t\t4285\t\nT\t\t4287\t\nT\t\t4288\t\nA\t\t4321\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run and follow the path into Slithus grab the FP and fly to...\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t29.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to |cffbbbbbb(29, 22)|r and follow the path into Slithus to |cffbbbbbb(50, 34)|r grab the FP and fly to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the NW part of town, turn in |cffffd100Bungle in the Jungle|r SKIP the next part turn in |cffffd100Super Sticky|r between the 2 entrances\nT\t\t4496\t\nT\t\t4504\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Darnassus and get new skills\nI\t\tHearth to Darnassus and get new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should have at least 50+ soils now\nI\t\tYou should have at least 50+ soils now.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarnassus\t31.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3764\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tNow go up to the top of the tower and accept |cffffd100Morrowgrain Research pt.1|r\nA\t\t3781\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo downstairs and turn in |cffffd100Morrowgrain Research pt.1|r\nT\t\t3781\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t3785\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now you might want to get extra seed packets depending on how...\nI\t\tNow you might want to get extra seed packets depending on how many soils you have. You can use the pouch every 10 minutes and you won’t always get a morrowgrain. All you need is 10 anyway\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun through to Rut’theran Village and go in the house to the right and accept |cffffd100Moontouched Wildkin|r it’s a winterspring feather quest\nA\t\t978\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Astranaar ride all the way east on the road which goes...\nG\t\tAshenvale\t91.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Astranaar ride all the way east on the road to |cffbbbbbb(91, 46)|r which goes into Azshara" },
  { name = "52-53 Azshara (Alliance)", title = "52-53 Azshara", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 52, hi = 53, next = "53-54 Felwood (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Just as you enter, on the right grab the FP\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tJust as you enter, on the right at |cffbbbbbb(11, 77)|r grab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust behind him, accept |cffffd100Spiritual Unrest|r and |cffffd100A Land Filled With Hatred|r\nA\t\t5535\t\nA\t\t5536\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t14.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just north to around |cffbbbbbb(14, 72)|r and |cffbbbbbb(16, 67)|rand kill all the ghosts around here until you complete |cffffd100Spiritual Unrest|r\nC\t\t5535\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go just north and kill all the satyr’s around here for DOA Land...\nG\t\tAzshara\t19.0\t61.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just north to |cffbbbbbb(19, 61)|r and kill all the satyr’s around here for DOA Land Filled With Hatred\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t11.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t5535\t\nT\t\t5536\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t39.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(39, 55)|r and get the Markri rubbing for |cffffd100Arcane Runes|r\nC\t\t3449\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t36.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(36, 53)|r and get the Beth’Amara Rubbing for |cffffd100Arcane Runes|r\nC\t\t3449\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t39.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(39, 50)|r and get the Jin’yael rubbing for |cffffd100Arcane Runes|r\nC\t\t3449\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t42.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(42, 42)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Hunter's Charm|r accept |cffffd100Courser Antlers|r this quest and the follow up are optional to do after you turn level 53, I do them so if you don’t you’ll be behind a little on the guide. It takes about 1-2 hours to get all the pieces for this and the next quest but will put you about 20-25% into the level\nT\tHunter\t8151\t\nA\tHunter\t8153\t" },
  { name = "53-54 Felwood (Alliance)", title = "53-54 Felwood", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Alliance", lo = 53, hi = 54, next = "54-54 Tanaris (Alliance)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Alliance", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t54.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStop at |cffbbbbbb(54, 86)|r and accept |cffffd100Cleansing Felwood|r\nA\t\t4101\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t51.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun north a little bit to |cffbbbbbb(51, 81)|r and accept |cffffd100Forces of Jaedenar|r\nA\t\t5155\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tInside the house, accept |cffffd100The Corruption of the Jadefire|r\nA\t\t4421\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tUnder the tent accept |cffffd100Verifying the Corruption|r and |cffffd100To Winterspring!|r\nA\t\t5156\t\nA\t\t5249\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust across the road accept |cffffd100Timbermaw Ally|r\nA\t\t8460\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t48.0\t91.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just SW of here around |cffbbbbbb(48, 91)|r and kill the Furlbogs until you finish |cffffd100Timbermaw Ally|r Just grind them all for rep until you’re done\nC\t\t8460\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t50.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to |cffbbbbbb(50, 85)|r and turn in |cffffd100Timbermaw Ally|r accept |cffffd100Speak to Nefian|r the other is repeatable for rep\nT\t\t8460\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t40.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up near the 2 lakes at |cffbbbbbb(40, 69)|r and kill the cursed oozes for the first part of |cffffd100A Little Slime Goes A Long Way pt.1|r\nC\t\t4512\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t37.0\t69.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the west of here now to |cffbbbbbb(37, 69)|r and kill the jadefire demons for |cffffd100The Corruption of the Jadefire|r these are good to farm too.\nC\t\t4421\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up and kill the tainted oozes for the second part of DOA...\nG\t\tFelwood\t39.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(39, 59)|r and kill the tainted oozes for the second part of DOA Little Slime Goes A Long Way pt.1\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t37.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo just west of here around |cffbbbbbb(37, 59)|r and kill the Jaedenar for |cffffd100Forces of Jaedenar|r You don’t have to go in the caves.\nC\t\t5155\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t51.0\t82.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t5155\t\nA\t\t5157\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tInside the house turn in |cffffd100The Corruption of the Jadefire|r accept |cffffd100Further Corruption|r\nT\t\t4421\t\nA\t\t4906\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t35.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back up to Jaedenar to the green pool at |cffbbbbbb(35, 59)|r and fill the canteen for |cffffd100Collection of the Corrupt Water|r\nC\t\t5157\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t51.0\t82.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t5157\t\nA\t\t5158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t42.0\t20.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(42, 20)|r and kill Entropic beasts and horrors and explore the craters for |cffffd100Verifying the Corruption|r.\nC\t\t5156\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t46.0\t14.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(46, 14)|r and follow it to the back, killing the demons for |cffffd100Further Corruption|r When you kill Xavaric he'll drop Flute of Xavaric which starts |cffffd100Flute of Xavaric|r kill the satyr’s to complete this.\nC\t\t4906\t\t\nA\t\t939\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t55.0\t17.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun over to Irontree Cavern at |cffbbbbbb(55, 17)|r and kill 15 of the elementals and that should be enough for |cffffd100Cleansing Felwood|r\nC\t\t4101\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up and get the FP\nG\t\tFelwood\t62.0\t24.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(62, 24)|r and get the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t64.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo north to 64,8 and turn in |cffffd100Speak to Nefian|r accept |cffffd100Deadwood of the North|r\nA\t\t6221\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now fall off the cliff to the west and start killing for...\nI\t\tNow fall off the cliff to the west and start killing for Deadwood of the North once you’re done you want to kill until you’re 150 rep from the next rank with the timbermaw (put the rep as an xp bar for ease)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t64.0\t8.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back to 64,8 and turn in |cffffd100Deadwood of the North|r and you should be unfriendly now and not aggro’d any longer. Accept |cffffd100Speak to Salfa|r and turn in any 5 sets of feathers for extra rep and 550 xp\nT\t\t6221\t\nA\t\t8465\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t27.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo through the cave to Winterspring and just outside the cave to the right at |cffbbbbbb(27, 34)|r turn in |cffffd100Speak to Salfa|r\nT\t\t8465\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t31.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t980\t\nA\t\t4842\t\nT\t\t3908\t\nA\t\t3909\t\nA\t\t5082\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run back throug the cave and go west at the fork into Moonglade\nI\t\tRun back throug the cave and go west at the fork into Moonglade.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and grab the FP\nG\t\tMoonglade\t48.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(48, 67)|r and grab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be very close leveling now\nI\t\tYou should be very close leveling now. You can grind the rest of the way. Hearth to Astranaar and fly to Feralas\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t3785\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo in the Inn, accept |cffffd100Jonespyre's Request|r\nT\t\t3785\t\nA\t\t3787\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t3787\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo up to the top of the tower, turn it in, accept |cffffd100The Mystery of Morrowgrain|r turn it back in unless you’re still making the stuff.\nT\t\t3787\t\nA\t\t3791\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up and buy a bait and read on how to get the videre elixir\nG\t\tFeralas\t45.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(45, 25)|r and buy a bait and read on how to get the videre elixir\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=At you can be put up to the top of the colossal tower and...\nG\t\tFeralas\t45.0\t16.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAt |cffbbbbbb(45, 16)|r you can be put up to the top of the colossal tower and parachute down. Just make sure you unmount!\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up and place the bait on the ground go loot an everroot\nG\t\tFeralas\t44.0\t10.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(44, 10)|r and place the bait on the ground go loot an everroot\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go back south to get your 3 videre elixir\nG\t\tFeralas\t45.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back south to |cffbbbbbb(45, 25)|r to get your 3 videre elixir\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Astranaar\nI\t\tHearth to Astranaar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t54.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun back up into Felwood to |cffbbbbbb(54, 86)|r and turn in |cffffd100Cleansing Felwood|r\nT\t\t4101\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Now she allows you to get stuff for some neat potions that are...\nI\t\tNow she allows you to get stuff for some neat potions that are on different cooldowns than potions are.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFelwood\t51.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to |cffbbbbbb(51, 81)|r and in the house turn in |cffffd100Further Corruption|r and |cffffd100Flute of Xavaric|r accept |cffffd100Felbound Ancients|r\nT\t\t4906\t\nT\t\t939\t\nA\t\t4441\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tUnder the tent, turn in |cffffd100Verifying the Corruption|r\nT\t\t5156\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run up\nG\t\tFelwood\t62.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to |cffbbbbbb(62, 23)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo through the cave to Winterfall and just outside the cave accept |cffffd100Winterfall Activity|r\nA\t\t6241\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t31.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3909\t\nA\t\t3912\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and grab the FP\nG\t\tWinterspring\t62.0\t36.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(62, 36)|r and grab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Rachet\nI\t\tFly to Rachet\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun west of the dock and turn in |cffffd100Volcanic Activity|r\nT\t\t4502\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t65.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun down to |cffbbbbbb(65, 43)|r and turn in |cffffd100Seeking Spiritual Aid|r accept Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood\nT\t\t5158\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Theramore and sail to Menethil fly to IF\nI\t\tFly to Theramore and sail to Menethil fly to IF\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tJust outside the Military Ward there should be a wandering npc, one is near FP too, grab the quest |cffffd100The New Frontier pt.1|r\nA\t\t1015\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t75.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4512\t\nA\t\t4513\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t31.0\t4.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3461\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Menethil sail to Theramore and fly to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tFly to Menethil sail to Theramore and fly to Gadgetzan"