    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get your mithril casing out of your bank or mailbox\nI\t\tGet your mithril casing out of your bank or mailbox\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go east to the GY and drink your videre elixir\nG\t\tTanaris\t54.0\t28.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo east to the GY at |cffbbbbbb(54, 28)|r and drink your videre elixir\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t53.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow you’re gonna die, don’t rez just release and run north to |cffbbbbbb(53, 23)|r and turn in |cffffd100Meet at the Grave|r accept |cffffd100A Grave Situation|r\nT\t\t3912\t\nA\t\t3913\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t54.0\t28.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo back and rez at |cffbbbbbb(54, 28)|r and touch the only tombstone there, turn in |cffffd100A Grave Situation|r accept |cffffd100Linken's Sword|r\nT\t\t3913\t\nA\t\t3914\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run into Un’Goro, I’d say fly but we have to go way SE\nI\t\tRun into Un’Goro, I’d say fly but we have to go way SE\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t4301\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Keep collecting dirt here if you need more morrowgrain\nI\t\tKeep collecting dirt here if you need more morrowgrain\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t37.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tNow all around the crater is slimes but you can find all the ones you need west of the volcano around |cffbbbbbb(37, 37)|r for |cffffd100A Little Slime Goes A Long Way pt.2|r I think there are more on the west side of the volcano but you can look on both sides they’re scattered. If it says they’re cloning, finish them very fast or stun them. If they clone it’s a full health mob that you can’t scoop up.\nC\t\t4513\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t64.0\t16.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(64, 16)|r and go to the right, when you see A-Me 01 accept |cffffd100Chasing A-Me 01 pt.1|r and turn it back in. Fall over the edge and to the right and up around until you see U’cha for |cffffd100The Mighty U'cha|r\nA\t\t4243\t\nC\t\t4301\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun back to the front and go right again and accept |cffffd100Chasing A-Me 01 pt.2|r now escort her out\nA\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t46.0\t13.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tEscort A-Me to Marshal’s at |cffbbbbbb(46, 13)|r and turn in |cffffd100Chasing A-Me 01 pt.2|r\nT\t\t4244\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo into Marshal’s and turn in |cffffd100Linken's Sword|r accept |cffffd100A Gnome's Assistance|r\nT\t\t3914\t\nA\t\t3941\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the back of the cave and turn in |cffffd100A Gnome's Assistance|r and accept |cffffd100Linken’s Memory|r\nT\t\t3941\t\nA\t\t3942\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run down and let the tar monsters kill you so you’re closer to...\nI\t\tRun down and let the tar monsters kill you so you’re closer to the SE\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tUn'Goro Crater\t71.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4301\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be over half way to level 55 now\nI\t\tYou should be over half way to level 55 now\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Astranaar and fly to Darnassus\nI\t\tHearth back to Astranaar and fly to Darnassus\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDarnassus\t39.0\t84.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo in the Temple of the Moon at |cffbbbbbb(39, 84)|r and fill the vial for |cffffd100Felbound Ancients|r\nC\t\t4441\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run into Felwood\nI\t\tRun into Felwood" },
