n that in, accept |cffffd100Rabine Saturna|r\nT\t\t1015\t\nA\t\t6761\t\nA\t\t6762\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tMoonglade\t51.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Moonglade to |cffbbbbbb(51, 45)|r and turn in |cffffd100Rabine Saturna|r accept |cffffd100Wasteland|r\nT\t\t6762\t\nA\t\t1124\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Auberdine, sail to Menethil and fly to IF, make it your...\nI\t\tFly to Auberdine, sail to Menethil and fly to IF, make it your home. Make sure you have your black dragonflight molt\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t75.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4513\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t38.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(38, 55)|r in the throne room and accept |cffffd100The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan pt.1|r click on her and listen to the story and turn it back in, accept |cffffd100The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan pt.2|r\nA\t\t3702\t\nA\t\t3701\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn front of the FP accept |cffffd100Taking Back Silithus|r\nA\t\t8275\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Lakeshire\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run north to 46,6 and enter the Burning Steppes\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t46.0\t6.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun north to 46,6 and enter the Burning Steppes" },
