    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go and follow the path up and grab the FP\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t83.0\t63.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(83, 63)|r and follow the path up and grab the FP\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Extinguish the Firegut|r and |cffffd100FIFTY! YEP!|r\nA\t\t3823\t\nA\t\t4283\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn front of the broken house, accept |cffffd100Dragonkin Menace|r This is the start of the Onyxia key chain\nA\t\t4182\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t81.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tStart killing ogres all over the mountain at |cffbbbbbb(81, 42)|r for |cffffd100Extinguish the Firegut|r then run back to |cffbbbbbb(84, 68)|r and turn it in, accept |cffffd100Gor'tesh the Brute Lord|r\nC\t\t3823\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3823\t\nA\t\t3824\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t66.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo NW to around |cffbbbbbb(66, 40)|r and collect the ruins that look like tombstones for |cffffd100The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan pt.2|r\nC\t\t3701\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.0\t24.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to |cffbbbbbb(65, 24)|r and go in the cave, turn in |cffffd100Yuka Screwspigot|r SKIP the rest\nT\t\t4324\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t4296\t\nA\t\t4726\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t54.0\t40.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(54, 40)|r and touch the dwarf statue for |cffffd100Tablet of the Seven|r\nC\t\t4296\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t43.0\t46.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo west to |cffbbbbbb(43, 46)|r to blackrock stronghold or south to |cffbbbbbb(49, 55)|r the pillar of ash and kill the orcs for |cffffd100FIFTY! YEP!|r they drop in large amounts\nC\t\t4283\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t40.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tWhile in the pillar of ash at |cffbbbbbb(40, 56)|r you should kill Gor’tesh for |cffffd100Gor'tesh the Brute Lord|r\nC\t\t3824\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGet a group if you can for |cffffd100Dragonkin Menace|r and then kill the mobs for it just NE of the camp along the east wall. It’s soloable but cutting it Also get 8 of the broodlings for |cffffd100Broodling Essence|r by using the device on them before you attack them.\nC\t\t4182\t\t\nC\t\t4726\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t3481\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t94.0\t31.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the cave at |cffbbbbbb(94, 31)|r and accept |cffffd100A Taste of Flame|r give him the molt and hand the quest back in. SKIP the next part\nT\t\t3481\t\nA\t\t4022\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t4296\t\nT\t\t4726\t\nA\t\t4808\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t84.0\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRide back to |cffbbbbbb(84, 68)|r and next to the griffin turn in |cffffd100FIFTY! YEP!|r and |cffffd100Gor'tesh the Brute Lord|r accept |cffffd100Ogre Head On A Stick = Party|r\nT\t\t4283\t\nT\t\t3824\t\nA\t\t3825\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tIn front of the broken house, turn in |cffffd100Dragonkin Menace|r accept |cffffd100The True Masters pt.1|r\nT\t\t4182\t\nA\t\t4183\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t80.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to the top of the mountin at |cffbbbbbb(80, 45)|r and click the soft dirt pile for |cffffd100Ogre Head On A Stick = Party|r then run back to |cffbbbbbb(84, 68)|r and turn it in\nC\t\t3825\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3825\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t29.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Lakeshire and run to the town hall at |cffbbbbbb(29, 44)|r and turn in |cffffd100The True Masters pt.1|r accept |cffffd100The True Masters pt.2|r\nT\t\t4183\t\nA\t\t4184\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to SW\nI\t\tFly to SW\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStormwind City\t78.0\t18.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to |cffbbbbbb(78, 18)|r into the SW keep and turn in |cffffd100The True Masters pt.2|r accept |cffffd100The True Masters pt.3|r talk to the lady and\nT\t\t4184\t\nA\t\t4185\t\nA\t\t4186\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tRedridge Mountains\t29.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly back to Lakeshire and go to the townhall at |cffbbbbbb(29, 44)|r and turn in |cffffd100The True Masters pt.4|r accept |cffffd100The True Masters pt.5|r\nT\t\t4186\t\nA\t\t4223\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to the Burning Steppes and turn in |cffffd100The True Masters pt.5|r when you land and accept |cffffd100The True Masters pt.6|r\nT\t\t4223\t\nA\t\t4224\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t64.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun up to |cffbbbbbb(64, 23)|r and listen to ragged john run back to |cffbbbbbb(84, 68)|r and turn in |cffffd100The True Masters pt.6|r I SKIP the next part, do it later if you’re worried about speed leveling. That was an easy 30k xp for doing nothing and your ony key chain is started.\nT\t\t4224\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should be about 10k from level 56, go grind until 5k on the...\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t49.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tYou should be about 10k from level 56, go grind until 5k on the orcs at |cffbbbbbb(49, 55)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to IF\nI\t\tHearth to IF\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tIronforge\t38.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the throne room at |cffbbbbbb(38, 55)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan pt.2|r\nT\t\t3701\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=You should now be level 56, get new skills\nI\t\tYou should now be level 56, get new skills\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Menethil and sail to Theramore\nI\t\tFly to Menethil and sail to Theramore\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan" },
