    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the NW side of town and scare sprinkle for |cffffd100Are We There, Yeti? pt.3|r\nC\t\t5163\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Gadgetzan your home\nI\t\tMake Gadgetzan your home\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=To the south of lost rigger cove is a bunch of stones in a...\nG\t\tTanaris\t70.0\t49.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTo the south of lost rigger cove at |cffbbbbbb(70, 49)|r is a bunch of stones in a circle, Loot the stuff from the blue backpack and use the book to summon Aquementas. He’s a level 54 water elemental\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Gadgetzan or die if it’s not up yet\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan or die if it’s not up yet.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Un’goro\nI\t\tFly to Un’goro\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFind Quixxil and scare him for |cffffd100Are We There, Yeti? pt.3|r\nC\t\t5163\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the back of the cave and turn in |cffffd100Aquementas|r accept |cffffd100Linken's Adventure|r and turn it in just outside the cave by the big tree SKIP the next part\nT\t\t4005\t\nA\t\t3961\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Silithus\nI\t\tFly to Silithus" },
