    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to CT\nI\t\tFly to CT.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3261\t\nA\t\t882\t\nA\t\t1130\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make CT your home\nI\t\tMake CT your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I give bloodshards to the gnoll in the cage to get increased...\nI\t\tI give bloodshards to the gnoll in the cage to get increased agility/spirit.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t45.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun south and keep an eye out for the mob named |cff00ff25Owatanka|r around |cffbbbbbb(45, 62)|r, he drops 'Owatanka's Tailspike' which starts |cffffd100Owatanka|r\nA\t\t884\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t44.0\t71.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Egg Hunt|r |cffbbbbbb(44, 71)|r\nC\t\t868\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Chen's Empty Keg|r (if you have it)\nC\t\t822\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t43.0\t79.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Betrayal from Within|r and |cffffd100Weapons of Choice|r |cffbbbbbb(43, 79)|r\nC\t\t879\t\t\nC\t\t893\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t46.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Gann Stonespire|r.\nA\t\t843\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t46.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do it at |cffbbbbbb(46, 86)|r.\nT\t\t843\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t46.0\t86.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t846\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Camp Taurajo, turn in |cffffd100Weapons of Choice|r and |cffffd100Betrayal from Within|r ...\nT\t\t893\t\nT\t\t879\t\nA\t\t879\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to XR\nI\t\tFly to XR.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t879\t\nT\t\t868\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t60.0\t32.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Ishamuhale|r at |cffbbbbbb(60, 32)|r\nC\t\t882\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nC\t\t1094\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t63.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Further Instructions|r at Ratchet |cffbbbbbb(63, 37)|r ...\nT\t\t1094\t\nT\t\t1095\t\nA\t\t1095\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1069\t\nT\t\t822\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Stonetalon Mountains\nI\t\tFly to Stonetalon Mountains..." },
