    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept all quests at Sun Rock Retreat (which include: |cffffd100Cenarius' Legacy|r |cffffd100Cycle of Rebirth|r and |cffffd100Harpies Threaten|r )...\nA\t\t1087\t\nA\t\t6301\t\nA\t\t6282\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Sun Rock Retreat your home\nI\t\tMake Sun Rock Retreat your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tI SKIP |cff00ff25Earthen Arise|r (accept |cffffd100Elemental War|r there though)\nT\t\t6421\t\nA\t\t6393\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t48.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Cycle of Rebirth|r, pick up the seeds around |cffbbbbbb(48, 41)|r\nC\t\t6301\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t35.0\t14.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Cenarius' Legacy|r, done at around |cffbbbbbb(35, 14)|r\nC\t\t1087\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t45.0\t27.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Jin'Zil's Forest Magic|r, the mobs are around the path at |cffbbbbbb(45, 27)|r, and the area at |cffbbbbbb(34, 14)|r\nC\t\t1058\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Sun Rock Retreat and turn in |cffffd100Cycle of Rebirth|r ...\nT\t\t6301\t\nA\t\t6381\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1087\t\nA\t\t1088\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1094\t\nA\t\t1096\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t64.0\t41.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle|r at |cffbbbbbb(64, 41)|r and |cffffd100Shredding Machines|r (kill |cff00ff25XT:4|r and |cff00ff25XT:9|r)\nC\t\t1096\t\t\nC\t\t1068\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t58.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffbbbbbb(58, 62)|r. If you couldn't do Arachnophobia, do it now!\nT\t\t1096\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t74.0\t97.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t1058\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t35.0\t27.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Shredding Machines|r in the Barrens at |cffbbbbbb(35, 27)|r\nT\t\t1068\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Sun Rock Retreat and turn in |cffffd100Arachnophobia|r if you just did it.\nT\t\t6284\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Stock back up on food/water\nI\t\tStock back up on food/water.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStonetalon Mountains\t32.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Harpies Threaten|r along with |cffffd100Elemental War|r and |cffffd100New Life|r at the Charred Vale, |cffbbbbbb(32, 67)|r\nC\t\t6282\t\t\nC\t\t6393\t\t\nC\t\t6381\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once they are all done, make sure you are at least 5 bars away...\nI\t\tOnce they are all done, make sure you are at least 5 bars away from level 25, so you may have to grind a little.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t5881\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to CT\nI\t\tThen fly to CT..." },
  { name = "25-25 Southern Barrens (Horde)", title = "25-25 Southern Barrens", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Horde", lo = 25, hi = 25, next = "25-26 Thousand Needles (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t882\t\nA\t\t907\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make CT your home\nI\t\tMake CT your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100A New Ore Sample|r (need to be lvl 25 to get this)\nA\t\t1153\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go down and do\nI\t\tGo down and do:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Enraged Thunder Lizards|r\nC\t\t907\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tYou should find the mob |cff00ff25Washte Pawne|r, he drops 'Washte Pawne Feather' which starts |cffffd100Washte Pawne|r\nA\t\t885\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t47.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Revenge of Gann|r at |cffbbbbbb(47, 85)|r Once done, Turn it in, accept the next part...\nC\t\t846\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t846\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t46.0\t85.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Revenge of Gann|r Part 3 at |cffbbbbbb(46, 85)|r, then turn it in.\nC\t\t846\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThe Barrens\t44.0\t91.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead south down the path to the Great Lift |cffbbbbbb(44, 91)|r,and turn in |cffffd100Calling in the Reserves|r\nT\t\t5881\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t4542\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run to Freewind Post\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t45.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun to Freewind Post... |cffbbbbbb(45, 50)|r in Thousand Needles" },
  { name = "25-26 Thousand Needles (Horde)", title = "25-26 Thousand Needles", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Horde", lo = 25, hi = 26, next = "26-27 Ashenvale (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4542\t\nA\t\t4841\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t5147\t\nA\t\t4821\t\nA\t\t4767\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get FP there\nI\t\tGet FP there.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go do (in the following order)\nI\t\tGo do (in the following order):\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Pacify the Centaur|r (mobs are just north)\nC\t\t4841\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t52.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Test of Faith|r, the cave at |cffbbbbbb(52, 43)|r\nC\t\t1149\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100A New Ore Sample|r (if you can't find the drop, just skip it for now)\nC\t\t1153\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t52.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Alien Egg|r, it has 4 possible spawn points, around: |cffbbbbbb(52, 56)|r / |cffbbbbbb(45, 63)|r / |cffbbbbbb(41, 60)|r / |cffbbbbbb(50, 56)|r, and there might be more, just check around those areas.)\nC\t\t4821\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If you're not level 26 (or two bars away from it), grind till...\nI\t\tIf you're not level 26 (or two bars away from it), grind till you are.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go up to Freewind Post\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t45.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo up to Freewind Post |cffbbbbbb(45, 50)|r..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4841\t\nA\t\t5064\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4821\t\nA\t\t4865\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Camp Taurajo\nI\t\tHearth to Camp Taurajo.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t907\t\nT\t\t885\t\nA\t\t913\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1153\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Cry of the Thunderhawk|r then turn it in ... I SKIP |cff00ff25Mahren Skyseer|r\nC\t\t913\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t913\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Thunder Bluff to get new spells/abilities\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff to get new spells/abilities.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t61.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Melor Sends Word|r, |cffbbbbbb(61, 80)|r on the Hunter Rise...\nT\t\t1130\t\nA\t\t1131\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t55.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t1195\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Splintertree Post, Ashenvale\nI\t\tFly to Splintertree Post, Ashenvale..." },
  { name = "26-27 Ashenvale (Horde)", title = "26-27 Ashenvale", group = "VanillaGuide 20-40", faction = "Horde", lo = 26, hi = 27, next = "27-27 Stonetalon Mountains (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make it your home\nI\t\tMake it your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Do the following order\nI\t\tDo the following order:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t71.0\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept all the quests, which include: |cffffd100Stonetalon Standstill|r |cffffd100Satyr Horns|r |cffffd100Ashenvale Outrunners|r (accept this at |cffbbbbbb(71, 68)|r). Make sure |cffffd100The Ashenvale Hunt|r is turned in at |cff00ff25Senani Thunderheart|r (you can accept this quest right at the NPC itself). Note: I SKIP |cff00ff25Warsong Supplies|r and |cff00ff25The Lost Pages|r\nA\t\t25\t\nA\t\t6441\t\nA\t\t6503\t\nA\t\t6383\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Kill the first of the three mobs related to the Ashenvale hunt\nI\t\tKill the first of the three mobs related to the Ashenvale hunt:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t74.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Sharptalon's Claw|r, Kill |cff00ff25Sharptalon|r who patrols around |cffbbbbbb(74, 70)|r, he drops the item that starts this quest. Hint: easy way to kill it (he's lvl 31 mob), is to kite him into the guards at Splintertree Post.\nC\t\t2\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t71.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo: |cffffd100Ashenvale Outrunners|r, around |cffbbbbbb(71, 72)|r. Once the quest is completed, turn it in when you get the chance.\nC\t\t6503\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t68.0\t75.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen go slightly west and do |cffffd100Torek's Assault|r at |cffbbbbbb(68, 75)|r\nC\t\t6544\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t53.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen go do |cffffd100Stonetalon Standstill|r at the lake at |cffbbbbbb(53, 70)|r. Find and kill |cff00ff25Tideress|r he drops an item which starts: |cffffd100The Befouled Element|r\nC\t\t25\t\t\nA\t\t1918\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t42.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Ursangous|r, around |cffbbbbbb(42, 67)|r for |cffffd100Ursangous's Paw|r (Ashenvale hunt)\nC\t\t23\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t56.0\t54.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Shadumbra|r, around |cffbbbbbb(56, 54)|r for |cffffd100Shadumbra's Head|r (Ashenvale hunt)\nC\t\t24\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t60.0\t72.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100The sacred Flame|r: First find a phial killing the dryads at |cffbbbbbb(61, 52)|r, then fill it at the moonwell at |cffbbbbbb(60, 72)|r\nC\t\t1195\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth to Splintertree Post to turn in |cffffd100Stonetalon Standstill|r |cffffd100The Befouled Element|r (accept |cffffd100Je'neu of the Earthen Ring|r ) |cffffd100Torek's Assault|r and all three of the 'Ashenvale Hunt' quests\nT\t\t25\t\nT\t\t1918\t\nA\t\t824\t\nT\t\t6544\t\nT\t\t247\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to Zoram Strand, and turn in |cffffd100Je'neu of the Earthen Ring|r\nT\t\t824\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept and do |cffffd100Vorsha the Lasher|r . Once done go back and turn it in.\nC\t\t6641\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t6641\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t34.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAccept and do: |cffffd100Between a Rock and a Thistlefur|r |cffbbbbbb(34, 37)|r and |cffffd100Troll Charm|r at the cave at |cffbbbbbb(38, 30)|r. |cffff6060NOTE:|r While you are in the cave, there is an escort quest (a white bear-formed druid in a cage) called |cffffd100Freedom to Ruul|r , try to do this quest, you may have to fight 3-5 mobs at once several times, if you fail then it can be skipped.\nC\t\t216\t\t\nC\t\t6462\t\t\nC\t\t6482\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOnce they are both completed, go turn in |cffffd100Between a Rock and a Thistlefur|r and |cffffd100Troll Charm|r (back at the Zoram Strand)\nT\t\t216\t\nT\t\t6462\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Splintertree Post. Turn in |cffffd100Freedom to Ruul|r (if you did it)\nT\t\t6482\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If im not level 27 i'll grind till I am\nI\t\tIf im not level 27 i'll grind till I am.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t61.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Ordanus|r |cffbbbbbb(61, 52)|r (|cffff6060fight your way to him, just kill the guy, grab his head and jump out of there!|r)\nC\t\t1088\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAshenvale\t67.0\t53.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Satyr Horns|r, done at the Night Run, |cffbbbbbb(67, 53)|r (entrance to the area is around |cffbbbbbb(64, 42)|r).\nC\t\t6441\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tRun back to Splintertree Post (don't hearth).\nT\t\t6441\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Stonetalon Mountains\nI\t\tFly to Stonetalon Mountains..." },
