    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t573\t\nA\t\t598\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to Booty Bay, and accept all quests, |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers|r, |cffffd100Up to Snuff|r, |cffffd100Fool's Stout|r, |cffffd100Akiris by the Bundle|r, |cffffd100Voodoo Dues|r, |cffffd100Stoley's Debt|r, |cffffd100Stranglethorn Fever|r and |cffffd100Keep An Eye Out|r\nA\t\t604\t\nA\t\t587\t\nA\t\t1127\t\nA\t\t617\t\nA\t\t609\t\nA\t\t2872\t\nA\t\t348\t\nA\t\t576\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Dream Dust in the Swamp|r, make Booty Bay your home.\nT\t\t1116\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t31.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers|r along with |cffffd100Up to Snuff|r and |cffffd100Keep An Eye Out|r These are done at the shore around |cffbbbbbb(31, 80)|r, and some more mobs can be found at |cffbbbbbb(27, 70)|r.\nC\t\t604\t\t\nC\t\t587\t\t\nC\t\t576\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t34.0\t60.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tAlso do |cffffd100Stranglethorn Fever|r, you will need 10x |cfffca742[Gorilla Fang]|r, and the |cff00ff25Witch Doctor|r is in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(34, 60)|r\nC\t\t348\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t25.0\t63.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Mok'thardin's Enchantment pt.4|r along with |cffffd100Akiris by the Bundle|r |cffbbbbbb(25, 63)|r\nC\t\t573\t\t\nC\t\t617\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t34.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Fool's Stout|r along with |cffffd100Voodoo Dues|r |cffbbbbbb(34, 52)|r and |cffbbbbbb(39, 58)|r\nC\t\t1127\t\t\nC\t\t609\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t46.0\t42.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Skullsplitter Tusks|r along with |cffffd100Split Bone Necklace|r at |cffbbbbbb(46, 42)|r. Skip |cffffd100Split Bone Necklace|r if you get to 43 before getting all.\nC\t\t209\t\t\nC\t\t598\t\t\nC\t\t598\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If not at least 2-3 bars away from 43, keep grinding til you...\nI\t\tIf not at least 2-3 bars away from 43, keep grinding til you are hearth to Booty Bay.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in ALL quests and make sure to accept |cffffd100Tran'Rek|r and |cffffd100Rumors for Kravel|r from |cff00ff25Krazek|r, and |cffffd100Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog|r from |cff00ff25Whiskey Slim|r.\nA\t\t2864\t\nA\t\t1117\t\nA\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tFly to Grom'gol and turn in |cffffd100Mok'thardin's Enchantment pt.4|r and |cffffd100Split Bone Necklace|r.\nT\t\t573\t\nT\t\t598\t\nA\t\t2932\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on the zeppelin to Orgrimmar\nI\t\tGet on the zeppelin to Orgrimmar\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tOrgrimmar\t75.0\t34.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t2981\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tThunder Bluff\t61.0\t81.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFly to Thunder Bluff, get |cfffca742[Frostmaw's Mane]|r from the bank if you put it there\nT\t\t1136\t\nA\t\t1205\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Desolace\nI\t\tFly to Desolace." },
