    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go into Gadgetzan, make it your home\nI\t\tGo into Gadgetzan, make it your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept: |cffffd100WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting|r and |cffffd100WANTED: Andre Firebeard|r from the |cfffca742Wanted! Poster|r.\nA\t\t2781\t\nA\t\t2875\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t2864\t\nA\t\t992\t\nA\t\t1690\t\nA\t\t1707\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t53.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the Shimmering Flats in Thousand Needles, at |cffbbbbbb(78, 77)|r and turn in |cffffd100Rumors for Kravel|r, |cffffd100News for Fizzle|r and |cffffd100Razzeric's Tweaking|r, accept |cffffd100Safety First|r.\nT\t\t1117\t\nT\t\t1137\t\nT\t\t1187\t\nA\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t1190\t\nT\t\t1190\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t1194\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Kravel Koalbeard|r and |cff00ff25Pozzik|r.\nA\t\t1118\t\nT\t\t1194\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tHearth back to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tSKIPSKIP the next part to this quest.\nT\t\t1189\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Grind your way east to Steamwheedle Port\nG\t\tTanaris\t67.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen grind your way east to Steamwheedle Port at |cffbbbbbb(67, 23)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t8365\t\nA\t\t3520\t\nT\t\t2872\t\nA\t\t2873\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t64.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Wastewander Justice|r along with |cffffd100Water Pouch Bounty|r at |cffbbbbbb(64, 29)|r or |cffbbbbbb(60, 23)|r\nC\t\t1690\t\t\nC\t\t1707\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t72.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen do the following at Lost Rigger Cove |cffbbbbbb(72, 47)|r; |cffffd100Pirate Hats Ahoy!|r, |cffffd100Stoley's Shipment|r and |cffffd100WANTED: Andre Firebeard|r\nC\t\t8365\t\t\nC\t\t2873\t\t\nC\t\t2875\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Ship Schedules|r (find this in one of the |cfffca742Pirate's footlocker|r, looted from mobs at Lost Rigger Cove. If the item cannot be found, just skip it)\nC\t\t2876\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once they're all done, hearth to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tOnce they're all done, hearth to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tSave leftover |cfffca742[Wastewander Water Puch]|r.\nT\t\t1707\t\nT\t\t1690\t\nA\t\t1691\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t38.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Gadgetzan Water Survey|r at |cffbbbbbb(38, 29)|r, grinding mobs along the way. Then go back and turn it in.\nC\t\t992\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t992\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to Steamwheedle Port\nG\t\tTanaris\t67.0\t23.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Steamwheedle Port. |cffbbbbbb(67, 23)|r\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t2873\t\nA\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t59.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen do |cffffd100More Wastewander Justice|r along with |cffffd100WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting|r at |cffbbbbbb(59, 37)|r.\nC\t\t1691\t\t\nC\t\t2781\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan. Put all the |cfffca742[Wastewander Water Pouches]|r you have in the bank, as you will need them for a later quest.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1691\t\nT\t\t2781\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Freewind Post\nI\t\tFly to Freewind Post.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Run west into Feralas\nG\t\tThousand Needles\t8.0\t11.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tRun west into Feralas, |cffbbbbbb(08, 11)|r" },
