nto Hinterlands, don’t fly!\nI\t\tThen ride back into Hinterlands, don’t fly!\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Undamaged Venom Sac|r, turn in |cffffd100The Atal'ai Exile|r, accept |cffffd100Return to Fel'Zerul|r\nC\t\t2934\t\t\nT\t\t1429\t\nA\t\t1444\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=When done, hearth to Tarren Mill\nI\t\tWhen done, hearth to Tarren Mill.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Undamaged Venom Sac|r, SKIP SKIPConsult Master Gadrin Only accept this quest if you still need to get a mount as orc/troll, as you turn it in in the same spot.\nT\t\t2934\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Undercity\nI\t\tFly to Undercity.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t2995\t\nT\t\t2782\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get 15x Silk Cloth from the bank/AH for a later quest\nI\t\tGet 15x |cfffca742[Silk Cloth]|r from the bank/AH for a later quest.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get on the zeppelin to Grom'gol\nI\t\tGet on the zeppelin to Grom'gol." },
