    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t2932\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t28.0\t44.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Raptor Mastery|r, kill |cff00ff25Tethis|r at |cffbbbbbb(28, 44)|r, and go turn it in\nC\t\t197\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t197\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Big Game Hunter|r (Elite), go do it\nA\t\t208\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to Grom'gol fly to Booty Bay\nI\t\tGo to Grom'gol fly to Booty Bay.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t604\t\nA\t\t608\t\nT\t\t580\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Booty Bay your home\nI\t\tMake Booty Bay your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t1118\t\nT\t\t2874\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t33.0\t76.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tFind |cfffca742[Half-Buried Bottle]|r laying around the shore east of Booty Bay |cffbbbbbb(33, 76)|r, until |cfffca742[Carefully Folded Note]|r drop, which starts |cffffd100Message in a Bottle|r\nA\t\t630\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tStranglethorn Vale\t38.0\t80.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo turn |cffffd100Message in a Bottle|r in at |cffbbbbbb(38, 80)|r SKIPSKIP the next part, its a 51 elite.\nT\t\t630\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThen go do |cffffd100The Bloodsail Buccaneers pt.5|r, kill the three pirates in the three ships, while doing it, find |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle|r, it's usually a little scroll downstairs in the middle ship.\nC\t\t608\t\t\nA\t\t624\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Booty Bay, if hearth stone still is on a...\nI\t\tThen hearth back to Booty Bay, if hearth stone still is on a cooldown, die on purpose.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t608\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Kargath (Badlands)\nI\t\tFly to Kargath (Badlands).\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go into Searing Gorge through the passage at COORD[03,62]\nG\t\tBadlands\t3.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into Searing Gorge through the passage at COORD[03,62]." },
