    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo south-east and do |cffffd100Caught!|r, guy in the outhouse |cffbbbbbb(65, 62)|r, then turn it in. Accept |cffffd100Ledger from Tanaris|r, pick up |cfffca742[Goodsteel Ledger]|r just beside the outhouse.\nC\t\t4449\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4449\t\nA\t\t4450\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tKill |cff00ff25Glassweb Spiders|r for the |cffffd100Ledger from Tanaris|r quest.\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t35.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTalk to |cff00ff25Kalaran Windblade|r at |cffbbbbbb(39, 38)|r on your way to Thorium Point |cffbbbbbb(35, 25)|r. Listen to him to do |cffffd100Divine Retribution|r, complete it and get |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r.\nC\t\t3441\t\t\nA\t\t3442\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t35.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to Thorium Point, get the flightpath, and accept |cffffd100What the Flux?|r.\nA\t\t7722\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100What the Flux?|r -the plans are right behind |cff00ff25Overseer Maltorius|r, and |cffffd100The Flawless Flame|r by killing |cff00ff25Heavy War Golem|r and |cff00ff25Blazing/Magma Elemental|r.\nC\t\t7722\t\t\nC\t\t3442\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3442\t\nA\t\t3443\t\nT\t\t7722\t\nA\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Forging the Shaft|r and |cffffd100JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition|r.\nC\t\t3443\t\t\nC\t\t7729\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=If Grimeslit Outhouse Key drops, accept the quest, and go turn...\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t65.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf |cfffca742[Grimeslit Outhouse Key]|r drops, accept the quest, and go turn it in at the outhouse at |cffbbbbbb(65, 62)|r. If you're far from 48, you could grind a while for it.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Forging the Shaft|r, SKIP SKIPThe Flame's Casing, turn in |cffffd100JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition|r.\nT\t\t3443\t\nT\t\t7729\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make sure you have all 20 Solid Crystal Leg Shaft head south...\nG\t\tSearing Gorge\t34.0\t77.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tMake sure you have all 20 |cfffca742[Solid Crystal Leg Shaft]|r head south into Burning Steppes, via Black Rock Mountains |cffbbbbbb(34, 77)|r.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get flightpath there , and fly directly to Stonard (Swamp of...\nG\t\tBurning Steppes\t65.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet flightpath there at |cffbbbbbb(65, 25)|r, and fly directly to Stonard (Swamp of Sorrows)." },
  { name = "48-48 Swamp of Sorrows (Horde)", title = "48-48 Swamp of Sorrows", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 48, hi = 48, next = "48-49 Feralas (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1;title=Do NOT make Stonard your home, it should still be Booty Bay\nI\t\tDo NOT make Stonard your home, it should still be Booty Bay.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t34.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the |cff00ff25Fallen Hero of the Horde|r |cffbbbbbb(34, 66)|r, keep talking to him till you get the quest |cffffd100The Disgraced One|r\nA\t\t2621\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t624\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t22.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen go do |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle|r at |cffbbbbbb(22, 48)|r, under the bridge click |cfffca742[A Soggy Scroll]|r. Accept |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle pt.2|r\nT\t\t624\t\nC\t\t625\t\t\nA\t\t625\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Stonard and turn in |cffffd100The Disgraced One|r and |cffffd100Return to Fel'Zerul|r.\nT\t\t2621\t\nT\t\t1444\t\nA\t\t2622\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo turn in |cffffd100The Missing Orders|r in the inn, accept |cffffd100The Swamp Talker|r\nT\t\t2622\t\nA\t\t2623\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t65.0\t78.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100The Swamp Talker|r in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(65, 78)|r\nC\t\t2623\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t94.0\t50.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen head north east and kill the mob |cff00ff25Jarquia|r at around |cffbbbbbb(94, 50)|r or |cffbbbbbb(92, 65)|r, he drops |cfffca742Goodsteel's Balanced Flameberge|r for the quest |cffffd100Ledger from Tanaris|r\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tSwamp of Sorrows\t34.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo to the |cff00ff25Fallen Hero of the Horde|r |cffbbbbbb(34, 66)|r and turn in |cffffd100The Swamp Talker|r. Accept and do |cffffd100A Tale of Sorrow|r, just talk with him. SKIP SKIPThe Stones That Binds Us.\nT\t\t2623\t\nC\t\t2801\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Booty Bay, and get on the boat to Ratchet\nI\t\tHearth to Booty Bay, and get on the boat to Ratchet.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Brackenwall Village (Dustwallow Marsh)\nI\t\tFly to Brackenwall Village (Dustwallow Marsh).\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t54.0\t55.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tHead south and get the |cfffca742Overdue Package|r for the quest |cffffd100Ledger from Tanaris|r at |cffbbbbbb(54, 55)|r\nC\t\t4450\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tDustwallow Marsh\t32.0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tThen head to Bloodfen Burrow cave |cffbbbbbb(32, 66)|r, and do |cffffd100Cortello's Riddle|r, click the ITEM[Musty Scroll] inside the cave, turn in and accept the next part to it.\nC\t\t626\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Head back to Brackenwall Village fly to Gadgetzan (Tanaris)\nI\t\tHead back to Brackenwall Village fly to Gadgetzan (Tanaris).\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Ledger from Tanaris|r and |cffffd100Into the Field|r, accept and complete |cffffd100Slake that Thirst|r using |cfffca742[Wastewander Water Pouch]|r from your bank. Put the |cfffca742[Power Source]|r in the bank for now.\nT\t\t4450\t\nT\t\t243\t\nC\t\t379\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Camp Mojache (Feralas)\nI\t\tFly to Camp Mojache (Feralas)." },
  { name = "48-49 Feralas (Horde)", title = "48-49 Feralas", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 48, hi = 49, next = "49-50 Tanaris (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tMake Camp Mojache your home. Turn in |cffffd100Testing the Vessel|r, accept |cffffd100Hippogryph Muisek|r, |cffffd100Vengeance on the Northspring|r and |cffffd100Dark Heart|r (Elite).\nT\t\t3123\t\nA\t\t3124\t\nA\t\t3063\t\nA\t\t3062\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t56.0\t63.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Hippogryph Muisek|r at |cffbbbbbb(56, 63)|r\nC\t\t3124\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth back to Camp Mojache, Turn in |cffffd100Hippogryph Muisek|r and accept |cffffd100Faerie Dragon Muisek|r.\nT\t\t3124\t\nA\t\t3125\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t68.0\t48.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Faerie Dragon Muisek|r at |cffbbbbbb(68, 48)|r, turn it in, accept |cffffd100Treant Muisek|r (Elite).\nC\t\t3125\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3125\t\nA\t\t3126\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t57.0\t73.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Treant Muisek|r (Elite) at |cffbbbbbb(57, 73)|r, turn it in, accept |cffffd100Mountain Giant Muisek|r (Elite).\nC\t\t3126\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3126\t\nA\t\t3127\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t45.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nA\t\t7003\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tFeralas\t39.0\t21.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Mountain Giant Muisek|r (Elite) along with |cffffd100Zapped Giants|r at |cffbbbbbb(39, 21)|r. Zap then kill the |cff00ff25Cliff Giants|r, to make them easier to kill.\nC\t\t3127\t\t\nC\t\t7003\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Vengeance on the Northspring|r and |cffffd100Dark Heart|r (Elite).\nC\t\t3063\t\t\nC\t\t3062\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tHearth to Camp Mojache.\nT\t\t7003\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Mountain Giant Muisek|r (Elite), accept |cffffd100Weapons of Spirit|r\nT\t\t3127\t\nA\t\t3129\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3063\t\nT\t\t3062\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t4120\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Gadgetzan (Tanaris)\nI\t\tFly to Gadgetzan (Tanaris)." },
  { name = "49-50 Tanaris (Horde)", title = "49-50 Tanaris", group = "VanillaGuide 40-60", faction = "Horde", lo = 49, hi = 50, next = "50-50 Azshara (Horde)", defaultFor = "", cond = "Horde", vanilla = true,
    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo to the |cfffca742Egg-O-Matic|r Machine in Gadgetzan, and turn in the |cfffca742[Hippogryph Egg]|r for |cffffd100The Super Egg-O-Matic|r.\nC\t\t2741\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Make Gadgetzan your home\nI\t\tMake Gadgetzan your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t82\t\nA\t\t4504\t\nA\t\t3362\t\nA\t\t5863\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3380\t\nA\t\t3444\t\nA\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t40.0\t58.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Dunemaul Compound|r in the area at |cffbbbbbb(40, 58)|r, |cff00ff25Gor'marok|r is in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(41, 57)|r. Look for |cfffca742[Gahz'ridian Ornaments]|r for |cffffd100Gahz'ridian|r while doing these next quests.\nC\t\t5863\t\t\nC\t\t3161\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t34.0\t47.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Noxious Lair Investigation|r at |cffbbbbbb(34, 47)|r.\nC\t\t82\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t28.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Thistleshrub Valley|r along with |cffffd100The Thirsty Goblin|r at |cffbbbbbb(28, 65)|r.\nC\t\t3362\t\t\nC\t\t2605\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t66.0\t25.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100Tooga's Quest|r, escort turtle quest that starts in the Thistleshrub Valley, lead |cff00ff25Tooga|r to |cff00ff25Torta|r at |cffbbbbbb(66, 25)|r.\nC\t\t1560\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Tooga's Quest|r along with |cffffd100Screecher Spirits|r, SKIP SKIPThe Prophecy of Mosh'Aru.\nT\t\t1560\t\nT\t\t3520\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo back to Gadgetzan and turn in |cffffd100The Thirsty Goblin|r, accept |cffffd100In Good Taste|r turn it in, accept |cffffd100Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient|r, turn in |cffffd100Thistleshrub Valley|r, |cffffd100The Dunemaul Compound|r and |cffffd100Noxious Lair Investigation|r, accept |cffffd100The Scrimshank Redemption|r.\nT\t\t2605\t\nA\t\t2606\t\nA\t\t2641\t\nT\t\t3362\t\nT\t\t5863\t\nT\t\t82\t\nA\t\t10\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGet your |cfffca742[Sampling Kit]|r and |cfffca742[Power Source]|r from the bank, accept |cffffd100Tanaris Field Sampling|r from it\nA\t\t654\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t52.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nT\t\t3161\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t53.0\t70.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100The Scrimshank Redemption|r, in the cave at |cffbbbbbb(56, 70)|r The secret for finding the item for this quest is keep making right turns in the cave and it will lead you to it.\nC\t\t10\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tTanaris\t60.0\t64.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tIf the |cfffca742[OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon]|r drops, accept the quest |cffffd100Find OOX-17/TN!|r and tun it in at |cffbbbbbb(60, 64)|r.\nA\t\t351\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth to Gadgetzan\nI\t\tHearth to Gadgetzan.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t654\t\nA\t\t864\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t10\t\nA\t\t110\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t110\t\nA\t\t113\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t113\t\nA\t\t32\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Orgrimmar, and make it your home\nI\t\tFly to Orgrimmar, and make it your home.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Get the Box of Empty Vials out of your Bank\nI\t\tGet the |cfffca742[Box of Empty Vials]|r out of your Bank.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Azshara\nI\t\tFly to Azshara." },
