    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t3504\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo turn in |cffffd100The Hunter's Charm|r, this is a hunter only quest, at |cffbbbbbb(41, 42)|r ...\nT\tHunter\t8151\t\nA\tHunter\t8153\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tAzshara\t52.0\t22.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo accept |cffffd100Kim'jael Indeed!|r at |cffbbbbbb(52, 22)|r on top of the hill\nA\t\t3601\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go do\nI\t\tThen go do:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Courser Antlers|r\nC\tHunter\t8153\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Betrayed|r\nC\t\t3505\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Kim'jael Indeed!|r\nC\t\t3601\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=NOTE: I grind away at bloodelfs for a while doing those 2 quests\nI\t\tNOTE: I grind away at bloodelfs for a while doing those 2 quests.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3601\t\nA\t\t5534\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\tHunter\t8153\t\nA\tHunter\t8231\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go do\nI\t\tThen go do:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Kim'jael's Missing Equipment|r\nC\t\t5534\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Wavethrashing|r\nC\tHunter\t8231\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once both are done, Hearth to Orgrimmar\nI\t\tOnce both are done, Hearth to Orgrimmar.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Azshara\nI\t\tThen Fly to Azshara..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nC\t\t3504\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3504\t\nT\t\t3505\t\nA\t\t3505\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tI SKIP |cff00ff25The Green Drake|r\nT\tHunter\t8231\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5534\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=At this point im usually about 3/4th the way to lvl 54, I grind...\nI\t\tAt this point im usually about 3/4th the way to lvl 54, I grind my way to level 54 on BloodElfs.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I grind bloodelfs, cause their squishy mobs (mobs that have 30%...\nI\t\tI grind bloodelfs, cause their squishy mobs (mobs that have 30% fewer health/armor, than the average mob that level). I used to grind satyrs on previous speed runs, but I was able to cut off almost a whole hour with the blood elfs.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=OPTIONAL: Instead of the grinding you could go do BRD instance...\nI\t\tOPTIONAL: Instead of the grinding you could go do