drops, save it and put it in your bank you will need it later.\nC\t\t5082\t\t\nA\t\t5083\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100Wild Guardians|r (the Ragged Owls are west of Everlook, and the Raging Owls are just north of Everlook)\nC\t\t4521\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t66.0\t29.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Chillwind Horns|r, you can find a larger concentration of chimaera around |cffbbbbbb(66, 29)|r\nC\t\t4809\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t31.0\t45.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tOnce |cffffd100Threat of the Winterfall|r and |cffffd100Winterfall Firewater|r is completed go turn them in along with |cffffd100Strange Sources|r at |cffbbbbbb(31, 45)|r... accept |cffffd100Falling to Corruption|r\nT\t\t5083\t\nC\t\t5082\t\t\nC\t\t5083\t\t\nT\t\t4842\t\nA\t\t5084\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tOnce the rest of those quests are complete, go back to Everlook and turn in |cffffd100Are We There, Yeti?|r ...accept |cffffd100Are We There, Yeti?|r part2. i SKIP |cff00ff25Return to Tinkee|r\nT\t\t3783\t\nA\t\t3783\t\nT\t\t4809\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go do\nI\t\tThen go do:\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t67.0\t37.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Winterfall Activity|r |cffbbbbbb(67, 37)|r\nC\t\t6241\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWinterspring\t66.0\t43.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Are We There, Yeti?|r (find 2 Pristine Yeti Horns) |cffbbbbbb(66, 43)|r\nC\t\t3783\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThen hearth to Everlook and accept |cffffd100A Strange One |r\nA\t\t6605\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t3783\t\nA\t\t3783\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo scare Legacki with the mechanical yeti for the quest |cffffd100Are We There, Yeti?|r part3\nC\t\t3783\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Felwood\nI\t\tThen fly to Felwood..." },
