    steps = "S\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5093\t\nA\t\t5096\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=(make sure you get a Flame in a Bottle first, before doing this...\nI\t\t... (make sure you get a Flame in a Bottle first, before doing this quest, it's in the box)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t6029\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept and complete |cffffd100Argent Dawn Commission|r\nC\t\t5405\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nA\t\t5901\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go into the Western Plaguelands, Felstone field\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t37.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo into the Western Plaguelands, Felstone field at |cffbbbbbb(37, 56)|r and...\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100Better Late Than Never|r (the lady in the house)\nA\t\t5021\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go to the barn next door\nI\t\tThen go to the barn next door, and...\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tComplete |cffffd100Better Late Than Never|r .. click on the chest again to accept |cffffd100Better Late Than Never|r again.\nC\t\t5021\t\t\nA\t\t5021\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t40.0\t51.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Scarlet Diversions|r, burn the tent down, and plant the banner |cffbbbbbb(40, 51)|r\nC\t\t5096\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go back to the Bulwark\nI\t\tGo back to the Bulwark.. (|cffff6060NOTE:|r Make sure you save all |cff00ff25Bone Fragments|r you find, you will need 30 of them for a later |cff00ff25quest|r)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAccept |cffffd100All Along the Watchtowers|r (Elite) and |cffffd100The Scourge Cauldrons|r\nT\t\t5096\t\nA\t\t5098\t\nA\t\t5228\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5228\t\nA\t\t5229\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go complete the whole Cauldron quest chain, you need to kill...\nI\t\tGo complete the whole Cauldron quest chain, you need to kill the Cauldron Lord at each targeted field (listed below), grab their key and use it at the big cauldron in the middle of the field. (Just keep going back and forth from The Bulwark to the next field completing each one, turning them in and accepting and doing the next one)...\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t37.0\t56.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Target: Felstone Field|r |cffbbbbbb(37, 56)|r\nC\t\t5229\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t46.0\t52.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Target: Dalson's Tears|r |cffbbbbbb(46, 52)|r. |cffff6060NOTE:|r While you are here, there is a small quest chain here that starts with a little Diary in the barn |cffbbbbbb(47, 50)|r called |cffffd100Mrs. Dalson's Diary|r , just click that to complete the quest. Now, after you did that, then you need to kill a |cff00ff25Wandering Skeleton|r to get a key that opens the outhouse behind the barn. After you get the key and open the outhouse, it will release a |cff00ff25Farmer Dalson|r, a level 56 undead. Kill him, grab that key, and then run in the house (that is right next to the barn) and go up the stairs, there you will find a cabinet, open the cabinet with that key (For the quest |cffffd100Locked Away|r ) and finally it's over. Easy 10200 XP! Or was it?\nC\t\t5231\t\t\nT\t\t5058\t\nC\t\t5059\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t53.0\t65.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Target: Writhing Haunt|r |cffbbbbbb(53, 65)|r (while you're there accept |cffffd100The Wildlife Suffers Too|r at |cffbbbbbb(53, 64)|r, the almost dead tauren in the hut\nC\t\t5233\t\t\nA\t\t4985\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t62.0\t59.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100Target: Gahrron's Withering|r |cffbbbbbb(62, 59)|r\nC\t\t5235\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Just keep going back and forth completing each one\nI\t\tJust keep going back and forth completing each one.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThen go accept and complete |cffffd100Mission Accomplished!|r\nC\t\t5238\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Head into Eastern Plaguelands\nI\t\tThen head into Eastern Plaguelands..." },
