0\t66.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tDo |cffffd100All Along the Watchtowers|r while working your way to the inn at |cffbbbbbb(39, 66)|r\nC\t\t5098\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t39.0\t68.0\t\t\t\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100A Strange Historian|r at |cff00ff25Chromie|r up stairs in the inn at |cffbbbbbb(39, 68)|r ...\nT\t\t5153\t\nA\t\t5154\t\nA\t\t4971\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go do (while grinding away at mobs)\nI\t\tThen go do (while grinding away at mobs):\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\t|cffffd100All Along the Watchtowers|r (Elite)\nC\t\t5098\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t47.0\t62.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100A Matter of Time|r |cffbbbbbb(47, 62)|r\nC\t\t4971\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nG\t\tWestern Plaguelands\t42.0\t67.0\t\t\t\nI\t\t|cffffd100The Annals of Darrowshire|r the book for this is in the building at |cffbbbbbb(42, 67)|r, the actual Annals of Darrowshire book looks different from the others, it has a lighter tint on the top portion of the pages in the book, unlike the rest which has a darker tint on the top portion of the pages.\nC\t\t5154\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4971\t\nT\t\t5154\t\nA\t\t4972\t\nA\t\t5210\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tGo do |cffffd100Counting Out Time|r then turn it in. (it's repeatable but you only get XP once from it)\nC\t\t4972\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4972\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I keep grinding away at mobs in Andorhal till i'm Friendly with...\nI\t\tI keep grinding away at mobs in Andorhal till i'm Friendly with the Argent Dawn, so im able to buy Enriched Manna Biscuits (which replenish mana faster from drinking). As soon as I hit friendly with AD, I go back to the Bulwark..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5901\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t5098\t\nA\t\t838\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Scholomance|r at the undead guy right next to him ...\nT\t\t838\t\nA\t\t964\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits (which replenishes mana...\nI\t\tStock up on |cff00ff25Enriched Manna Biscuits|r (which replenishes mana faster from drinking)\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tI then go back to Andorhal, and grind all the way to level 58 while doing |cffffd100Skeletal Fragments|r quest.\nC\t\t964\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tAs soon as I hit 58 and |cffffd100Skeletal Fragments|r is done and you also have 30 |cff00ff25Bone Fragments|r (please note, if you are far off from the 30 bone fragments, then you can just skip it), then go back to the Bulwark and turn in |cffffd100Skeletal Fragments|r .. I SKIP |cff00ff25Mold Rhymes With...|r\nC\t\t964\t\t\nT\t\t964\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I turn in any scourge stones, I have\nI\t\tI turn in any scourge stones, I have.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits (about 600? :D)\nI\t\tI stock up on |cff00ff25Enriched Manna Biscuits|r (about 600? :D)\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Go get on the zeppelin to go to Orgrimmar\nI\t\tThen go get on the zeppelin to go to Orgrimmar. (while waiting, make heavy runecloth bandages)\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Once in Orgrimmar i get new spells/abilites\nI\t\tOnce in Orgrimmar i get new spells/abilites.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Bank 2/3rd of my manna biscuits\nI\t\tBank 2/3rd of my manna biscuits.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Winterspring\nI\t\tThen fly to Winterspring..." },
