.\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tThen go down to the Owl Wing Thicket and do |cffffd100Wild Guardians|r part3\nC\t\t4721\t\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I keep grinding away at Owls till im about 59 and a half, then\nI\t\tI keep grinding away at Owls till im about 59 and a half, then...\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I die on purpose, so i end up at Everlook (don’t hearth)\nI\t\tI die on purpose, so i end up at Everlook (don’t hearth)\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Fly to Bloodvenom Post (Felwood)\nI\t\tThen Fly to Bloodvenom Post (Felwood)..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nT\t\t4721\t\nT\t\t4882\t\nA\t\t4882\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I fly to XRs to Thunderbluff, go to Elder Rise\nI\t\tI fly to XRs to Thunderbluff, go to Elder Rise..\nS\t\t\tvg=1\nI\t\tTurn in |cffffd100Guarding Secrets|r part2 and |cffffd100Glyphed Oaken Branch|r (both at Nara Wildmane)\nT\t\t4882\t\nT\t\t4987\t\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=Hearth back to Everlook\nI\t\tHearth back to Everlook.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=At this point im usually about 3/4 way to 60\nI\t\tAt this point im usually about 3/4 way to 60.\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=I go back down to the Owl Wing Thicket and Grind to 60\nI\t\tI go back down to the Owl Wing Thicket and Grind to 60. (See End Game Credits)\nS\t\t\tvg=1;title=CONGRATULATION, you're lvl60 now!\nI\t\tCONGRATULATION, you're lvl60 now!" },
